<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Uown Lawt</para>
  <para style="toc1">Uown Lawt</para>
  <para style="toc2">Uown Lawt</para>
  <para style="mt1">Uown Lawt</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow Mosi chekhai, now arui khin dow 1,440-1,405 <char style="w">BC</char> takra kowi chekhai. Mami bowih dow Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi kowh pre lawmbawr mih chekhai. Mami bowih dow kaah sakowmma mih Israeluüa hai pur prakowi kowh nauang ta uowi kown mih amatni kowh chenchapuüa vüi Mosi ruiah mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa uown lawt mih lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Josef kowng kung kowi Israeluüa mih Aigupta pren kowi 400 ning mowr chang nar lup khai, now 400 ning chi khe dow Aigupta nar hownia nalawtla kownkow Mosi kowi Thurai uang chin pe khai. Aigupta mang mih Thurai kowi kingküa khai rakowi hamüt chap mowr Mosi tüng pe awdara lup khai. Nami kung kowi dow nar hownia Israeluüa lawt khai bowt. Aigupta pren hownia amatni lawt mih ni natukla reng kownkow Takat Pawi mih chowngchowng saksakma Israeluüa sunah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow sata dawnglang iawng Israeluüa mang mih, Sinai hungh kowi kowh hamüt klüng mih ana pek Israeluüa ka mih hai taklowp taklangra te thawp lawnguan kowi arui uowi chekhai. Sinai hungh kowi kowh hamüt klüng mih ana pek klen kowi paw ari aiang hai rirow ahuma aia maru-uüa kowi Thurai peah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Thurai mih tawng iawng chow aia kowi nachupiiaah kown mih hai tawng iawng chow nachowm nauowi kown mih Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla kung kowi aia kowh ari aiang hai rirow hown Israeluüa kowi tüngsangah khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh lang pankri mih lawnguan dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi uang lawtla mih hai Thurai kowh maru iawng hown akeng chenchapuüa hownia Israeluüa kowi lang kloah mih chekhai. Mami bowih hailawm Mosi ruiah mih tanga klüng mih bowih kowi dow ari arow bowih pahai Hebraiuüa tek pe khai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Taklowp taklangra te: Taklowp taklangra te pami dow achük alai kowh Israeluüa kowh Thurai chup kim chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Ephawd: Ephawd pami dow uamow lang kri mih kowh pankrima mih tawnguat chekhai. Nami tawnguat dow athawngma panow bawng uowi dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Owngphowr: Owngphowr pami dow chang uamow lup khe kowh downgprang kowi kowh uamow lang kri mih danla reng mih chekhai. Nami owngphowr dow paklepchow panow tali tingnui kowi leng khuowk rah uowi bowk chekhai, now nami luk kowi dow achalachow panow asung khakma mih hua uowi sum tan chekhai. Atan kowi nami asung khakma mih hua cha uowi tali klüng chi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Cherup: Cherup pami dow mukuang pren kowi kowh Thurai chintak miuüa chekhai. Nami dow maru powm iawng chepaw alap uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Aigupta pren hownia Israel chenchap ka lawngra mih 1:1-15:21</para>
  <para style="io2">Aigupta pren kowi uowi nar mih 1:1-22</para>
  <para style="io2">Mosi dia mih hai chownglawng uown 2:1-4:31</para>
  <para style="io2">Aigupta mang hown Mosi hai Arawn iüah takrum mih 5:1-11:10</para>
  <para style="io2">Takat pawi hai Aigupta pren hownia lawt mih 12:1-15:21</para>
  <para style="io1">Sata Rik hownia Sinai hungh kowi kowpün mih 15:22-18:27</para>
  <para style="io1">Ari arow hai sangbowk laitawm 19:1-24:18</para>
  <para style="io1">Taklowp taklangra te hai uamow kowh arah 25:1-40:38</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Israeluüa prung mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Israel dow achapauüa hown achapauüa kowh kimchak hailawm Aigupta pren kowi kowpowt khai. Israel kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Jakawb chekhai. Naiawngün Jakawb kowh chapauüa ming dow <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Reuben, Simiawn, Levi, Juda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isakar, Zebulun, Benjamin, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dan, Naptali, Gad hai Aser büah chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Josef dow naiawngünuüa dowi rawn Aigupta pren kowi kowrik uowi khai bowt. Jakawb kowh naiawngün krungchakuüa maru iun dow bowkbowk kowi 70 ia chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Now akung kowi dow Josef hown atainau-uüa hai amatni chowng kowi kowh maru-uüa maten kowng khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa dow awr prung ngamlam chekhai; amatni dow maru iun uang hu hanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi krawi tauet büah khai. Amatni dow lainowmma uang kür büah khai, now Aigupta pren kowi atekma uowi büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi Aiguptauüa changah nowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Ning kawmma kung kowi dow Aigupta pren kowi mang sar uang uowi khai iawk; nami mang sar dow Josef lawnguan kowi tawngpaw tawi tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Nami mang tek pe aia maru-uüa mih, “Sünta büa diah, Israeluüa mih a-i lak-e maru iun lang kawm khai bowt, now kür paw a-i lak-e lang kür khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Naiawng rakowi chu, amatni kowh maru iun nahula dowi bowt kownkow <char style="w">prengia</char> hown a-i chang lup diah sik. Naiawng nadowi now tasen khe a-i kowh ransu-uüa hown nacham tawi tabawng büah ün tarawng. Now natawi sen a-i hanow akung kowi dow mami pren hownia napowtta a-i tarawng,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Naiawng rakowi mang Faraw<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Faraw </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Aiguptauüa lai hown mang pami chekhai. Mang maten kowi Aiguptauüa dow Faraw pahai hawah khai.</char></note> dow Israeluüa kowi changah nowng hanow napiakta pe sak kown mih kamrüt khai bowt. Aia hai aia kowh maru iukuüa dow Israeluüa luk kowi tow pe aluchow ne khai, now Israeluüa kowi akratma mih lup pe changah büah khai. Amatni dow nanungla Faraw kowh cha kownkow Israeluüa kowi pe thawpah marow pre buk khai. Nami marow ming dow Pithawm hai Rameses chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi dow changah nowng ngamlam maru iun uang lang hu ngamlam chekhai. Amatni dow pren kowi krawi tauet ngamlam chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Aigupta prenchakuüa mih Israeluüa kowi lainowmma kramah khai. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Amatni dow Israeluüa kowi akratma mih nar lup lang pe changah ngamlam khai. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Amatni dow laih kowi kowh akeng mih lup maten hailawm amia müa thundi hown sakka kam hai <char style="w">ipbawn</char> thawp ün Israeluüa kowi pe changah khai. Naiawngün nar lup pe changah mih khin khe Aigupta maru-uüa mih Israeluüa kowi lainowmma changah anowng apowng khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowh chownglawng dow lainowmma kawmkrat khai.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kachakuüa chah kowi saita kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Israel masiuüa hawmh kowh dow Siphawra hai Puai pape mih penchow kimuowi sara uowi pre ia chekhai. Nami sara pre ia kowi Aigupta mang tek pe mih, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />“Hebrai masiuüa uowi kim mih khin khe enchi cham chang sara now müah iüah kaneu diah. Chah che kachakuüa chekhai hanow bawmta iüa diah, now masiuüa chekhai hanow pe singah iüah taih,” pape khai. <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Nachenganchepaw nami pen sara pre ia dow Thurai kowi ringkaw mih maru chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatchi dow Aigupta mang kowh ana iawng chang dowi kowi kachakuüa chah kowi paw bawmla iüah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Nami khin khe nami pen sara pre ia kowi mang hawah now tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng mih lup enchi tuk chang khai? Tawngplawng kowchow kachakuüa chah kowi enchi bawmla dowi?” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Nakhowk khe Faraw kowi pen sara pre ia tek pe mih, “Hebrai masiuüa dow Aigupta masiuüa iawng nadowi. Hebrai masiuüa hawmh dow kimuowi iama chekhai; amatni dow pen sara kowting dowi rawn rik taklen reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20-21" />Nami pen sara pre ia dow Thurai kowi ringkaw mih maru chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Thurai mih nami pen sara pre ia kowi peah iungra khai. Thurai mih amatchi kowi paw pe kaah chah khai bowt; amatchi kowh chauüa kowi paw <char style="w">krungchak</char> ahuma pe phawah khai. Israeluüa kowh dow maru iun uang hu ngamlam chekhai, now amatni dow uang kür ngamlam büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 1:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Now akung kowi dow aia maru-uüa luk kowi Faraw lawt ana khai. Faraw tek pe mih, “Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kachakuüa chah che uang dia khai hanow nami chah kowi dow Nail aw kowi nakowkuakta kown. Nachenganchepaw masiuüa chah maten kowi dow nape singah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s">Mosi uang dia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Nami khin khe Levi chenchap maru lowk ia dow amatni achen sang mih masiuüa kowi chawngah khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Nami masiuüa dow uang kum nau hanow pen chapa lowk ia khai. Aia kowh chapa dow apawr klangiungma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami ngiachow kowi sum la mowr petah khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Nachenganchepaw nami ngiachow kowi nowng pet dowi bowt mih khin khe dow uaklung kawng hown kowh kawngah mih kruk aia pawah lowk khai, now tui naia kupla dowi kownkow <char style="w">than</char> hown miaah khai. Now nami ngiachow kowi dow nami kruk kowi iüaah khai. Now nami kruk mih Nail aw pang kowi tui dawng kowi kowh uaklung bia kowi kowtowah khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Nami ngiachow tawng chow cham own mih nakrawi mü kownkow atuamow dow nami aw hownia alak sangrumchow re-e iowng khai.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Now kra sangrum kung kowi dow mang chama mih Nail aw kowi uang lu tui khai bowt. Nakhowk khe aia kowh narmauüa dow aw pang kowi krawi len khai. Nami khin khe aia dow uaklung dawng kowi kruk tapowng powlow mih haikhi lowk khai. Now nami kruk nakowpaw kownkow aia mih kowchin narma lowk ia khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />Nami kruk dow aia hoah hanow ngiachow kowi aia khi khai. Nami ngiachow dow kar süklük chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami ngiachow kowi mih lainowmma aia sanaah khai. Aia tek mih, “Mami dow Hebraiuüa kowh chah lowmow,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Nakhowk khe nami ngiachow kowh tuamow mih <char style="w">Faraw</char> kowh chama tut-e uangah now tek pe mih, “Nami ngiachow kowi nathum en kownkow ang uang hawla en Hebrai masiuüa lowk ia tak ü?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Nakhowk khe Faraw kowh chama tek pe mih, “Ow, kowhaw ang madiah,” pakhai. Now nami ngiachow kowh tuamow dow a-u kowi uang hawla pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Nami ngiachow u uang ting khe Faraw kowh chama tek pe mih, “Mami ngiachow kowi thum ang mawm ang diah. En thum ang mih sung ang pe en kown taih,” pakhai. Nami masiuüa dow ngiachow kowi pawla now thumah mawmah khai.<verse eid="EXO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />Nami ngiachow awr iuk sangrum khe dow nami masiuüa mih Faraw kowh chama tut-e kowpawla pe khai. Now mang chama dow nami ngiachow kowi achapa iawng hai hawt pawah khai. Aia tek mih, “Mami kowi dow tui hownia kowh ang uang pawla mih chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi nami ngiachow kowi dow Mosi pahai aia rük pe ming khai.<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Midian pren kowi Mosi kowpowt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Akung kowi Mosi awr iuk awr sown hanow aia chenchapuüa kowi kowmü kownkow kowkowi khai. Nami khin khe aia dow aia chenchapuüa akratma mih lup chang takla mih kowkhi khai. Now Hebrai maru lowk ia kowi Aigupta maru lowk ia bawpah mih paw aia kowkhi khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Nakhowk khe aia dow mapra paipra krawi mü hanow aria aret kowi amia kowi paw khi dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow nami Aigupta maru kowi saita hanow se kowi phumah khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Now auai ni paw aia mih prang kowi plan lawt khai iawk. Nami khin khe dow Hebrai maru pre ia hawt takhüm mih aia kowkhi khai. Now atawi uowi mih kowi aia tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow en tainau kowi en tuk bawp khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Nami maru tek pe mih, “Angching luk kowi aluchow hai nachet tara kown mih alow amia chow pe en? Aigupta maru kowi mani kowh en saita iawng ang kowi paw en saita ang kown en nau mih bow?” pakhai. Mosi dow nami laiklow tata hanow kram khai bowt. Aia dow naiawngün lawnguan maru tukta bowk khowk padow ka tuak khai.<verse eid="EXO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />Faraw mih naiawngün lawnguan tawi tuk hanow Mosi kowi nasaita kownkow kamrüt khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw Mosi dow Faraw hownia ku powt hanow Midian pren kowi kowtowm khai, now aia dow Midian pren kowi kowh tuikuam ria re-e kowchowm phülü khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Nakowi kowh Midian chenchap <char style="w">uamow</char> kowh dow chama uowi 7 ia chekhai. Nami uamow kowh chamauüa mih a-pa kowh tawncher hawmh kowi pe khamah tui kownkow nami tuikuam kowi uang towng tui büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Nachenganchepaw akeng mih tawncher thing miuüa uangah now nami masiuüa hawmh kowi tuikuam hownia uang prütta khai. Nami khita hanow Mosi mih nami masiuüa hawmh kowi kowtawi khowngah khai, now amatni kowh tawncher hawmh kowi pe khamah tui khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />Nami masiuüa hawmh dow a-pa Reuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reuel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Jethraw chekhai.</char></note> tut-e kowplan khai bowt. Nakhowk khe a-pa hawt lüntaah mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow ani dow enni uang lüa mang lai kowbow?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Amatni tek pe mih, “Ani dow akeng mih tawncher thing miuüa rut hownia Aigupta maru lowk ia lawng anging khai. Nami klen kowi tawi towng anging tui hanow anging kowh tawncher hawmh kowi paw pe khamah tui khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Achamauüa kowi a-pa lüntaah mih, “Aia dow tawng kowi chow? Tawngplawng kowchow aia kowi enni towla hüah? Aia kowi uang hawla now pe cha pe khamah diah snow,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Akung kowi Mosi dow nami uamow kim kowi tawi uowi kown mih nauta khai. Nami uamow mih aia kowh chama Zipawr kowi Mosi hown pe tachawngah khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Nami kung kowi Zipawr dow ka chapa lowk ia khai. Now achapa ming dow Gersawn pahai Mosi rük pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia tek mih, “Ang dow akeng pren kowi kowh cham uowi mih chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa prakowi Thurai plan pe ching mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Ning kawmma rawn khowk kung kowi Aigupta mang mih kowng khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowh nar lup chang dow uang lang krat ngamlam chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kar büah sawmlawm khai. Nami kar klow dow Thurai tut-e kowtowm khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Thurai mih Israeluüa kowh kar klow ta hanow Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah tut-e kowh aia towah mih <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm</char> laiklow ka tuak khai. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Aia dow Israeluüa prakowi iu mü khai bowt, now amatni prakowi pe ching khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Mosi kowi Thurai hawah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />Akat khe Mosi mih a-pu Jethraw kowi cham thing pe rua hai ruapur hawmh khai. Jethraw dow Midian pren kowi kowh uamow chekhai. Naiawng aia cham thing rua hai ruapur mih khin khe Mosi mih <char style="w">süngrüp süngkangma</char> paipra pown kowi kowh Sinai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sinai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sinai hungh kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Horeb hungh chekhai.</char></note> pape mih Thurai hungh re-e kowting khai. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Nakowi mih singh plum dawng kowi maih lün pluplup mih hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">kramamu</char> aia tut-e uang tatüng khai. Nami singh plum dow maih lün pluplup chepaw kam dowi mih Mosi khi khai. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Nami khita hanow Mosi ka tuak mih, “Aria kowi kowkowiah hanow nami awdara sia ang kowsam mü matak. Tawngplawng kowchow singh plum kam dowi mih ang kowmü tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />Nakowmü kownkow Mosi haimang mih khin khe nami singh plum hownia CHAKRAMANG Thurai hawah mih, “Mosi, Mosi,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Mosi klangah mih, “Mami re-e chaw ang uowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Hauang tatawn tham bowt. En iowngah mih arah dow chimsaima chekhai. En kowh phanaikhawk klüpta diah. <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Ang dow en pa kowh Thurai; ang dow Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb kowh Thurai chekhai,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe Mosi mih Thurai kowi khi kown kram kowh mumta lumowr khai.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang maru-uüa luk kowi Aigupta maru-uüa changah anowng apowng mih ang khi. Aigupta aluchowuüa changah anowng apowng rakowi Israeluüa kar mih klow ang ta chekhai. Amatni kowh akawm akrat lawnguan mih ang tuk. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />Aigupta maru-uüa rut hownia amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow ang uang dowm mih chowbowt. Amatni kowi mih Aigupta pren hownia nalawtla hanow Kananuüa, Hituüa, Amawruüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa pren kowi ang napawla kown. Naiawngün pren dow aiukma hai klangiungma chekhai. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Israeluüa kowh kar klow mih ang tut-e uang towm khai bowt. Matawng iawng chow amatni kowi Aigupta maru-uüa changah anowng apowng mih paw ang khi khowk. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Naiawng rakowi kawmat mih Faraw tut-e ang kowchin en kown, en mih kowkowi diah. Nakowi kowkowiah hanow ang maru Israeluüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Nachenganchepaw Mosi tek pe mih, “Ang dow tawngpaw nadowi mih maru chowtaih. Tawng iawng chow Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi ang uang nowng lawtla chow?” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Thurai tek pe mih, “Ang natawi uowila en kown taih. Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi en nauang lawtla hanow mami hungh kowi enni nauang chupiia ang kown. Enni uang chupiia ang mih dow ang kowchin en mih chekhai pami amatra naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Thurai mih, “Ang kowkowiah now Israeluüa kowi, ‘Enni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai uang chin ang mih chowbowt,’ pahai ang kowtek pe kown. Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe amatni mih, ‘Aming tawng chow?’ padow nalünta ang büah kown. Nami khin khe amatni kowi tawng iawng chow ang natek pe kown?” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Thurai tek pe Mosi mih, “IAWNGUOWI. Israeluüa kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘IAWNGUOWI pami enni tut-e uang chin ang mih chowbowt,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EXO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">CHAKRAMANG </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami Hebrai lai hown dow YHWH pahai ruiah khai. Nami dow Thurai kowh ming chimsai lai kowh tek kown nau dowi kowh tatek dowi iawng tekah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi YHWH pami takcha ADONAI pahai Hebraiuüa tekah khai. ADONAI pami dow CHAKRAMANG pami chekhai.</char></note>, amatni kowh pipu Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowh Thurai, amatni tut-e uang chin en mih pami paw tek pe diah. Chowngchowng saksakma ang kowh ming dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Chowngchowng saksakma mami ming hown maru natuk ang kown. <verse eid="EXO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />Kowkowiah hanow Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi arasang kowkuaah diah, now amatni pipu Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai uang tatüng en mih tek pe diah. Aigupta pren kowi tawng ngai chow amatni kowi maru changah mih ang khi reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Naiawng rakowi ang takham khowk. Aiguptauüa nowng chang powng changra hownia amatni kowi mih ang nalawtla bowt kown. Now Kananuüa, Hituüa, Amawruüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa pren kowi amatni kowi ang napawla kown. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi chekhai pami tek pe diah.<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“En kowh lai dow Israel aluchowuüa nasünta en kown taih. Now en hai amatni hailawm Aigupta mang tut-e nakowkowi kown. Enni tek pe kown mih, ‘Hebraiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai uang tatüng anging khai. Süngrüp süngkangma kowi sum ni mang rawng mangah hanow anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai vüi tawncher hown nachang <char style="w">phuchua</char> kownkow uang tek anging khai. Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown pe kowi anging diah,’ pape diah. <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Nachenganchepaw mün khowt chow ang kür mih ang tüng pe dowi matchang Aigupta mang mih nape kowi enni kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Naiawng rakowi ang kowh kür hown awdara uowima mih lup ang natüng pe kown. Awdara uowima hown Aigupta pren kowi ang naripah kown, nahanow Faraw mih nalawt enni kown taih. <verse eid="EXO 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />Aigupta maru-uüa kowi mih nasanala enni kown mih saktuak ang napeah kown. Nahanow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt mih khin khe rut khawma hown enni nalawt kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Hebrai masiuüa maten amatni klowkchak Aigupta masiuüa hownia hai naiawngünuüa kim kowi kowh uowi mih akeng chenchap masiuüa hownia nalüla uanh kown. Amatni dow kuh hai tai hown kowh uanh ün, tawnguat ün nalüla kown. Now naiawngün uanh hown enni kowh chauüa kowi enni natawngah kown. Naiawng hown Aiguptauüa kowh uanh mih Israeluüa nakhuowila pe bun kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Mosi kowi Thurai tüng pe amat müa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Mosi tek pe Thurai mih, “Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa mih hawt owm ang dowi tham, now ang laiklow paw nau sünta büah dowi tham. Amatni dow maiawng natek ang kown, ‘En tut-e CHAKRAMANG uang tatüng dowi,’ napa kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En rut kowi kowh nami tawng chow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:2">Mosi tek pe mih, “Mami dow ang kowh raitua taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Nami raitua krawng kowi iu kuakta madiah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:3">Now Mosi iu kuakta hown akrowksang nami raitua dow awr chowng rua khai. Nakhowk khe Mosi dow nami rua hownia alenma powt khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Nami rua mai kowi iu dowk madiah,” pakhai. Now nami rua mai kowi Mosi iu dowk hown krowksang nami rua dow plan chowng raitua khai iawk.<verse eid="EXO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Naiawng hai raitua hown amatni kowi en natüng pe awdara lup kown. Nahanow amatni pipu Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai en tut-e uang tatüng ching pami naowm en büah kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, “En kowh rut downgprang kowi sowrah diah,” pakhai. Now Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng chang khai. Nachenganchepaw aia howkta rut khe dow aia kowh rut kowi par uang phaw khai, nami par dow aia rut kowi <char style="w">nang</char> iawng akawma awr phaw khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En kowh rut mih downgprang kowi plan sowrah iawk diah,” pakhai. Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng aia dow aia kowh rut mih downgprang kowi plan sowrah khai iawk. Now aia howkta khe dow aia kowh rut mih aiawng uowi khe kowh iawng plan iung khai iawk.<verse eid="EXO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Auown khe kowh amatra hown amatni nau owm en dowi chepaw akung kowi kowh amatra hown dow naowm en kown taih. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Nachenganchepaw amatni che nami pre buk mih amatra kowi nau owm dowi hai en laiklow pra paw pe ching dowi kowh chalow now Nail aw hownia tui towngah sangrum now krawng kowi khükah diah. Nami en khükah mih tui mih krawng kowi hawk hown krowksang nachowng vi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi tek taklet lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang dow tawng nam khe paw klangiungma tuk tek lai dowi. En klang ang dowi rawn khe paw ang dow tuk tek lai dowi, now en klang ang kung kowi paw ang dow tuk tek lai dowi chekhai. Ang dow lai tek smumow; tuk tek lai kaneu dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Maru kowh nawr amia chow thawp? Now lai a-ma, param pangma hai mik duma mih ün amia chow changah? Now khi mik miuüa kowi amia chow pe khiah? Naiawngün chang miia ang CHAKRAMANG nadowi bow? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Kawmat mih kowkowi diah. En tek lai mih khin khe ang tawi khowng en kown taih, now tawng ngai chow en natek kown mih paw ang nasang en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Mosi tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang chup en, mami lup nachang kownkow akeng mih maru kowi phai kowchin diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Nami laiklow tata hanow CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi luk kowi kunmarau khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En taimow Levi chenchap Arawn uowi nadowi bow? Aia dow klangiungma tuk tek laiklow mih ang tuk. Aia mih en hown nauang takrum kownkow uang tarü khowk. Aia dow khi en hanow lainowmma naawmrawm kown. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Now tawng chow atek takla mih aia kowi en natek pe kown. Enchi tek lai mih khin khe ang natawi khowng enchi kown taih, now tawng chow achang takla mih paw ang nasang enchi kown taih. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />En takcha aia dow maru kawm pur kowi natek lai kown. Aia dow en kowh lai tek mih naown kown. Now en dow aia kowh thurai iawng naown kown. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />En kowh nami raitua mih en napawla reng kown. Nami raitua hown awdara lup maten en natüng pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren kowi Mosi kowplan mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Nami kung kowi dow a-pu Jethraw tut-e Mosi kowplan now tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi kowh ang tasin taken miuüa tut-e pe kowi ang diah. Kawmat paw amatni sing uowi reng tak chünchü mih kowmü kown ang nau,” pakhai. Now aiungma naia towmla kownkow a-pu Jethraw dow Mosi kowi krawi peah <char style="w">prasi</char> khai.<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Midian pren kowi uowi mih khin khe Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kawmat Aigupta pren kowi kowplan diah. En kowi kowngta en kownkow krawi cham en mih maru-uüa kowng bowk khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Now Mosi mih amasi hai achapa iüah kowi <char style="w">kawrngaramchük</char> luk kowi tangla now Aigupta pren kowi kowkowi khai bowt. Nami Thurai kür uowi mih aia kowh raitua paw pawla khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Awdara lup maten nachangla kown mih kür ang peta en khowk. Aigupta pren kowi en kowtowm mih khin khe Faraw pur kowi awdara lup maten en nakowtüng pe kown. Nachenganchepaw aia kowh saktuak dow akhawtma ang nachangta pe kown. Naiawng rakowi aia mih en maru-uüa kowi nalawt en kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Nami khin khe Faraw kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Israel dow ang kowh chapa ta chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Nachupiia ang kownkow ang kowh chapa ta kowi lawtta kown mih ang tek en khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia kowi en lawtah dowi. Naiawng rakowi en kowh chapa ta kowi ang nakowngta kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Aigupta pren prakowi mang büah mih khin khe iakra kowi CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi kowi nakowngta kownkow aia pur kowi uang tatüng pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Nami khin khe amasi Zipawr mih huaran pawah lowk hanow achapa kowi hiah pe <char style="w">khampha uanpik</char> khai. Nami khampha uanpik dow ahua Mosi khawk kowi kowlükah now tek pe mih, “Ang lawtta vi khowk. Naiawng rakowi kawmat dow en mih ang hua<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hua </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami tawngbak mih Baibul dow ahua kowi tek pe mih iawng, now tawngbak mih Baibul dow achapa kowi kowh tek pe mih iawng ruiah khai.</char></note> towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Nami laiklow Zipawr tek mih dow khampha uanpik hiah lawnguan kowi chekhai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow Mosi kowi lawtah khai.<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi hai Arawn iüah takrum mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Nami khin khe Arawn kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Süngrüp süngkangma kowi Mosi tut-e kowkowi diah,” pakhai. Nahanow Arawn dow kowkowi khai, now aia dow Thurai hungh kowi Mosi hown kowtakrum hanow namah khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Mosi mih aia kowi CHAKRAMANG krawi tek pe mih srui Arawn kowi lawp pe khai. Nami klen kowi tawng awdara lup ngai chow nachang kownkow CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih paw aia dow Arawn kowi lawp pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih Aigupta pren kowi kowkowiah now Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa maten kowi arasang kuaah khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Now Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG krawi tek pe mih maten kowbüah kowi Arawn phuang pe khai. Now awdara uowima mih lup ün paw maru-uüa pur kowi Mosi tüng pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Nahanow Israeluüa dow Mosi kowi Thurai uang chinah mih chekhai pami owmah khai bowt. Amatni kham ngare mih iu khi kowh CHAKRAMANG uang khowngah kown pami ta büah hanow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah iiaah khai.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s1">Faraw tut-e Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowkowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe mih, “Israeluüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih, ‘Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowkowiah now ang vüi nauang chang phuchua pawi kownkow ang maru-uüa kowi pe kowiah diah,’ padow natek en kownkow tek angching khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Nachenganchepaw Faraw tek pe mih, “Mia chow nami CHAKRAMANG? Tawngplawng kowchow aia ana chün hanow Israeluüa kowi ang nape kowiah kown? Nami CHAKRAMANG kowi paw ang tuk dowi, now Israeluüa kowi paw ang nape kowiah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Nami khin khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah tek pe mih, “Hebraiuüa kowh Thurai mih anging tut-e uang tatüng khai. Naiawng rakowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi sum ni mang rawng kowkowiah hanow anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai vüi tawncher hown nachang phuchua kownkow sakrauma hown pe kowi anging diah. Naiawng nadowi hanow makowng hawi hai tasenra hown aia mih narip anging kown chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Now Aigupta mang tek pe mih, “Mosi hai Arawn, tawngplawng kowchow maru-uüa kowi enchi tuk piakta pe lup chang sak khai? Tarü, kowchang lup büah. <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Mü madiah, pren kowi enni kowh maru iun lainowmma uang hu khai bowt. Maru kawmuüa taingta lup chang mih dow enchi rakowi chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Nami ni khe Faraw mih naruüa luk kowi nachang nowng kownkow aia towah mih Aigupta aluchowuüa hai Israeluüa hownia kowh kruitown miuüa kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />Faraw tek pe mih, “Nathawpla ipbawn kownkow maru-uüa kowi enni napeah chahau kown nadowi bowt. Amatni vüi chahau dow amatni matia pacham krawi tawnla towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Nachenganchepaw alai kowh amatni rik thawp khowt chi kawmat paw amatni kowi enni nape thawpah ipbawn kown takla; lowkchow paw iut dowi iawng enni nape thawpah kown. Thurai vüi kowi tawncher hown cham chang phuchua kown pahai amatni tek mih dow silik lup chang kowh chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Dai lai prakowi pe ching dowi kownkow lup chang hown pe pusaah diah. Amatni kowi nami lak-e lang krat mih lup pe changah büah küng diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Nami khin khe naruüa kowi nachangah nowng kown mih Aigupta aluchowuüa hai Israeluüa hownia kowh kruitown miuüa dow prang kowi lawt hanow maru kawmuüa kowi tek pe mih, “Faraw tek aia nape enni chahau kown nadowi bowt pe. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Enni cham ka rah hownia chahau mih enni nacham tawn bowt kown. Tawkchedow enni kowh lup mih ditchow paw naiut enni kown nadowi,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow chahau takcha nacham tawn chathang kownkow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi cham krawi tauet khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Nami aluchowuüa dow maru kawmuüa kowi krowkah se tek pe mih, “Pe enni chahau khe kowh ni towng enni ia thawp ipbawn khowt chi kawmat paw enni nathawp kown takla,” pape khai. <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Now akat khe dow Faraw kowh aluchowuüa mih amatni towah mih Israeluüa hownia kowh kruitown miuüa kowi bawpah tepah se tek pe mih, “Enni rik thawp khe kowh ni towng enni ia thawp khowt chi tawngplawng kowchow enni thawp ipbawn dowi? Ani paw enni thawp dowi, now mani paw enni thawp dowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa hownia kowh kruitown miuüa dow Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now tabawk krawm se atünma tek pe mih, “En kowh naruüa hown tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang khai? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />Chahau dow pe anging dowi kowi en kowh aluchowuüa pe thawp anging ipbawn khai. En kowh naruüa kowi bawpah tepah mih sam mü madiah; tawkche atawi dow en maru-uüa kowh chowtaih,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Faraw klangah mih, “Enni dow silikma, tawng lup paw chang kown enni nau dowi. Naiawng rakowi enni tek mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG vüi nakowchang tawncher phuchua kownkow pe kowi anging diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Tarü, kowchang lup büah. Nape enni chahau kown nadowi. Tawkchedow enni nathawp kown mih laiklow uowi mowr chi enni nathawp ipbawn reng kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa hownia kowh kruitown miuüa dow kla phih mih chowbowt lowmow pami tatuk büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow rik thawp ipbawn khe kowh khowt chi kawmat paw ipbawn thawp takla khai. <verse eid="EXO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />Amatni dow Faraw pur hownia uang lawt hanow Mosi hai Arawn iüah hown uang takrum khai. Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow amatni kowi hawt chawngah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Nakhowk khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi Israeluüa hownia kowh kruitown miuüa tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG pacham pe enchi <char style="w">ripra</char> lah. Enchi rakowi Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kawmat sui anging khai bowt. Naiawng hai nasai anging kownkow kowbüah rut kowi saidawng enchi ap pe khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai tut-e Mosi chawk lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Kowplan hanow CHAKRAMANG kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawngplawng kowchow mami chenchap kowi en tuk towkah ngare khai? Tawngplawng kowchow ang kowi en uang tuk chin ang khai? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />En ming hown Faraw tut-e ki tek lai hownia mami maru-uüa luk kowi phih uang kla khai. Tawng kowi chow en maru-uüa kowi en lawngah mih?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa kowi nalawngah kownkow Thurai khamah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Khaleng dow Faraw kowi tawng chow ang nachangah kown mih sam mü madiah ba. Ang kowh kür ang natüng pe hanow aia dow ang maru-uüa kowi nalawtta bowt kown taih. Ang kowh kür khi hanow aia dow aia pren hownia ang maru-uüa kowi naprütta bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Thurai plan tek pe Mosi mih, “Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Lowra nowngia chang mih Thurai iawng hai Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah tut-e ang kowtatüng pe reng. Nachenganchepaw ang ming dow CHAKRAMANG pami amatni kowi ang phuang pe dowi tak. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Amatni vüi kowi dow ang tow pe sangbowk laitawm khowk chekhai. Nami sangbowk laitawm kowi ang tek pe mih, ‘Prenlang maru iawng hai kawmat kowh enni uowiah mih Kanan pren ang nape enni kown,’ ang pape khai. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Aigupta maru-uüa towah nar mih Israeluüa kowh kar klow dow ang ta khai. Amatni hown kowh ang kowh sangbowk laitawm laiklow dow ang sak kowi uowi reng. <verse eid="EXO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. Aiguptauüa kowh ngare towkra hownia ang nalawtla enni bowt kown. Amatni changla enni nar mih hownia ang nalawng enni kown. Amatni kowi dow ang kowh rut akürma mih hown lainowmma ang naripah hanow ang nalawng enni kown. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Enni kowi dow ang nachangla enni ang maru kown; ang dow enni kowh Thurai naown kown. Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh Thurai pami enni natuk kown. Now Aiguptauüa kowh ngare towkra hownia uang lawtla enni mih paw ang chowtaih pami enni natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowi ang napeah pren kownkow ang takham khai. Nami pren kowi ang napawla enni kown, now nami pren dow ang nape powng enni bowt kown. Ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Now Mosi dow naiawngün laiklow maten Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe khai. Nachenganchepaw nar lup chang bowm hai sak piak lai bowt rakowi Israeluüa mih Mosi laiklow kowi pe ching dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Aigupta mang tut-e kowkowiah now aia pren hownia Israeluüa kowi nalawtah kownkow kowtek pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Nachenganchepaw Mosi tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Ang dow tuk tek lai kaneu dowi. Israeluüa khowm padow ang laiklow sünta kown nau dowk now Faraw ngam padow tawng iawng chow nasünta ang laiklow kown chow?” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Nakhowk khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi nalawtla kownkow ang pe enchi ana mih Aigupta mang hai Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe iüa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh krungchak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Maiawngünuüa dow Reuben, Simiawn hai Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Jakawb kowh chapa ta Reuben kowh chapauüa dow Hanawk, Pallu, Hezrawn hai Karmi büah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 6:14">Maiawngünuüa dow Reuben krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Simiawn kowh chapauüa dow Jemuel, Jamin, Awhad, Jakin, Zohar hai Sawl büah chekhai. Sawl dow Kanan masiuüa hown kowh kaah mih chekhai. Maiawngünuüa dow Simiawn krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Levi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn, Kohat hai Merari büah chekhai. Levi dow 137 ning mowr singla khai.<verse eid="EXO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Gersawn kowh chapa dow Libni hai Simei iüah chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Kohat kowh chapauüa dow Amram, Izhar, Hebrawn hai Uziel büah chekhai. Kohat dow 133 ning mowr singla khai. <verse eid="EXO 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Merari kowh chapa dow Mali hai Musi iüah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Amram kowh masi dow a-pa kowh tuamow Jawkebed chekhai. Amatchi kowh chapa dow Arawn hai Mosi iüah chekhai. Amram dow 137 ning mowr singla khai.<verse eid="EXO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Ishar kowh chapauüa dow Kora, Nefek hai Zikri büah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Uziel kowh chapauüa dow Misael, Elzafan hai Sithri büah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Arawn dow Aminadab kowh chama Eliseba pami hown <char style="w">tachawng</char> khai. Eliseba kowh rak dow Nasawn chekhai. Now Eliseba hown kowh Arawn kaah mih chapauüa dow Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar hai Ithamar büah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Kora kowh chapauüa dow Asir, Elkana hai Abiasaf büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Kora krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Arawn kowh chapa Eleazar dow Putiel kowh chama hown tachawng khai. Now nami hown kowh Eleazar kaah mih chapa dow Finehas chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi <char style="w">siphai</char> hawmh iawng nauang lawtla kownkow CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow nami krungchakuüa hownia kowh chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi nalawtla kown mih lai Faraw tut-e kowtek mih dow nami Mosi hai Arawn iüah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi kowi Thurai peah ana mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28-29" />Aigupta pren kowi Mosi hown taklang mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang chowbowt CHAKRAMANG. Ang tek en mih srui Aigupta mang kowi kowtek pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe Mosi tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “Ang dow tuk tek lai kaneu dowi. Tawng iawng chow ang kowh laiklow Faraw nasünta ang kown chow?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Sünta diah, Faraw tut-e mih thurai iawng ang nachang en kown. Now en taimow Arawn dow en kowh <char style="w">risi</char> iawng natek lai kown. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Ang pe en mih ana maten en taimow Arawn kowi en naphuang pe kown. Aia dow Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi nalawtah kownkow Faraw kowi natek pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3-4" />Aigupta pren kowi amatra hai awdara lup ahuma lup ang tüng pe chepaw Faraw mih nachün enchi laiklow kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowh saktuak dow akhawtma ang changta pe kown chekhai. Aigupta prenchakuüa luk kowi mih ang napar pe rut hanow lainowmma ang naripah kown, now ang maru-uüa kowi dow nami pren hownia ang nauang lawtla kown. <verse eid="EXO 7:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Ang kowh kür hown Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi ang uang lawtla mih khin khe dow Aigupta maru-uüa mih ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">ana pek</char> iawng chang khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Faraw hown taklang mih khin khe Mosi dow 80 ning khowk chekhai, now Arawn dow 83 ning khowk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arawn kowh raitua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe mih, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“Awdara lup natüng kownkow Faraw tek enchi mih khin khe Arawn kowi en tek pe kown mih, ‘Faraw pur kowi en kowh raitua iu kuak diah,’ pape diah. Nahanow nami raitua dow nachowng rua kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng Faraw tut-e kowchang khai bowt. Nakowi dow Arawn mih Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa pur kowi aia kowh raitua kuakah khai. Now nami raitua dow awr chowng rua khai. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Nami khi hanow Faraw dow maiaklese sarauüa hai amatni kowi kowh khowng miuüa kowi nakrawi haw kownkow krawi chin maru khai. Now amatni kowh maiaklese kür hown nami lup dow tawi chang büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />Amatni paw amatni kowh raitua maten krawng kowi kuakah büah khai, now naiawngün raitua paw awr chowng rua khai. Tawkchedow Arawn kowh raitua mih amatni kowh raitua maten kowi iawnta pe bowk khai. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Nachenganchepaw Faraw kowh saktuak dow akhawtma uowi reng chekhai. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi. Nami dow amatchi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng uang phaw mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">1. Vi hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Faraw kowh saktuak dow akhawtma uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow maru-uüa kowi lawtah dowi. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Tharau rau-e khe Nail aw kowi Faraw nakowkowi kown. Nakhowk khe aia hown natakrum kownkow aw pang kowi en kowhawt iowng diah. Now chowng rua mih en kowh raitua paw pawla diah. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Faraw kowi en tek pe kown mih, ‘Hebraiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih mami laiklow uang tek en kownkow uang chin ang mih chekhai. Aia tek mih: Süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang maru-uüa nauang chup ang kownkow en nalawtah kown mih uang tek en khowk chowdiah. Tawkchedow kawmat mowr kowi ang laiklow en sünta ang dowi. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Naiawng rakowi mami amatra en khi hanow ang dow CHAKRAMANG pami en natuk kown,’ napape kown. Now Faraw kowi en plan tek pe kown mih, ‘Mü diah, mami ang kowh raitua hown kawmat mih Nail aw tui kowi ang bawp kown. Nahanow mami aw tui dow nachowng vi kown. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Now aw kowi kowh dam maten nakowng bowk kown. Mami aw kowi kowh dam su nam dow nakrawi tauet kown. Naiawng rakowi Aigupta maru-uüa mih nakham aw tui kown mih nasui büah kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Arawn mih aia kowh raitua pawla now Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw, awchawng, kanh hai cham tatum hüah mih tui maten prakowi aia kowh raitua nakrawi rawk kownkow tek pe diah. Nahanow naiawngün tui mih nachowng vi bowk kown towbowt. Now Aigupta paprenma kowi vi nakrawi uowi kown; tui nungra maten kowi kowh tui ün khowm padow nachowng vi bowk kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng chang iüah khai bowt. Arawn mih Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa pur kowi aia kowh raitua hown Nail aw tui kowi iu bawpah khai. Now nami Nail aw tui maten dow uang chowng vi khai. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Nami aw kowi kowh dam dow kowng bowk hanow asu nam mih lainowmma krawi tauet khai. Naiawng rakowi Aiguptauüa mih nami tui nowngia kham büah dowi bowt. Aigupta paprenma kowi dow vi kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Nachenganchepaw Aigupta pren kowi kowh maiaklese sarauüa paw amatni kowh maiaklese kür hown nami lup tawi nowng chang khai. Naiawng rakowi Faraw kowh saktuak dow akhawtma uowi reng chekhai. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh laiklow sünta pe dowi. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG tekta iawng uang phaw mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Faraw dow aia kim kowi powtta pe khai. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh laiklow prakowi hing pe pe ching dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Aigupta maru-uüa dow ka kham aw tui dowi bowt rakowi aw pang kowi cham krawi uat tuikuam büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Nail aw tui luk kowi CHAKRAMANG bawpah mih hownia naiawng uowi mih dow ranit ni mowr chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="s1">2. Purh hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe diah, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Nauang chupiia ang kownkow ang maru Israeluüa kowi pe kowiah diah. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Israeluüa kowi che en pe kowiah dowi now Aigupta pren paprenma kowi purh hown ang towk enni ngare kown. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Nail aw kowi mih purh natek mup kown. Now aw hownia purh nauang lawt hanow en kim kowi nauang uowi kown. Naiawngün purh dow en kowh towklak kowi hai en kowh phangbek kowi ün nakrawi uowi kown. En kowh maru iukuüa hai en kowh maru-uüa kim kowi paw nauang krawi uowi kown. Nami klen kowi en kowh taping hai en kowh kawmdi lawk müa biatum kowi ün nakrawi uowi kown. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Naiawngün purh dow en hai en kowh maru iukuüa hai en kowh maru-uüa luk kowi nakrawi chetla prung kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Arawn kowi kowtek pe diah. Aigupta pren kowi kowh aw hai awchawng uowi mih maten hown kanh uowi mih maten prakowi aia kowh raitua hailawm rut mih pakrawi rawk lah; nahanow purh nakrawi uowi kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Now Arawn dow Aigupta pren kowi kowh tui uowi mih maten prakowi aia kowh rut krawi rawkah khai. Now purh uang lawt hanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi atekma uang uowi khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Now maiaklese sarauüa paw amatni kowh maiaklese kür hown naiawng mih lup tawi nowng chang khai. Amatni paw Aigupta pren kowi purh ahuma uang tawi ia pawla khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Nami khin khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi Faraw hawah now tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowkowi iüa diah, now ang hai ang maru-uüa hownia maiawngün purh namata kownkow kowchup anging Thurai iüa diah. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG vüi tawncher hown nachang phuchua kownkow Israeluüa kowi ang pe kowiah sow,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Mosi tek pe Faraw mih, “Naiawngün purh dow en kim hownia, en kowh maru iukuüa kim hownia hai en kowh maru-uüa hownia napowt hanow aw kowi krowngchow nakowuowi kownkow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang kowtek kown taih. CHAKRAMANG tut-e nakowtek kownkow tawng khe chow en nau mih en phai tek ang akhin diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Faraw tek pe mih, “Tharau khe kowtek diah,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Mosi tek pe mih, “En tek iawng naphaw kown taih. Now anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai iawng miapaw uowi dowi chekhai pami nami hownia en natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Naiawngün purh dow en hownia hai en kim hownia, now en kowh maru iukuüa hownia hai en kowh maru-uüa hownia napowt kown taih. Naiawngün purh dow Nail aw kowi krowngchow towbowt nauowi kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Naiawng tekla pe now Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow Faraw pur hownia powt khai. Now Faraw luk kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG uang pe tingah mih purh naprütta pe kownkow Mosi mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowkar khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow Mosi tek iawng chang pe khai. Kim kowi kowh hown viadawng kowi kowh uowi mih ün, now üa hai laih kowi kowh uowi mih ün, purh uowi mih maten dow kowng bowk khai. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Naiawngün purh uak dow maru kawmuüa krawi kuaah hanow achun achunma cham towah khai. Naiawngün purh su nam dow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi krawi tauet khai. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün purh kowng bowk mih tuk hanow Faraw dow aia kowh saktuak akhawtma changah khai iawk. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh laiklow kowi pe ching dowi iawk chekhai. CHAKRAMANG rik tekta khowk iawng dow uang phaw khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">3. Changitchow hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Arawn kowi kowtek pe diah. Aia kowh raitua parah now krawng kowi kowh dinchow kowi pacham hup lah. Now naiawngün dinchow dow nachowng changitchow hanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi natek mup kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow naiawng kowchang khai bowt. Arawn mih aia kowh raitua parah now krawng kowi kowh dinchow kowi iu hup khai. Nahanow Aigupta pren kowi kowh dinchow maten dow chowng changitchow khai bowt. Now naiawngün changitchow dow maru hai tawncher hawmh luk kowi krawi chawp khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Maiaklese sarauüa dow amatni kowh maiaklese kür hown natawi lawt changitchow kownkow tawi chang büa chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw amatni dow tawi ia chang dowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh changitchow kawm dow maru-uüa hai tawncher hawmh luk kowi krawi chawp prungrung khai. <verse eid="EXO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Naiawng rakowi maiaklese sarauüa tek pe Faraw mih, “Naiawngün lup kowi dow Thurai kowh rut tawi uowi chekhai,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw Faraw kowh saktuak dow akhawtma hing uowi hüah khai. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh lai sünta pe dowi chekhai. CHAKRAMANG rik tekta khowk iawng dow uang phaw khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">4. Ving hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Akung kowi Thurai tek pe Mosi mih, “Rau murpa en narü hanow aw pang kowi Faraw kowkowi mih khin khe Faraw pur kowi en nakowiowng kown. Now Faraw kowi en natek pe kown mih, ‘CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Nakowchup ang kownkow ang maru-uüa kowi pe kowiah diah. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />En che pe kowiah dowi kowh chalow now en hai en kowh maru iukuüa hown en kowh maru-uüa luk kowi ang nauang chin enni ving kawm kown. Aigupta maru-uüa uowi rah maten kowi dow kim lak kowi hai prang kowi ving kangowh natek mup kown. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Nachenganchepaw ang maru-uüa uowi rah Gawsen süng kowi dow ving ang nape uowiah kown nadowi. Nami hownia dow ang CHAKRAMANG mami pren kowi uowi chekhai pami enni natuk kown. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Ang kowh maru-uüa hai en kowh maru-uüa kowi dow alangma ang namüah kown; ang kowh maru-uüa kowi dow ang nalawngah kown. Nachenganchepaw en kowh maru-uüa kowi dow ang lawngah dowi tham. Mami awdara lup dow tharau khe en nakhi kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow naiawng chang khai bowt. Ving kawm dow ahuma Faraw kim kowi hai aia kowh maru iukuüa kim kowi kowkup khai bowt. Naiawngün ving kawm rakowi Aigupta pren paprenma kowi dow piakra uang ting khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Nami khin khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi hawah now Faraw tek pe mih, “Mami Aigupta pren kowi tawng re-e chünchü cham kowiah büah hanow enni kowh Thurai vüi tawncher hown cham chang phuchua büah towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Now Mosi tek pe mih, “Naiawng nachang kown mih taka dowi tham. Tawncher hown phuchua CHAKRAMANG Thurai mih maru-uüa kowi dow Aigupta maru-uüa naukhi dowi chekhai. Aigupta maru-uüa naukhi dowi mih lup amatni pur kowi anging chang hanow hua hown nakuak anging büah kown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />CHAKRAMANG Thurai ana pek iawng süngrüp süngkangma kowi sum ni mang rawng mangah hanow aia vüi kowi anging kowchang phuchua kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Now Faraw tek pe mih, “Enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai vüi tawncher hown nachang phuchua kownkow süngrüp süngkangma kowi ang nape kowi enni kown taih. Tawkchedow alakma kowi enni cham nowng kowi kown nadowi. Khaleng dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang vüi kowlü iawk diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Now Mosi tek pe mih, “En hai en kowh maru iukuüa hai en kowh maru-uüa hownia naiawngün ving kawm tharau khe napowt kownkow en hownia powt hown akrowksang CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang nakowlü kown. Tawkchedow hauang kuan anging tham bowt; anging kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi tawncher hown nachang phuchua kownkow en pe kowi anging ngengche kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Akung kowi Faraw pur hownia Mosi powt hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowlü khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Now CHAKRAMANG paw Mosi tek iawng chang pe khai. Aia dow Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa hai aia kowh maru-uüa hownia ving kawm maten henta pe khai; lowkchow khowm ta lat dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Nachenganchepaw nami leng paw Faraw dow aia kowh saktuak akhawtma changah khai iawk, now maru-uüa kowi pe kowiah dowi iawk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s1">5. Tawncher kowng hawi hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe diah, ‘Hebraiuüa kowh Thurai, CHAKRAMANG tek mih maiawng: Nauang chupiia ang kownkow ang maru-uüa kowi pe kowiah diah. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Amatni kowi che en pe kowiah dowi kowi en townah iawk hanow <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />dowm kowi kowh kawrnga, kawrngaramchük, ut, chia, ruapur, rua hai en kowh tawncher uowi mih maten luk kowi kramra uowima mih makowng hawi ang nauang pawla pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowh tawncher hawmh kowi dow Aigupta maru-uüa kowh tawncher hawmh kowi iawng ang nachangah kown nadowi. Israeluüa kowh tawncher hawmh dow lowkchow paw natawi kowng kown nadowi,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Now makowng hawi nauang ting kown mih akhin paw CHAKRAMANG khowm bowkla pe khai. Aia tek mih, “Tharau khe naiawngün dow ang nape phawah kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Now nami powm iawng dow auai ni khe CHAKRAMANG chang khai bowt. Aiguptauüa kowh tawncher maten dow kowng khai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowh tawncher dow lowkchow paw tawi kowng dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Faraw dow krawi paw satang kownkow krawi chin maru khai, now Israeluüa kowh tawncher dow lowk paw tawi kowng dowi pami ta khai. Nachenganchepaw Faraw kowh saktuak dow akhawtma uowi reng; aia dow Israeluüa kowi lawtah dowi iawk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">6. Pawibau hawi hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Taping hownia kowchawm plawi iüah pre sum chawm diah. Nami plawi dow Faraw pur kowi kuang prakowi Mosi paawr uetah lah. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Naiawngün plawi dow dinchow iawng naphaw hanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi nauang kla kown. Now Aigupta pren paprenma kowi maru hown tawncher buk kowi pawibau naphaw hanow nama kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah dow taping hownia kowchawmla plawi hanow Faraw pur kowi kowkowi khai. Now nami plawi dow kuang prakowi Mosi awr uetta hanow maru hai tawncher buk kowi pawibau phaw now awrma khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Nami pawibau dow akeng miuüa kowi iawng maiaklese sarauüa buk kowi paw phaw khai. Naiawng rakowi maiaklese sarauüa dow Mosi pur kowi uang nowng uang dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Nachenganchepaw Faraw kowh saktuak dow akhawtma CHAKRAMANG changta pe khai iawk. Aia dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowh laiklow kowi pe ching dowi iawk chekhai. CHAKRAMANG rik tekta khowk iawng dow uang phaw khai.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">7. Ria hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Murpa rü hanow Faraw pur kowi kowkowi diah. Now Faraw kowi kowtek pe kown mih, ‘Hebraiuüa kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tek mih maiawng: Nauang chupiia ang kownkow ang maru-uüa kowi pe kowiah diah. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Naiawng nadowi now khaleng dow en kowh maru iukuüa hown en kowh maru-uüa luk kowi krowngchow nadowi kowi en luk kowi ngengche paw ngare towkra chap maten ang nauang pe tingah kown. Nami khin khe dow palusama kowi ang iawng mih miapaw uowi dowk pami en natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />Ang nau panü dow ang kowh kür hown ang uang pawla enni makowng hawi hanow lusa hownia ang nowng mitta enni prang bowt diah. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Nachenganchepaw ang kowh kür ang nowng tüngla en kownkow hai palusama kowi ang kowh ming pacham tahowng lah pakowh ang pe sing en reng tak mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Kawmat mowr paw ang maru-uüa luk kowi en chang bawri reng tak, now amatni kowi mih en lawtah dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Naiawng rakowi tharau kowh maiawng khin khe kramra uowima mih ria ang nauang pe klaah kown. Naiawng mih ria dow Aigupta pren uown uowi hownia kawmat mowr katpaw uang kla dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Naiawng rakowi dowm kowi kowh uowi mih en kowh tawncher hai maru maten kowi tatung tanimra kowi nauang pawla kownkow kowkrawi chin maru diah. Maru lah, tawncher lah, prang kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow ria kuakah rakowi nakowng bowk kown chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG laiklow kowi kram mih Faraw kowh maru iukuüa dow amatni kowh naruüa hai tawncher hawmh kowi alenma kim kowi uang mangla khai. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG laiklow kowi pe ching dowi miuüa dow amatni kowh naruüa hai tawncher hawmh kowi dowm kowi towta hüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Kuang prakowi en kowh rut awr chawk diah. Nahanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi maru hai tawncher hown singh kau luk kowi ria nauang kla kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />Nakhowk khe Mosi dow aia kowh raitua kuang prakowi awr chawkah khai. Now lainowmma muk tün hai ria uang kla khai bowt, now kaikreng paw sawr khai bowt. Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG dow Aigupta pren kowi uang chin pe ria khai. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Ria uang kla klen kowi pla paw nowi plaplap khai. Naiawng mih ria hai maih dow Aigupta pren uown phaw hownia kawmat mowr kowi katpaw uowi dowi tak chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Aigupta pren paprenma kowi dowm kowi kowh uowi mih maru hai tawncher maten dow ria hownia miapaw plai dowi chekhai. Ria kuakah rakowi üa hai laih kowi kowh uanh maten dow piak bowk chekhai; singh khowm padow tapiak bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa uowi rah Gawsen süng kowi dow ria kla dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Nakhowk khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi hawah now Faraw tek pe mih, “Khaleng tarapdow ang changta <char style="w">angak</char> khai nowm. CHAKRAMANG chang mih tawi dowi chekhai. Ang hai ang kowh maru-uüa tawi khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Muk tün hai ria kla mih anging nowng kham dowi bowt chekhai; nataingta bowt kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowi kowtek pe diah. Khaleng dow ang lawt enni kown towbowt. Makowi enni uowi kla dowk tham,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Now Mosi tek pe mih, “Marow hownia lawt hown akrowksang chawk rut se CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang nakowlü kown. Now muk tün paw narim kown, now ria paw kla dowi bowt tham. Nahanow palusama dow CHAKRAMANG kowh chekhai pami en natuk bowt kown. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Tawkchedow en hai en kowh maru iukuüa mih CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi kawmat paw kram dowi tak pami ang tuk chowh,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />Nami khin khe Aigupta pren kowi dow iakmow lawt thüm chekhai, now la paw pau thüm chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami ria hown iakmow hai la dow hing piak bowk khai. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe püm dow ru dowi tak rakowi tawngpaw tawi piak dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Nami kung kowi Mosi dow Faraw kim hownia powt khai bowt. Aia dow marow hownia lawt hanow chawk rut se CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowlü khai. Nahanow muk tün hai ria kla mih dow rim khai bowt. Nami klen kowi uangchak mang kla iawmlawm mih paw taing khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün uangchak hai ria kla mih hown muk tün mih taing kung kowi dow Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa mih plan chang ngak khai iawk. Amatni dow amatni kowh saktuak akhawtma changah büah khai iawk. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG rik tek pe khowk iawng dow Faraw kowh saktuak mih akhawtma uowi reng; aia dow Israeluüa kowi lawtah dowi iawk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s">8. Plawng hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1-2" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Faraw tut-e kowkowi diah. Faraw hai aia maru iukuüa kowh saktuak akhawtma ang changta pe khowk. Ang kowh awdara lup ang nowng tüngla kownkow hai Aigupta maru-uüa luk kowi ang changah naklak mih hown awdara lup maten en chu en chauüa kowi en nowng lawpla pe kownkow naiawng ang chang mih chekhai. Nahanow ang chowtaih CHAKRAMANG pami enni natuk kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah mih Faraw tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG, Hebraiuüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Tawng nam khe chow ang tut-e en nakham sum kown? Nachup naiia ang kownkow ang maru-uüa kowi lawtta bowt diah. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />En che ang maru-uüa kowi lawtah kown nauta dowi kowh chalow now tharau khe en pren kowi ang nauang pawla en plawng hawmh kown. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Nami plawng hawmh dow paprenma kowi nauang krawi uowi kown. Nami khin khe krawng khowm padow enni nakhi kown nadowi tham. Nami plawng hawmh dow ria kuak khe kowh tawi piak dowi mih ün nakrawi chata bowk kown. Dowm kowi kowh singh pawi awr awm mih ün paw nakrawi chata bowk kown. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Nami kung kowi en kowh kim, en kowh maru iukuüa kim hai Aigupta pren kowi kowh kim maten kowi nami plawng hawmh atekma nakrawi uowi kown. Naiawng mih plawng hawmh dow enni pipu-uüa khowm padow lusa kowi uang uowi hownia katpaw uanla dowi tak chekhai,’ pape diah” pakhai. Naiawng ki tekla kung kowi Mosi dow Faraw hownia powt khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Nakhowk khe Faraw kowi aia kowh maru iukuüa tek pe mih, “Mün khowt tak chow nami maru natowk a-i kawm kown? Aigupta pren piak bowk khowk mih en tuk dowi tak bow? Nami maru-uüa kowi amatni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi nakowchup kownkow lawtta bowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi mih Faraw tut-e maru kowplan pawla khai iawk. Amatchi kowi Faraw tek pe mih, “Kowkowi now enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi kowchup büa diah. Tawkchedow amia ngai chow enni kowkowi kown mih tekla ang büah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Now Mosi klangah mih, “Anging kowh ngeuüa hai lawngtanguüa, anging kowh chauüa hai tawncher hawmh maten kowi anging napawla bowk kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG vüi anging kowchang pawi lowk kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Now amatchi kowi Faraw tek pe mih, “Enni kowh chauüa kowi che enni pawla hanow CHAKRAMANG nakhowng enni kown takla. Enni kowh sangkrangra angakma chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Naiawng nadowi, CHAKRAMANG kowi enni kowchup kown chedow kachakuüa ngetchow kowkowi büah towbowt,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi Faraw pur hownia prütta khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En kowh rut mih Aigupta pren luk kowi parah diah. Now plawng hawmh nauang hanow Aigupta pren kowi ria kuak khe kowh tawi piak dowi mih pramna hai singh pawi maten dow nauang krawi chata bowk kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Nakhowk khe Mosi dow aia kowh raitua mih Aigupta pren luk kowi parah khai. Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow satlawt li uang pe uangah khai. Nami satlawt li dow ni chut uar prowt Aigupta pren kowi hing uangta hüah chekhai. Now auai rau dow nami satlawt li hown plawng hawmh paw uang tawi rown khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Now nami plawng hawmh dow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi uang krawi chawp khai. Naiawng khowt mih plawng hawmh hu dow nami dowi rawn khe katpaw khi dowi tak chekhai, now nami kung kowi paw nakhi kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Nami plawng hawmh dow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi krawi uowi bowk chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Aigupta pren dow hing iiu mup khai. Now ria kuak khe kowh tawi piak dowi mih dowm kowi kowh pramna hai singh kowi kowh uih maten nami plawng hawmh krawi chata bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi Aigupta pren paprenma kowi dow singh hai pramna mih hing uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Nami khin khe Faraw dow Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi alenma uang hawla now tek pe mih, “Enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai luk kowi hai enni luk kowi ang changta angak khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown khaleng dow ang kowh angak lawt ang iüah akatchow diah. Mami ang luk kowi kowh kramra uowima mih ripra nahenta ang kownkow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai tut-e lü ang iüa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Nakhowk khe Mosi dow Faraw hownia powt hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowlü khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow satkup li uang pe uangah khai. Nami satkup li dow plawng hawmh kowi rownla now sata Rik kowi kowkuakta khai. Nami hownia now Aigupta pren paprenma kowi lowkchow khowm padow plawng uowi dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow Faraw kowh saktuak akhawtma changta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Faraw dow Israeluüa kowi lawtah dowi iawk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">9. Iiu hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mukuang prakowi en kowh rut awr parah diah. Nahanow Aigupta pren mih naiiu kown towbowt. Nami iiu krang dow puh lak kowi kowh cham uowi iawng naown kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Now Mosi dow mukuang prakowi awr par rut khai bowt. Nahanow Aigupta pren paprenma kowi dow sum ni mowr lainowmma iiu khai.<verse eid="EXO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Nami sum ni mowr mih lowkkowlowk miapaw takhi dowi chekhai. Kim hownia paw miapaw ia lawt dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa uowi rah kowi dow anowima chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Nakhowk khe Mosi kowi Faraw hawah now tek pe mih, “Kowkowiah now enni kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi kowchup büah towbowt. Enni kowh chauüa paw enni hown nowngia tawi kown taih. Tawkchedow enni kowh chia hai rua mih makowi enni nata towla kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Now Mosi klangah mih, “Anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai vüi tikah mih <char style="w">uanap</char> hai akeng mih uanap chang müa tawncher hawmh paw en nape pawla anging kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Anging kowh tawncher hawmh paw anging napawla bowk kown; lowkchow paw anging nata towla kown nadowi. Anging kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai kowi nachup naiiala kownkow naiawngün tawncher hawmh dow anging nalakke kown chekhai. Arah kowi kowtowm dowi mowr dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tawng iawng mih tawncher chow nalakke kown mih anging tuk dowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow Faraw kowh saktuak akhawtma changta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Faraw dow Israeluüa kowi lawtah kown mih nauta pe dowi.<verse eid="EXO 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Faraw tek pe Mosi mih, “Ang hownia alakma kowi cham powt prang. Ang pur kowi katpaw hauang tham bowt. Ang pur kowi che en uang iawk now en uang mih ni khe en nakowng kown!” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Nami khin khe Mosi tek pe mih, “Iung chowh! Ang matia low hown en pur kowi katpaw ang nauang kown nadowi bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Chapa ta kowng lawnguan Thurai rik phuang pe mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Faraw hai Aigupta prenchak kowi akatchow towbowt ang natowkah ngare kown. Nami kung kowi dow mami pren hownia Faraw nalawt enni kown towbowt. Mami pren hownia aia dow hing prütta enni kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Naiawng rakowi amatni kowh klowkchakuüa hownia kuh hai tai uanh nakrawi lüla kownkow Israeluüa maten kowi tek pe diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />Now Israeluüa kowi nasaksing sanaah kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow Aiguptauüa kowi peah saktuak khai. Nami klen kowi Mosi kowi dow akri akraingma mih maru pahai Faraw kowh maru iukuüa hown Aigupta maru-uüa nüla khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Faraw kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek uar dawng khe Aigupta pren iawng aia nauang mang kown pe. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Aigupta pren paprenma kowi chah ta maten nakowng kown. Faraw kowh chapa ta hownia nakowng hanow mi tung mih narma kowh chapa ta pat nakowng kown; mia kimchak paw nata lat kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi tawncher rik pen mih kowi kowh ala maten paw nakowng bowk kown. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Naiawng rakowi Aigupta pren paprenma kowi dow kar klow nachai ngawnglawng kown. Naiawng khowt mih kar klow dow nami dowi rawn katpaw uowi dowi tak chekhai, now nami kung kowi paw katpaw nauowi kown nadowi bowt tham. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi dow rarimma naown kown; maru kowi lah, tawncher kowi lah kui khowm padow na-uh kown nadowi tham. Naiawngün hownia dow Aigupta maru-uüa hown Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG lang kraah pami enni natuk kown. <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />En kowh maru iukuüa dow ang pur kowi uang tua kung hanow uang tek kown mih, ‘En kowh maru-uüa kowi pawla hanow lawt towbowt!’ napah ang kown. Nami kung kowi dow ang namang bowt kown pe,” pakhai. Naiawngün lai ki tek pe now Mosi dow atawm kunmarau Faraw pur hownia powt khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />CHAKRAMANG rik tek pe Mosi mih, “Aigupta pren kowi awdara lup ahuma ang nowng tüngla kownkow Faraw mih nasünta en lai kown nadowi,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Naiawngün awdara lup dow Faraw pur kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah chang khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih Faraw kowh saktuak akhawtma changta pe khai rakowi Faraw mih aia pren hownia Israeluüa kowi lawtah dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s">Takat Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />Aigupta pren kowi uowi reng tak khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Mami la dow enni vüi la uown naown kown, mami la dow enni kowh ning klowk müa la uown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Israeluüa kowi kuaah lawmah now kowtek pe iüah dit. Mami la lacher hamüt ni khe kim towng kowi kowh kim iah mih chowlowkkow kimchakuüa vüi rua chah chepaw, ruapur chah chepaw nakram apum chi kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Pakimchak vüi tawncher papum lakke dowi mih kantiachow che uowi khai hanow aria kowi kowh uowi mih kimchakuüa hown naia tahum kown. Pre dawng maru iun mün khowt chow nowng cha kown mih changah ingsap now naiawng khowt chow mih tawncher nakram kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Nami dow rua chepaw, ruapur chepaw paningchow mih ala chah naown kown takla, now aser auowk uowi dowi kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Nami tawncher dow mami la lacher laitali ni mowr natowah kown. Now laitali ni mih ni sat kup khe dow Israel chen pachenma chowlowkkow kimchakuüa vüi nangen tawncher kown.<verse eid="EXO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />“Now enni nacha pe chaknga kown mih kim towng kowi dow kimplawt mawm pre pra hown aluk pra mawm kowi enni naplik pe tawncher vi kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Nami iak khe naiawngün chaknga dow nakrengah hanow the pe <char style="w">tuah</char> dowi mih kawm hai akhakma mih pram kan hown enni nachaah kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />Naiawngün chaknga dow asing enni naiung cha kown nadowi, now abut paw enni naiung cha kown nadowi. Naiawngün dow alu, akhawk hai kawlakchak hailawm maih kowi krengah hanow enni nachaah kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />Naiawngün dow uarthowi pat tawngpaw enni natowah kown nadowi; ta lat khai ne tak now maih kowi enni natikta kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Nami enni cha mih khin khe enni kowh tawnguat kelang kowi enni nasükah kown, phanaikhawk paw enni nakruala kown, now raitua paw enni nadowkla kown takla. Now sakkrowng sakkrangma hown enni nachaah kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh Takat Pawi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />Nami iak dow Aigupta pren lak kowi ang nauang len kown. Now maru-uüa kowh chapa ta maten hai tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten ang nasaita kown. Aigupta pren kowi kowh akeng thurai maten kowi ang naripah kown. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Nachenganchepaw kimplawt mawm kowi kowh vi plikia uowi mih dow enni Israeluüa uowi rah pami amatra naown kown. Nami vi ang khi hanow ang nakatla enni kown. Naiawng hai Aigupta pren luk kowi ang towkah ngare mih hownia enni dow naplai kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />Nami ni dow enni natuakah reng kown mih ni chekhai. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chowngchowng saksakma ari iawng enni nasunah reng kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />“Ranit ni mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown. Nami ranit ni takra kowi the pe tuah mih kawm cha mih srui kowi dow Israel chenchap hownia enni nabatta kown takla. Naiawng rakowi enni kim kowi kowh tuah uowi mih maten auown ni khe enni nahenta kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />Auown ni hai achur ni kowi dow takua talawm büa diah, nami takua talawm khin dow chimsaima sunah büa diah. Nami pre ni dow kowmatia chakkham lup klen kowi akeng mih lup tawngpaw enni nachang kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />Nami The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi dow chowngchowng saksakma ari iawng enni nasunah reng kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ni dow Israel krungchak maten kowi Aigupta pren hownia ang lawtla enni mih enni natukla reng kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />La uown kowi kowh lacher laitali ni mih iak pra hownia pirmi lailowk ni iak pra mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />Nami ranit ni kowi enni kowh kim kowi mih mapaw tuah naia uowi kown nadowi. Akeng chenchap lah, Israel chenchap lah; nami khin khe kowh the pe tuah mih chakkham cha mih maru kowi dow Israel chenchap hownia enni nabatta kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />Lowra kowi enni cham uowi chepaw nami ranit ni lak kowi dow the pe tuah mih chakkham tawng chap paw enni nacha kown nadowi. Kawm paw the pe tuah dowi mih enni nacha kown takla,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Nami khin khe Israeluüa kowi kowh lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi Mosi hawah now tek pe mih, “Enni matia chowlowkkow kimchakuüa vüi enni nakram ruapur chah apum chi kown takla. Nami ruapur chah dow Takat Pawi kowi enni nangenah kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Now enni nacham paw pe lawngthow singh kre acheng hanow biatum kowi kowh vi kowi enni nachimah kown. Now nami vi dow kimplawt mawm pre pra hai aluk pra mawm kowi enni nakrawi plikah kown. Now uarthowi dowi mowr dow kim hownia miapaw enni naia lawt kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi CHAKRAMANG nasaiah kownkow pren lak kowi aia uang len mih khin khe enni kowh kimplawt kowi vi taplik mih khi hanow aia nakatla kown. Nakrawi sai maru kown mih kramamu kowi nasai enni kownkow enni kowh kim kowi CHAKRAMANG nape kupah kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />“Maiawngün ana pek maten dow enni hai enni kowh chuprek chaprekuüa mih ari iawng chowngchowng saksakma enni nasunah reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Nape enni kownkow aia kham enni mih pren kowi enni kowuowi khe paw nami pawi dow enni nasunah reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />‘Tawngplawng kowchow mami pawi a-i chang khai dow?’ padow pur prakowi enni kowh chu-uüa chauüa nalünta enni kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Nami khin khe enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Aigupta pren kowi a-i uowi mih khin khe aia dow Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi saita bowk khai. Nachenganchepaw a-i kowi dow pe plai a-i khai. Aia dow a-i kowh kim maten kowi katla a-i khai. Naiawng rakowi mami <char style="w">phuchuara</char> hownia dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi a-i sun Takat Pawi reng chekhai,’ napape kown,” pakhai. Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih krawng kowi tabawkah krawm now CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah khai. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih iawng Israeluüa mih kowplan hanow kowchang khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">10. Chapa ta kowng hawi hown Thurai towkah ngare mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Nami kung kowi dow lacher laitali ni kowi kowh uar dawng khe CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh chapa ta maten kowi saita pe bowk khai. Faraw kowh chapa ta hownia kla thawng mih kowh chapa ta pat tawi kowng khai. Nami klen kowi tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten paw tawi kowng bowk khai. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Nami uar dow Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa hown Aigupta pren kowi kowh maru maten awr thowr khai; Aigupta pren paprenma kowi dow kar klow chai ngawnglawng khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kowng dowi mih kim dow lowk paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Nami iak khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi uang hawla now Faraw tek pe mih, “Kawmat lawt büah! Israeluüa kowi pawla now ang maru-uüa hownia lawt iüah. Enni kowh CHAKRAMANG kowi kowchup kowiia büah. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Enchi tek iawng enni kowh chia hai ruapur hawmh paw pawla büah. Now ang kowi paw pela ang <char style="w">prasi</char> iüah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Aigupta maru-uüa dow amatni pren hownia Israeluüa kowi alenma nalawt kownkow krowkah khai. Amatni tek pe mih, “Enni che lawt dowi kowh chalow now anging nakowng bowk kown chekhai!” pabüah khai. <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa mih kawmdi lawkia kowi thela tuah kown mih khin khowm ka büah dowi chekhai. Amatni dow kawmdi lawkia hailawm atawm biatum uan hown thupla now pangkawt kowi uaila khai. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Israeluüa dow Mosi tek iawng Aigupta maru-uüa tut-e kuh uanh, tai uanh hai tawnguat ün lüla büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Now Israeluüa kowi nasaksing sanaah kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta maru-uüa kowi peah saktuak khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa lü mih srui Aigupta maru-uüa peah khai. Naiawng hai amatni dow Aigupta maru-uüa kowh dawngthawnguan khuowila pe bun khai.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Israeluüa mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh Rameses marow hownia lawt hanow Sukawt pami arah prakowi tarü büah khai. Nami khin khe kowh mang miuüa dow kachakuüa nget maru iun 600,000 ia chekhai. Nami klen kowi amatni tut-e dow masiuüa hai ngeuüa paw tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Amatni hown dow akeng maru-uüa hai chia hai ruapur hawmh paw thum aiukma tawi mang pathum chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />Aigupta pren hownia kowh amatni uang pawla mih kawmdi lawkia dow tiama rawng kowi thawpla kawm büah khai. Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt khe sakkrowng büah lai rakowi amatni dow tuah khowm padow kawmdi kowi ia thela büah dowi chekhai. Now tiama rawng kowi kowh nacha nakhamah kown mih paw amatni dow tawngpaw nowng thawpla dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Aigupta pren kowi Israeluüa uowila mih dow 430 ning mowr chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Now 430 ning chur mih ni khe dow Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh maru-uüa maten lawt khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Nami iak dow Israeluüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla now tawi chawngah khai. Naiawng rakowi ning towng kowh Takat Pawi iak dow nakrü uar pauar chi kownkow CHAKRAMANG vüi chowngchowng saksakma Israeluüa asun takla reng chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takat Pawi nasunah kown mih rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Nami kung kowi Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Mami dow Takat Pawi rirow chekhai: Takat Pawi kowi kowh chakkham dow akeng chenchapuüa tawi ia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Nachenganchepaw tangka hown kowh ranah mih nar dow hiah khampha uanpik khai hanow tawi ia cha kown. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Tawkchedow enni tut-e kowh uang tawi uowi mih hai tangka hown kowh uang tawi tangah mih akeng chenchapuüa dow tawi nowng cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />Amia kim kowi chow ngen tawncher mih nami kim kowi tawncher nga dow nacha kown takla. Nami chaknga dow prang kowi naia lawtla kown nadowi. Now ahut paw lowkchow khowm naia klowkta kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />“Nami pawi dow Israeluüa maten mih nasun kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa che CHAKRAMANG vüi nami Takat Pawi tawi sun kown nau kowh chalow now amatni kimchak kachakuüa maten narik hiata khampha uanpik kown takla. Nami kung kowi chiang Israeluüa iawng natawi ia sun kown. Nachenganchepaw hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih maru dow nami pawi kowi kowh chakkham natawi ia cha kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Mami ana dow enni Israeluüa vüi hai enni tut-e kowh uang tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa vüi hown akat sang chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Now Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Israeluüa dow chang khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Nami ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa kowi siphai hawmh iawng Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla khai.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Thurai vüi naap chapa ta kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh uang rik dia mih kachakuüa chah hai tawncher kowi kowh uang rik pen mih ala maten dow ang vüi kowi ap-ah diah. Uang rik dia mih kachakuüa chah hai tawncher kowi kowh ala maten dow ang kowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Nami khin khe Mosi tek pe maru-uüa mih, “Mami ni dow Aigupta nar hownia aia kür hown CHAKRAMANG lawtla enni mih ni chekhai rakowi tukah büah reng diah. Mami ni dow the pe tua mih tawng chap paw enni nacha kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Ani dow enni lawt mih chowbowt. Ani dow Abib la kowi kowh ni uown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />CHAKRAMANG dow Kananuüa, Hituüa, Amawruüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa uowiah mih pren kowi nakowpawla enni kown. Aia dow naiawngün pren nape enni kownkow enni pipu-uüa tut-e khamta sawi khowk chekhai. Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi. Nami pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe mami pawi dow ning towng kowh mami la kowi enni nasun reng kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />“Mami pawi enni sun mih khin khe ranit ni mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown. Now ranit ni kowh ni khe dow CHAKRAMANG vüi enni nachang pawi kown. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Mami ranit ni mowr dow the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown. Nami ranit ni kowi dow paprenma kowi tuah hai the pe tuah mih tawng chap paw naia uowi kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Nami pawi khe enni kowh chauüa kowi enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Mami dow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt mih khin khe ang vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG changah mih srui tukla reng kownkow ang chang mih chekhai,’ napape kown. <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow natukla reng kownkow ruiah now bawng kowi hai kau kowi maru sükah reng chekhai. Nami iawng dow CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow natukla reng kownkow nami pawi enni nasunah reng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aiamat kür hown Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG lawtla enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />Naiawng rakowi nami pawi dow rirow kowi uowi iawng ning towng kowh khin kowi enni nasunah reng kown.<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chapa ta klan lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“CHAKRAMANG dow enni hai enni pipu-uüa tut-e khamta sawi khowk iawng Kananuüa pren kowi nakowpawla enni kown. Aia dow nami pren nape powng enni kown. <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />Nami pren kowi enni kowuowi mih khin khe enni kowh chapa ta hai tawncher kowi kowh uang rik pen mih ala maten dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi enni naap-ah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Nachenganchepaw kawrngaramchük rik pen mih ala takcha kowi ruapur chah hown enni naklanah kown. Klan dowi kowh chalow now nami kawrngaramchük chah kowh ngawng mih enni naklowkta pe kown. Naiawng hai enni kowh chapa ta maten kowi paw enni naklanah ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />“Enni kowh chauüa dow pur prakowi nami auan nalünta enni kown. Nami khin khe enni natek pe kown mih, ‘Aigupta pren kowi anging uowi nar mih hownia CHAKRAMANG dow aia kür hown uang lawtla anging khai. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />Aigupta pren kowi kowh mang dow lainowmma saktuak khawt. Aia dow mapaw nau lawt anging dowi. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG mih Aigupta maru-uüa kowh chapa ta hai tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten kowi kowngta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi ang kowh tawncher uang rik pen mih ala maten hown CHAKRAMANG kowi ang phuchuaah khai, now ang kowh chapa ta kowi dow ang klanah khai. <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow natukla reng kownkow ruiah now bawng kowi hai kau kowi maru sükah reng chekhai. Nami iawng dow CHAKRAMANG kowh rirow natukla reng kownkow nami pawi enni nasunah reng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aiamat kür hown Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG lawtla enni mih chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israeluüa uown lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />Israeluüa kowi Faraw lawtah mih khin khe Thurai dow amatni kowi Filistinuüa pren iawng tiama lang teng chepaw nami tiama iawng pawla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Filistin pren iawng che mang now nami prenchakuüa hown tasen takla mih khin khe saktuak taplan kown chekhai. Nahanow Aigupta pren kowi nakowplan tarawng padow Thurai ka tuak khai. <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih süngrüp süngkangma iawng panow sata Rik prakowi pawla khai. Israeluüa dow cham dowk tasen mih siphai hawmh iawng Aigupta pren hownia lawt khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Mosi mih Josef kowh hut maten pawla bowk khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Josef mih aia kowng dowi rawn nami lawnguan kowi Israeluüa kowi pe khamla sawi khai. Josef tekla mih, “Thurai dow naming nakhet enni ngengche kown taih. Mami pren hownia enni lawt mih khin khe ang kowh hut maten pawla büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow Sukawt marow hownia lawt now süngrüp süngkangma ria re-e kowh Etham pami arah kowi kowkhup <char style="w">tangbung</char> büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi natüng pe tiama kownkow ni-e dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih kowi uowiah now amatni pur kowi rik mang khai, now iak-e dow nanowila kownkow maih lün iowng chunglung mih iawng amatni pur kowi rik mang khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow ni-e hai iak-e ia mang khai. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Ni-e hai iak-e dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih hai maih lün iowng chunglung mih amatni pur kowi hing uowi hüah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="s1">Israeluüa kowi Aigupta siphai hawmh krawiah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: Kung prakowi pacham plan büah iawk lah, now Pi-Hahirawt hai Balzephawn marow pur prakowi pacham khup tangbung büah lah. Nami dow Mikdawl marow hownia sata prakowi kowh mangla mih tiama dawnglang kowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Nakowi enni khup tangbung mih khita hanow Faraw ka tuak kown mih, ‘Israeluüa takuowng mih chowbowt, now süngrüp süngkangma kowi takhang büah mih chowbowt,’ napa kown. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Faraw kowh saktuak mih akhawtma ang nachangta pe kown. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Israeluüa kowi nauang krawiah kown. Nahanow Faraw hai aia kowh siphai hawmh kowi dow ang nape sumah hanow ang kowh kraingra ang tüngah kown. Nami hownia dow ang CHAKRAMANG chekhai pami Aiguptauüa natuk bowt kown,” pape khai. Now Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG tek iawng chang khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Israeluüa powt khai bowt pami satang dow Faraw tawi ta khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Faraw hai aia kowh maru iukuüa dow saktuak taklowi khai bowt. Amatni dow tatek mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow Israeluüa kowi a-i tuk pe powtah khai? A-i mata nar bowk mih chowbowt lowmow!” pabüah khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Nahanow Faraw dow nakamrüt pe aia kowh <char style="w">kawrnga kari</char> kownkow peah ana khai, now aia kowh siphai hawmh kowi kuala now pawla khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Aia dow aia kowh lang iung mih kawrnga kari 600 pawla klen kowi Aigupta pren kowi kowh akeng mih kawrnga kari maten paw pawla bowk khai. Kawrnga kari lowk kowi siphai aluchow mih uowi lowk ia chi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Aigupta mang kowh saktuak dow akhawtma CHAKRAMANG changta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi Faraw dow sakkraingma hown powt khowk mih Israeluüa kung kowkawi krawi khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Aia kowh kawrnga maten hai kawrnga kari, kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih hai siphai hawmh kowi pawla now aia dow Israeluüa kowi kowkawi krawi khai, now Israeluüa uowi rah hown atawnchow re-e kowting büah khai bowt. Nami khin khe Israeluüa uowi mih dow Balzephawn marow hown tatang klowk mih Pi-Hahirawt marow re-e kowh sata pang kowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />Faraw hai siphai hawmuüa amatni kung kowi uang kawikrawi mih dow Israeluüa khita khai. Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow kram lai bowt kowh CHAKRAMANG tut-e nguk büah kar büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Amatni dow Mosi kowi tek pe mih, “Aigupta pren kowi tadupra uowi dowi chekhai bow? Tawngplawng kowchow süngrüp süngkangma kowi nakowngta anging kownkow en uang tuk pawla anging khai? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawng en tuk chang anging khai? Tawngplawng kowchow Aigupta pren hownia en uang tuk lawtla anging khai? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Aigupta pren kowi uowi reng tak khe, ‘Makowi pe uowi anging phülü towbowt. Aigupta maru-uüa kowh nar lup anging chang phülü kown taih,’ pami anging tek en khowk nadowi bow? Mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowng mih lak-e Aigupta maru-uüa kowh nar lup chang phülü mih che lang iung rowt tak chowdiah,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Hangkow kram büah. Uowi phülü büah taih. Tawng iawng chow ani kowh CHAKRAMANG nalawng enni kown mih phai mü büa diah. Ani kowh enni khi-ah mih Aigupta maru-uüa kowi dow tawng nam khe paw enni nakhi-ah iawk kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />CHAKRAMANG matia ngengche mih enni vüi natasen kown taih. Rarimma phai uowi büah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sata tui takra iawng Israeluüa powt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow ang tut-e en uang tuk kar khai? Pur prakowi nathüa kown mih phai Israeluüa kowi tek pe diah. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />En kowh raitua dowkah now sata tui prakowi haiparah diah, now sata tui dow nataak kown towbowt. Nahanow sata phai akang khawngma mih iawng Israeluüa nowng mang kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Aigupta maru-uüa kowh saktuak akhawtma ang nachangta pe kown. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow enni kung kowi nauang krawi kown. Now Faraw hai aia kowh siphai hawmh hown kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa dow ang kowh kraingra tüng müa nachowng kown. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Nami awdara lup khita hanow ang dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai pami Aigupta maru-uüa natuk bowt kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Nakhowk khe Israeluüa pur kowi kowh rik mang reng mih Thurai kowh kramamu dow Israeluüa kung prakowi kowuowi khai bowt. Now uangnim iowng chunglung mih paw amatni pur hownia süt hanow amatni kung kowi kowiowng khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />Nami uangnim dow Aiguptauüa kowh uowi rah hown Israeluüa kowh uowi rah takra kowi hing uowi hüah khai. Naiawng rakowi uar-e khe paw Israeluüa prakowi dow anowima chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Aigupta maru-uüa pra dow aiiuma chekhai. Naiawng kowh Israeluüa uowi rah prakowi Aigupta maru-uüa mih uar prowt chepaw kownowng kowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Akung kowi Mosi dow aia kowh rut mih sata prakowi haiparah khai. Now CHAKRAMANG mih satlawt li kowi uar prowt akürma pe uangah hanow sata tui kowi pe taakah khai. Aia dow sata tui kowi pe taakah lang hanow sata phai iawng akang khawngma mih tiama thawp pe lowk khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Now Israeluüa dow sata tui takra kowi kowh sata phai akang khawngma mih iawng haimang khai bowt. Sata tui dow amatni kowh hawmlawm pra hown lakuai prakowi <char style="w">tap</char> iawng iowng hüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aigupta maru-uüa kowi sata tui limah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Nami khita hanow Aiguptauüa dow Israeluüa kung kowi kowkawi krawi khai. Faraw kowh kawrnga maten hai kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih srui Israeluüa kung kowi sata tui takra iawng kowkawi krawi khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Now uarthowi ria prakowi dow CHAKRAMANG mih uangnim hai maih lün iowng chunglung mih dawng hownia Aigupta siphaiuüa prakowi haitang mü khai, now Aigupta maru-uüa kowi mih peah takrow takraira khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Aia dow Aigupta maru-uüa kowh kawrnga kari khawk ün chowita pe nak khai. Naiawng rakowi Aigupta maru-uüa dow kawrnga kari hown nalün kown mih lainowmma krat khai. Aigupta maru-uüa tatek mih, “Chu, a-i powt bowt lah. Israeluüa vüi CHAKRAMANG matia dowk a-i tasen mih chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En kowh rut mih sata tui prakowi haiparah iawk diah. Nahanow Aigupta maru-uüa hown amatni kowh kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa luk kowi tui nauang limah kown towbowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Nakhowk khe Mosi dow aia kowh rut mih sata tui prakowi haiparah khai, nahanow sata tui dow uarthowi hown akrowksang aiawng uowi iawng kutplan uowi khai bowt. Nami khin khe Aigupta maru-uüa dow hawmlawm pra powt lai, lakuai pra powt lai krawi powt khai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi dow sata tui hown mumta klum khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Sata tui dow aiawng uowi iawng plankut uowi hanow Israeluüa kung kowi kowh uang kawikrawi mih kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa hai Faraw kowh siphai hawmh maten kowi limta bowk khai. Amatni dow lowk iachow paw plai dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Israeluüa tarapchedow sata tui takra kowi kowh bawn kangma iawng haiia mang khai. Sata tui dow amatni kowh hawmlawm pra hown lakuai prakowi tap iawng iowng hüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Naiawng hai nami ni dow Aigupta maru-uüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG lawngah khai. Aigupta maru-uüa kowh uak dow sata pang kowi takuakla pan mih Israeluüa khi khai. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Naiawng hai CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh kür akraingma mih Aigupta maru-uüa luk kowi tawngah khai. Nami khita hanow Israeluüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi kram büah khai bowt. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG hai Mosi kowi owmah khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Mosi kowh meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi maiawng Mosi hai Israeluüa tek meng khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">“CHAKRAMANG kiow hai ang natek meng kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">aia dow akraingma hai ransu-uüa kowi nowngta khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">Kawrnga hai aluk kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi aia dow sata tui kowi pe tamirah khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh kürra hai ang kowh meng chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">aiamat dow ang kowh lawng miia hai ang kowh Thurai chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Aia dow apa kowh Thurai chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">aia kowh kraingra meng ang natek kown.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />CHAKRAMANG dow tasen akiakma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:3">aia kowh ming dow CHAKRAMANG chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Faraw kowh kawrnga kari dow sata tui kowi aia kuakah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">Faraw kowh siphai hawmuüa kowi dow sata tui kowi aia kuakah khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:4">Faraw kowh lang kiak mih siphaiuüa dow sata Rik kowi tamir khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">amatni dow sata Rik kowi kowng bowk khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Amatni kowi dow abüpma mih tui limah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">amatni dow huaklu iawng sata thing kowi nip büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh hawmlawm bawng dow kür akraingma chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">en kowh hawmlawm bawng dow ransu-uüa kowi di-ah reng chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />“En kowh kraingra akraingma mih hown <char style="w">kingküa</char> en miuüa kowi dow en nowng sumta khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">en kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih hown chahau kowi kowh maih kamah iawng amatni kowi kamah khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />En nakawng hownia kowh kawli hown sata tui dow uang tahen khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">sata kowi kowh takling nurlur mih tui dow uang taklu bowk khai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">Talowng phunglung mih tui maten dow tap iawng iowng hüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />“Ransu-uüa tek mih, ‘Amatni kowi ang kawikrawiah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">ang kowh saidawng howkla hanow amatni kowi ang nakrawi saiah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Amatni kowi dow ang krawi ia um kown taih;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">amatni kowh uanh dow ang naretah kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">naiawngün uanh hown apiawma ang nauowi kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Nachenganchepaw en kowh li hown sata dow en hutah khai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">sata tui dow amatni kowi mumta klum khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">amatni dow tui abüpma mih kowi khema iawng nip büah bowk khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, akeng thuraiuüa pungmadawng kowi en iawng mih mia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">En iawng dow chimsaima mih hai akraingma mih amia chow uowi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Naiawng awdara uowima mih lup nachang kown mih kür mia kowh chow uowi?<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />En kowh hawmlawm bawng dow en parah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">now anging kowh ransu-uüa kowi dow krawng iawnta bowk khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />En kowh sakraura achur uowi dowi mih hown en maru-uüa kowi en lawngah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">amatni kowi dow en matia kür hown en kowh arah chimsaima mih prakowi en kruila khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14-15" />Naiawng en changah mih ta hanow akeng chenchapuüa lainowmma takrow hai chür khai:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14-15">Filistinuüa dow kram lai bowt kowh sak chür klukluk towbowt,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14-15">Edawmuüa kowh aluchowuüa dow lainowmma kram khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14-15">Moabuüa kowh akürma miuüa dow takrow lai bowt kowh chürla kluk khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14-15">Kanan pren kowi kowh maru maten dow kram lai bowt kowh rüp bowk khowk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, akeng chenchapuüa dow lainowmma nakram kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">amatni pren hownia en lawngah mih maru-uüa taklen dowi mowr amatni dow nakram kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">En kowh bawng kür rakowi akeng chenchapuüa dow huaklu iawng nauowi phülü kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">Kramra dow amatni luk kowi tamum klum khowk chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">takrow takraira dow amatni luk kowi hing uowi hüah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />En kowh maru-uüa kowi dow en matia kowh hungh kowi en napawla kown;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">nami hungh kowi amatni kowi dow singh pawi iawng en nakowchowkah kown.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:17">Aw CHAKRAMANG, nami dow en kowh uowi rah chimsaima mih chekhai;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">nami dow en matia rut hown kowh en thawpah mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma nachowm mang reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miriam kowh meng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />Israeluüa dow sata dawnglang iawng akang khawngma mih bawn luk hown nowng powt bowk khai. Nachenganchepaw Faraw kowh kawrnga hai kawrnga kari hown kawrnga kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi dow sata dawnglang kowi uowi khe CHAKRAMANG uang plan pawla pe sata tui khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Arawn kowh tuamow Miriam dow risi chekhai. Miriam dow dowkla sawkchow lowk hanow dowm plai khai, now masiuüa maten paw dowkla sawkchow lowk chi now aia kung tawi plai khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Now Miriam dow maiawng krui meng khai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">“CHAKRAMANG kiow hai tek meng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">aia dow akraingma hai ransu-uüa kowi nowngta khai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">Kawrnga hawmh kowi dow sata tui kowi aia pe tamirah khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">kawrnga luk kowi kowh chowm miuüa kowi dow sata tui kowi aia pe limah khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akhakma mih tui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Nami kung kowi dow sata Rik hownia Israeluüa kowi Mosi pawla khai bowt. Now amatni dow Sur pami süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowrik kowi büah khai. Nami süngrüp süngkangma kowi dow sum ni mowr krawi mang büah khai, nachepaw tawng re-e paw krum tui büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Nami kung kowi dow Mara pape mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowting büah khai. Tawkchedow nakowi kowh tui mih akhakma rakowi nowng kham büah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Mara pahai chapah khai. (Mara pami auan dow akhakma pami chekhai). <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa Mosi kowi kamcheah mih, “Khaleng dow tawng chow anging nakham bowt kown?” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Nami laiklow rakowi Mosi mih CHAKRAMANG tut-e kowkar khai bowt. Now CHAKRAMANG dow Mosi kowi iu tüng pe singh pachap khai. Nami singh kre dow tui kowi Mosi kowkuakah khai, now tui dow akham iung khai bowt.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">CHAKRAMANG dow nakowi amatni kowi chaingah khai, now amatni kowi dow peah ana khai. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Enni kowh CHAKRAMANG Thurai lai chün hai aia mik kowi iung iawng enni nauowi kown takla, now aia kowh ana pek sünta hai aia kowh rirow maten enni nachün kown takla. Nahanow Aigupta maru-uüa luk kowi kowh ang uang pawla pe mih rawka chap maten enni luk kowi ang nauang pawla enni kown nadowi. Enni kowh arau abau pe iung enni mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow Elim pape mih arah kowi kowting büah khai. Nakowi dow tuikuam uowi laipre buk, now chekmarawng singh uowi 70 singh chekhai. Amatni dow nami tuikuam ria kowi khup tangbung büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Mukuang hownia kowh <char style="w">manna kawm</char></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />Israeluüa dow Elim pami arah hownia plan lawt khai iawk. Amatni dow Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt kung kowi pre la kowi kowh lacher laitanga ni khe Sin pape mih süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowtowm khai. Nami arah dow Elim hai Sinai hungh takra kowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Sin süngrüp süngkangma kowi uowi büah mih khin khe Israeluüa mih Mosi hai Arawn iüah kowi kamcheah khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Amatchi kowi Israeluüa tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow Aigupta pren kowi uowi khe CHAKRAMANG rut kowi anging tuk kowng dowi? Nakowi dow chaknga puh tawnla se kawm hai chaknga du pat chi anging ka cha reng chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow mami süngrüp süngkangma kowi akhawr hown nape kowng anging kownkow enchi uang pawla anging mih chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mukuang hownia uangchak iawng enni vüi ang naiu pe enni chakkham kown. Nami chakkham dow panichow chak müa taih enni naia lüm kown. Panichow chak klen kowi ahuma enni naia lüm kown nadowi. Ang kowh ana pek enni chün tak chünchü ang nachaing enni kown. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Taruk ni mih ni khe dow pre ni chak vüi naia lüm büah kown, now nathawpla chakkham büah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Nami khin khe Mosi hai Arawn iüah tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Aigupta pren hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow enni kowh CHAKRAMANG chekhai pami aiak sat kowi prakowi enni natuk kown. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Tharau rau-e khe dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra enni nakhi kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowi kowh enni kamcheah mih maten aia ta bowk chekhai. Angching dow iawngpa mih maru chowtaih; tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk kamche angching khai?” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Mosi plan tek pe Israeluüa mih, “CHAKRAMANG mih sat kup khe nape enni chaknga kown, now rau-e dow ahuma nape enni kawm kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi kowh enni kamcheah mih maten dow aia ta bowk khowk chekhai. Angching dow enni tut-e tawngpaw nadowi. Naiawngün enni kamche mih dow angching kowi kowh enni kamche mih nadowi; CHAKRAMANG kowi enni kamcheah mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Nami kung kowi mami laiklow Israeluüa kowi nakowtek kownkow Mosi tek pe Arawn mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi kowh enni kamcheah mih maten aia ta bowk khowk. Naiawng rakowi enni bowkbowk CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowkowi diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Israeluüa hown Arawn taklang mih khin khe Israeluüa dow süngrüp süngkangma prakowi haitang mü khai. Now uangnim dawng kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow khi büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Israeluüa kamche ang mih maten ang ta bowk khowk. Naiawng rakowi mami laiklow amatni kowi kowtek pe diah. Sat kup khe dow nacha chaknga büah kown, now rau-e khe dow du pat naka cha kawm büah kown. Nahanow ang dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai chekhai pami natuk büah bowt kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Now CHAKRAMANG tekah iawng sat kup khe dow uamuk hawmh uang iow hanow Israeluüa kowh tangbung tapat lut uang krawi chawp khai. Nahanow rau-e dow tangbung tapat lut <char style="w">nang</char> uang kla khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />Naiawngün nang kang kung kowi dow dam lip iawng apaklepchow krawng kowi talüp mih khi büah pachap khai. Naiawngün dow nang takheu khe kowh iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Nami khita hanow lowkkowlowk Israeluüa tatek mih, “Naiawngün tawng chow?” pakhai. Naiawngün dow tawng chap chow mih tuk büah dowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Naiawngün dow enni chak müa CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih manna<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Manna </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Hebrai lai hown “Naiawngün tawng chow?” pami chekhai.</char></note> kawm chowbowt. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />CHAKRAMANG dow maiawng pe enni ana khai. Enni bowkbowk kimchakuüa lawk mowr chi enni nalümla kown. Maru lowk ia vüi pathun (aset hown 800 gram) chi tangbung kowi kowh uowi mih maten vüi enni nalümla kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Israeluüa dow Mosi tek iawng chang khai bowt. Tawngbak mih dow ahuma lümla khai, now tawngbak mih dow a-echow lümla khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />Nachenganchepaw khaiah khe dow ahuma lümla miuüa kowh paw chüt dowi, now a-echow lümla miuüa kowh paw e dowi chekhai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow kimchak vüi lawk mowr chi lümla khai.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “Nami dow auai rau kowh vüi hangkow towah büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Nachenganchepaw tawngbak mih maru dow Mosi tek iawng chün dowi; amatni dow auai rau kowh vüi towah ne khai. Nahanow nami chakkham kowi dow dung uang uowi khai, now nami chakkham dow uang nam nga khai. Naiawng chang mih khi hanow Mosi mih amatni luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />Maru kawmuüa dow amatni chowlowkkow kimchakuüa vüi lawk mowr chi rau towng uang lümla manna büah khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawngün dow sat den now ter khai.<verse eid="EXO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Now taruk ni mih ni khe amatni dow pre dungna chi uang lümla büah khai. Amatni dow maru lowk ia vüi pre thun chi uang lümla büah khai. Nami lawnguan dow Israel aluchowuüa mih Mosi kowi uang tek pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek maiawng: Tharau dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh chimsaima mih Tanai Ni naown kown. Naiawng rakowi enni nau heuah mowr mih maih kowi heuah büa diah, now enni nau butah mowr mih butah büa diah. Ta lat mih dow auai rau kowh vüi towah büa diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Now amatni dow Mosi ana pek iawng ta lat mih dow auai rau kowh vüi towah büah khai. Nakhowk khe dow naiawngün mih nam paw nam dowi, dung paw uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Auai rau khe Mosi tek pe mih, “Ani dow naiawngün cha büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ani dow CHAKRAMANG kowh Tanai Ni chekhai. Ani dow naiawngün mih dowm kowi enni nakhi kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Taruk ni mowr enni nalüm kown. Tawkche ranit ni mih ni khe dow enni naka kown nadowi tham. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ni dow CHAKRAMANG kowh Tanai Ni chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Nachenganchepaw ranit ni mih ni khe maru-uüa dow naiawngün nakrawi lüm kownkow prang kowi cham lawt ne khai. Tawkchedow tawngpaw kowkrawi ka büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mün ni tak chow ang kowh ana pek hai rirow pek enni nachün ang dowi kown? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Sünta büa diah, mami Tanai Ni dow enni vüi kowi CHAKRAMANG towah mih chekhai. Naiawng rakowi taruk ni mih ni khe aia dow pre ni chak vüi pe enni mih chekhai. Naiawng kowh ranit ni mih ni khe dow kim hownia amiapaw prang kowi nalawt kown nadowi; kim kowi enni nauowi phülü kown takla,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Naiawng rakowi maru-uüa dow ranit ni mih ni kowi tanai khai.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Israeluüa dow nami chakkham kowi manna pahai tek pe khai. (Manna pami dow “Naiawngün tawng chow” pami chekhai). Naiawngün dow bakkawr nuk powm iawng chekhai, now arawng dow akawma chekhai; achak sowr dow kuai tui hown kowh thawpah mih kawmpah iawng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Nami kung kowi Mosi tek pe Israeluüa mih, “CHAKRAMANG ana pek maiawng: Enni mih enni krungchakuüa vüi lang towta manna kawm pathun diah. Nami dow Aigupta pren hownia CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla enni kung kowi süngrüp süngkangma kowi tawng chow pe cha enni mih enni krungchak maru-uüa nakhila kownkow chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Nami khin khe Mosi tek pe Arawn mih, “Paw puh lowk hanow nami puh kowi tow pe manna kawm pathun now asima kümah diah. Nami dow a-i kowh chuprek chaprekuüa nakhila kownkow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowtowah diah,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Now Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng tow pe manna kawm mih puh dow <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</char> pur kowi Arawn towah khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Amatni kowuowiah kown mih Kanan pren sünghi kowi kowting dowi mowr Israeluüa dow 40 ning mowr nami manna kawm cha büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />(Pathun kowi dow aset hown 800 gram chekhai).<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s1">Huamang hownia kowh tui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Sin pape mih süngrüp süngkangma hownia lawt khai bowt. CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng amatni dow parah mih hownia parah kowi cham süt cham süt now Refidim pape mih arah kowi kowkhup tangbung büah khai. Nachenganchepaw nakowi dow nakhamah kown mih tui uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Mosi kowi nangah se tek pe mih, “Khamah kown mih tui pe anging,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe mih, “Tawngplawng kowchow enni tuk nang ang khai? Tawngplawng kowchow CHAKRAMANG kowh <char style="w">nowng changra</char> enni tuk owm dowi?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow tui sakkrai mih chür khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Mosi kowi kamcheah khai. Maru kawmuüa tek pe Mosi mih, “Anging hai anging kowh chauüa hown anging kowh tawncher hawmh kowi tui sakkrai hown nape kowng anging kownkow Aigupta hownia en uang lawtla anging mih bow?” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e kar se tek mih, “Mami maru-uüa hown tawng chow ang nachang kown? Kra nawng now amatni dow hua hown nakuak ang kown chowbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi pawla pre sum ia now maru kawmuüa pur kowi kowrik mang diah. Now en bawpla Nail aw mih raitua paw pawla diah. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Sinai hungh kowi kowh hua uowi lowk mih luk kowi en pur kowi ang nauang iowng kown. Nami hua kowi dow raitua hown en nabawpah kown. Nahanow nami hua hownia dow maru kawmuüa nakhamah kown mih tui nauang lawt kown,” pakhai. Now Mosi dow Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa pur kowi CHAKRAMANG tek iawng chang khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Mosi dow nami arah ming Meriba hai Masa pahai chap pe ming khai. Meriba pami auan dow “tanang” pami chekhai, now Masa pami auan dow “achaing” pami chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa dow nami Refidim kowi Mosi hown tanang khai. Now amatni dow, “CHAKRAMANG tawi uowila a-i bow, tawi uowila a-i dowi bow?” padow CHAKRAMANG kowi chaingah khai.<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amalekuüa kowi Israeluüa awngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Nami khin khe Amalekuüa kowh siphai hawmh dow Israeluüa hown nauang tasen kownkow Refidim kowi uang khai. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe Josua mih, “En mih a-i pungmadawng hownia klola maru now Amalekuüa kowi kowsen diah. Tharau khe Thurai kowh raitua pawla hanow hungh chut kowi ang kowhawt iowng kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Josua dow Mosi tek iawng chang khai. Aia dow Amalekuüa kowi kowsenah khai. Nakhowk khe Mosi, Arawn hai Hur büah dow nami hungh chut kowi kowpün khai. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Tasen mih khin khe Mosi parta bawng hüah mowr dow Israeluüa awng khai. Nachenganchepaw Mosi iu klata bawng now Amalekuüa awng khai. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi kowh bawng ri lai bowt khe dow Arawn hai Hur iüah mih uang pawla pe huaklu lowk khai, now Mosi dow nami hua luk kowi chowm khai. Arawn hai Hur iüah dow Mosi kowh bawng hawmlawm pra lowk ia lakuai pra lowk ia tawi town pe khai. Naiawng hown Mosi kowh bawng dow sat kup dowi mowr hing tapar hüah khai. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Naiawng rakowi Josua dow Amalekuüa kowh siphaiuüa kowi hing chumta pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami tasen laiklow mih natukla reng kownkow <char style="w">charam tua</char> kowi ruiah diah. Now Amalekuüa kowh ming dow lusa hownia ang nahing mata kown mih laiklow Josua kowi tek pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Nami kung kowi Mosi dow thawp phuchuara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phuchuara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uown Thawp 8:20 kowi kowh footnote mü diah.</char></note> lowk khai, now aming dow Jehova-Nisi pahai chap pe khai. (Jehova-Nisi pami dow “CHAKRAMANG dow ang kowh <char style="w">tamkhuown</char>” pami chekhai). <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Mosi tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowh tamkhuown ruangah diah. CHAKRAMANG dow chowngchowng saksakma Amalekuüa kowi nasenah reng kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s1">Mosi pu Jethraw kiow Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Israeluüa hai Mosi luk kowi kowh Thurai chang pe mih lawnguan srui dow Mosi pu Jethraw mih tawi ta bowk chekhai. Nami klen kowi Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi tawng iawng chow CHAKRAMANG uang lawtla mih paw Jethraw tawi ta khai. Jethraw dow Midian pren kowi kowh uamow chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Israeluüa kowi nalawngah kownkow Midian pren hownia Aigupta pren prakowi kowplan mih khin khe Mosi mih amasi Zipawr hai achapa pre ia kowi a-pu Jethraw tut-e kowsata khai. Now Jethraw dow naiawngünuüa kowi aia tut-e towla khai. <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />(Mosi kowh chapa ta ming dow Gersawn chekhai. Achapa ta uang dia khe Mosi tek mih, “Akeng pren kowi ang cham uowi mih chekhai,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi achapa ming dow Gersawn pahai aia rük pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Now achapa sawi mih uang dia khe Mosi plan tek iawk mih, “Khowng ang mih dow apa kowh Thurai chekhai. Faraw rut hownia kowh lawng ang mih dow aia chowtaih,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi achapa sawi ming dow Eliezer pahai aia rük pe mih chekhai. Eliezer pami auan dow “Thurai tawi khowng ang reng” pami chekhai).<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Mosi dow Thurai hungh ria kowi kowh süngrüp süngkangma kowi khup tangbung khai. Nakhowk khe a-pu Jethraw mih Mosi kowh masi chauüa kowi pawla now nakowi kowkrawi kowi khai. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Nakowi uang towm dowi rawn khe Jethraw mih amawkchow Mosi kowi kowrik phowng pe satang khai. Jethraw tek pe mih, “Ang dow en pu Jethraw chekhai. En kowh masi hai en kowh chapa pre ia kowi uang pawla now en tut-e ang uang tarü khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Now amasi hai achauüa hown a-pu uang ting mih khin khe Mosi mih tangbung lak hownia uang lawtah hanow tabawk krawm se a-pu kowi chupah khai, now nam pe awm khai. Amatchi dow lowkkowlowk tapaw satang palang se tangbung lak kowi kup iüah khai. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Israeluüa prakowi tangila kowh Faraw hai Aigupta maru-uüa luk kowi CHAKRAMANG changah mih srui Mosi mih a-pu kowi lawp pe khai. Nami klen kowi tiama rawng kowi kowh amatni ngarela mih hai tawng iawng chow amatni kowi Thurai lawngah mih lawnguan paw aia dow a-pu kowi lawp pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Now Aiguptauüa rut hownia Israeluüa kowi lawngah khe kowh Thurai chang mih srui ta hanow Jethraw dow lainowmma awmrawm khai. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Naiawng rakowi Jethraw tek mih, “Faraw hai Aiguptauüa rut hownia lawng enni mih CHAKRAMANG dow akiow pauowi lah! <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Enni kowh CHAKRAMANG dow akeng mih thurai lak-e lang kri lang kraing pami kawmat ang tuk khowk. Tawngplawng kowchow panow abawrima mih Aigupta maru-uüa kowh ngare towkra hownia Israeluüa kowi aia dow uang lawngla khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Nami kung kowi dow Jethraw mih Thurai vüi tikah mih uanap hai akeng mih uanap nachangla kownkow uang pawla tawncher khai. Now Arawn hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa maten dow Thurai pur kowi Mosi pu hown taiua cha taiua kham büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi kowi a-pu Jethraw peah prengia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Auai ni dow maru kawmuüa kowi nachet pe tara kownkow Mosi chowm khai. Rauchow hownia sat kup iüp mowr aia pur kowi maru kawmuüa mih iowngla rim khai. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />Maru kawmuüa hown naiawng Mosi chang mih khita now a-pu tek pe mih, “Naiawng khowt maru kawm dawng kowi tawngplawng kowchow en malowkchow en tuk chet pe tara khai? Tawngplawng kowchow rauchow hownia sat kowi iüp mowr en pur kowi maru kawmuüa iowngla rim khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Now a-pu kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa mih Thurai naukrang natukla kownkow ang tut-e uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Amatni che takhowk taran ditchow now ang tut-e uang büah reng, now pre powchak kowi ang hawt chet pe tara reng. Amatni kowi mih Thurai rirow hai ana pek ang tüng ang sangah reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Nakhowk khe Mosi kowi a-pu tek pe mih, “Naiawng en chang mih iung dowi. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Naiawng en chang mih dow en hai en maru-uüa nabowm lai kown chekhai. Nami lup dow lainowmma krat chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami lup dow en malowkchow en ia chang dowi tham. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Kawmat dow ang kowh prengia lai sünta diah, now Thurai paw natawi uowila en kown taih. Thurai hown maru kawmuüa takra kowi kowh ria mang mih lup phai en chang diah: Maru kawmuüa kowh akrat pusa lawnguan Thurai kowi phowk pe diah, <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />now Thurai rirow hai ana pek lawnguan dow amatni kowi en tüngsangah diah. Tawng iawng chow chowm uowi takla mih hai achang takla mih amatni kowi en tek pe diah.<verse eid="EXO 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />“Nami klen kowi maru kawmuüa pungmadawng kowi tating tataing mih maru maten kowi ruiah diah; Thurai kowi kram mih, tek lainowm mih hai <char style="w">bümsua</char> kowi sui miuüa kowi ruiah diah. Now en ruiah miuüa kowi dow maru kawmuüa luk kowi aluchow en nathawpah kown. Tawngbak mih kowi dow 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow, tawngbak mih kowi dow 100 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow, tawngbak mih kowi dow 50 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow, now tawngbak mih kowi dow hamüt ia luk kowi kowh aluchow en nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow kawmat hownia maru kawmuüa kowi nachet pe tara bowt kown. Chili chalachow mih lawnguan dow naiawngünuüa nachet pe kown, now aiukma mih lawnguan dow en tut-e nauang pawla büah kown. Amatni paw tawi khowng kur en <char style="w">kurdik</char> khai rakowi en kowh lup mih nalang howp kown. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Thurai pe en ana mih iawng en che chang hanow naiawngün lup krat dow en naia kham kown taih, now maru kawmuüa paw thaulangma hown chowlowkkow kim kowi naia powt kown towbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Now Mosi dow a-pu kowh prengia pek chün khai; aia dow a-pu tek iawng chang khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Aia dow Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh tating tataing miuüa kowi kloah now thawpah aluchow khai. Tawngbak mih kowi dow 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow, tawngbak mih kowi dow 100 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow, tawngbak mih kowi dow 50 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow, now tawngbak mih kowi dow hamüt ia luk kowi kowh aluchow aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Now maru kawmuüa kowi dow aia ruiah mih maru-uüa chet pe tara khai bowt. Akratma mih lawnguan kowi dow Mosi tut-e kowpawla büah khai, now chili chalachow mih lawnguan kowi dow amatni chet pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Nami kung kowi dow Jethraw mih aiamat pren prakowi mang khai bowt. Mosi dow a-pu Jethraw hown taprai khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s">Sinai hungh ria kowi Israeluüa uowi mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1-2" />Israeluüa dow Refidim pami arah hownia lawt hanow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowting khai. Nami süngrüp süngkangma kowi dow aming Sinai pami hungh uowi lowk. Amatni dow nami Sinai hungh ria kowi khup tangbung khai. Nami dow Aigupta pren hownia amatni uang lawt mih sum la khe chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 19:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Nakowi uowi mih khin khe Mosi dow Thurai hown taklang kownkow Sinai hungh luk kowi kowpün khai. Nakhowk khe Mosi kowi Thurai tek pe mih, “Jakawb kowh chuprek chaprek Israeluüa kowi maiawng kowtek pe diah: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />Aigupta prenchakuüa kowi tawng iawng ngai chow ang changah mih enni khi khowk. Uamu cham iowla chah iawng dow ang matia tut-e aiungma ang uang pawla enni khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Naiawng rakowi enni che ang laiklow sünta hai ang kowh sangbowk laitawm chün hanow ang matia kowh maru enni nachowng kown. Lusa kowi kowh maru maten dow ang kowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw enni dow ang kowh asung lang uowi mih dawngthawnguan naown kown. <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />Enni dow ang vüi kowi kowh chimsaima mih chenchap naown kown; enni dow uamow chenchap nachowng kown. En mih maiawngün laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi dow uang dowm hanow Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi kuaah khai, now CHAKRAMANG pe tekah mih laiklow maten kowbüah kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Nami laiklow tata now maru maten akrowksang tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih srui anging chang kown towbowt,” pakhai. Now maru kawmuüa tekah mih laiklow dow CHAKRAMANG kowi Mosi kowplan phowk pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En hown ang taklang mih khin khe maru kawmuüa natawitala kownkow hai achowngma naia owmla en kownkow uangnim tatma mih dawng kowi en tut-e ang nauang kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Kowplan dowm hanow ani hown tharau mih maru kawmuüa kowi en kowchimsaiah diah. Maru kawmuüa mih amatni kowh dawnguan pacham chuta lah. <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />Now thowirau khe dow pacham kamrüt büah bowk lah. Thowirau khe dow maru maten khi iawng Sinai hungh luk kowi ang nauang dowm kown. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Maru-uüa vüi hungh tapat lut krawi thawp pe rihi diah. Now hungh luk kowi nauang pün dowi kownkow hangah diah; rihi lak kowi khowm padow nauang chawp dowi kownkow maru kawmuüa kowi hangah diah. Hungh kowi uang chawp mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />Tawkchedow nami maru kowi rut hown bawpah dowi kowi hua hown nakuakah kown, nadowi now salangba sek hown naap-ah kown takla. Maru chepaw, tawncher chepaw hungh kowi uang chawp mih kowi dow nape singah kown nadowi bowt. Nachenganchepaw amaisang kra sangrum mowr <char style="w">baw</char> tün kung kowi dow hungh luk kowi uang ia pün büah kown taih,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Nami kung kowi dow hungh hownia uang dowm hanow maru kawmuüa kowi Mosi pe tachim tasaiah khai, now maru kawmuüa dow chu dawnguan khai bowt. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Mosi tek pe mih, “Thowirau kowh vüi kamrüt büa diah. Thowirau mowr mih masi hown miapaw hang taphua taiua büa diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sinai hungh kowi CHAKRAMANG uang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Now sum ni khe kowh rau-e dow muk tün khai bowt, pla paw nowi pliplip khai bowt, now hungh luk kowi uangnim paw atatma uang tamum khai. Nami klen kowi baw paw atünma uang tün khai bowt. Naiawngün ta hai khi büah hanow maru kawmuüa dow kram kowh chürla kluk khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Nakhowk khe Thurai pur kowi kowpawla kownkow Mosi mih maru kawmuüa kowi uang lawtla khai. Now maru kawmuüa dow hungh tut kowi kowiowng khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Now CHAKRAMANG dow maih hailawm Sinai hungh luk kowi uang dowm khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Sinai hungh dow maikhük hown hing tamum klum khai. Nami maikhük dow üa towk maikhük iawng pün lawmlawm khai, now nami hungh dow pahungma<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pahungma </char><char style="ft" closed="false">chür nukluk pami akeng Baibul kowi dow maru kawmuüa chür mih pahai arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> hing chür nukluk khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />Now baw tün dow atün atünma kutplan tün ngamlam khai. Nami khin khe Mosi dow Thurai hown taklang khai, now Thurai paw atünma Mosi kowi klangah khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />CHAKRAMANG dow Sinai hungh chut kowi uang dowm hanow Mosi kowi hawah khai, now Mosi dow hungh chut kowi kowpün khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Kowdowm hanow maru kawmuüa kowi kowtek pe diah. Nauang mü ang kownkow rihi lak kowi hauang pacham kup büah lah. Naiawng nadowi now ahuma nakowng büah kown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Nami klen kowi chang lup kownkow ang tut-e uang reng mih uamowuüa khowm padow natachim tasai kown takla. Naiawng nadowi kowh chalow now amatni kowi paw ang naripah kown chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Now CHAKRAMANG kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Maru kawmuüa mih Sinai hungh luk kowi uang ia pün dowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow chimsaima natowah kownkow hungh tapat lut nathawp pe rihi kown mih en tek anging khowk,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Adak kowi kowdowm hanow Arawn kowi uang hawla diah. Tawkchedow uamowuüa hai maru kawmuüa dow ang tut-e nauang kownkow rihi lak kowi hauang pakup lah. Naiawng nadowi now ang naripah kown chekhai,” pape khai. <verse eid="EXO 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Naiawng rakowi Mosi dow uang dowm hanow naiawngün laiklow maten maru kawmuüa kowi uang tek pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s1">Thurai kowh hamüt klüng mih ana pek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Nami kung kowi Thurai tek mih maiawng: <verse eid="EXO 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Aw Israeluüa, ang CHAKRAMANG dow enni kowh Thurai chekhai. Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup chang hownia uang lawtla enni mih dow ang chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“Ang klen kowi dow akeng mih thurai kowi enni nachup naiia kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“Tawng iawng mih arup paw enni nathawp kown nadowi. Nami dow kuang kowi kowh uowi mih chap iawng pana lah, lusa kowi kowh uowi mih chap iawng pana lah, sata kowi kowh uowi mih chap iawng pana lah, enni nathawp kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />Naiawngün arup kowi dow enni nachupiia kown nadowi, now amatni kowh lup enni nachang pe kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih enni kowh Thurai. Ang dow khowrbown dawma; ang klen kowi akeng chap kowi enni cham chup mih mapaw ang nau dowi chekhai. Sui ang miuüa kowi dow amatni kowh angak ripra sum tali chowng mowr ang peah reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Nachenganchepaw sakrau ang miuüa hai ang ana pek chün miuüa kowi dow athawng aiawng chowng mowr ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura ang natüng pe kown.<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ming enni narük naklak kown nadowi; rük naklak mih kowi dow ang naripah kown.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Tanai Ni dow tuakah hanow chimsaima khangah büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Taruk ni mowr mih enni kowh lup maten enni nachang kown. <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />Nachenganchepaw ranit ni mih ni dow CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai vüi Tanai Ni chekhai. Nami ni dow enni matia lah, enni kowh chauüa lah, enni kowh narma narla lah, enni kowh tawncher lah, enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa lah, amia iawng mih paw nachang lup kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow taruk ni mowr dow mukuang, lusa, sata hai naiawngün lak kowi kowh uowi mih maten ang thawp khai. Nachenganchepaw ranit ni mih ni khe dow ang tanai khai. Naiawng rakowi nami Tanai Ni kowi dow ang peah prasi hanow ang matia vüi chimsaima ang towah khai.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Enni kowh u-pa kowi ringkawah büa diah. Nahanow ang nape enni kown mih pren kowi chowngdawng sakklangma enni nasing kown.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“Hang sai maru sak.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“Hang chang iang.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“Hang ku.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“Klowkchakuüa luk kowi hang thuak dai lai saksi.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“Enni klowkchakuüa kowh kim üa chepaw, masi chepaw, narma narla chepaw, chia hai kawrngaramchük chepaw tawng iawng mih chap paw hang cham irh büah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maru kawmuüa kram Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />Nami khin khe pla nowi hai hungh hownia akhük chai ngawnglawng mih Israeluüa khi khai, now muk tün hai baw tün ün paw ta büah khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow kram kowh alakma hownia iowng se chür büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />Amatni tek pe Mosi mih, “Anging hown en phai taklang diah, anging nachün en laiklow kown towbowt. Thurai matia che klang anging now anging nakowng kown chekhai,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe maru-uüa mih, “Hang kram büa diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nauang chaing enni kownkow aia uang mih chekhai. Aia kowi enni kram now enni nachang angak dowi bowt kownkow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Maru kawmuüa dow alakma kowi hawt ta iowng khai. Now Mosi dow nami uangnim atatma mih prakowi Thurai tut-e kowkowi khai.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nathawp phuchuara kown mih krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Maiawngün laiklow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah: <char style="w">Mukuang pren</char> hownia ang iu klang enni mih dow enni mik hown enni khi khowk. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />Kuh hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih thurai maten kowi nachupah kownkow ang pur kowi enni natow kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />Ang vüi bawn hown enni nathawp phuchuara lowk kown. Nami phuchuara luk kowi dow tikah mih uanap hai CHAKRAMANG hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap enni nachang kown. Nami uanap kowi dow chia, rua hai ruapur mih enni naap-ah reng kown. Enni nachup naiiala ang kownkow ang nakhowm bowk enni arah kown, now naiawngün arah maten kowi ang nauangah hanow ang nape enni prasi kown. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Hua hown che ang vüi kowi enni thawp phuchuara kown nau khai hanow hua mih enni nabawpah kown nadowi. Nami hua luk kowi che <char style="w">rutchün khawkleng</char> hown enni kakta khai hanow enni napiakta kown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />Dawng hown enni pün mih khin khe enni kowh siri natüngla dowi kownkow ang kowh phuchuara mih dawng chak takla dowi iawng enni nathawpah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="s1">Narla tawn lawnguan kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Mami ang kowh rirow maten Israeluüa kowi kowphuang pe diah.<verse eid="EXO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />“Hebrai chenchap maru kowi che changla nar kownkow enni ran khai hanow taruk ning mowr nami nar mih enni nimkrüa kowi nachang lup kown. Nachenganchepaw ranit ning mih ning khe dow paw pe sung plan dowi kowi enni nalawtta kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Enni kim kowi nami nar uang uowi khe che aia lowk iachow taih hanow lawt khe paw aia malowkchow taih nalawt kown; aia uang uowi khe che uang pawla masi khai hanow enni lawtta mih khin khe paw amasi hailawm enni nalawtah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Nachenganchepaw enni kim kowi uowi mih khin khe che nami nar kowi enni kowh narma hown enni pe tachawngah khai hanow aia lawt mih khin khe amasi chauüa kowi enni nakrawi lawt pe kown nadowi; aia malowkchow taih nalawt kown.<verse eid="EXO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />“Tawkchedow nami nar che aia kowh kim iah hai amasi chauüa kowi sakraula khai, now amatni kowi towla now powtta kown nau dowi pami achima tek khai hanow <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />Thurai chup kim kowi nami nar kowi mih kim iah nakowpawla kown. Now kimplawt büng kowi chepaw, kimplawt mawm kowi chepaw nami nar kowi nanüa pe param hanow chukchem hown narui pe kown. Nami hownia now aia dow achowngma pat kim iah kowh nar nachowng kown towbowt.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Narma tawn lawnguan kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Lowra maru kowmatia chama kowi che maru nachangla nar kownkow cham sumta khai hanow nami masiuüa dow kachakuüa nar iawng ranit ning khe paw naia lawt kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Kim iah che nau khai hanow aia ranah mih narma kowi naia chawng kown. Nachenganchepaw tachawng kung kowi kim iah che nami narma luk kowi sak-ih dowi kowh chalow now a-pa tut-e napaw pe sung plan hanow nasata iawk kown takla. Akeng chenchap maru tut-e tarapdow nami narma kowi naia sum kown nadowi. Naiawng che chang khai hanow nami narma pa hown kowh laikham piak pe mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Kim iah che achapa vüi nami narma kowi nau pe khai hanow kowmatia chama iawng nami narma kowi naming nakhetah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Now tachawng kung kowi nami narma hua cham plan paw masi iawk chepaw nami narma kowi chakkham hai khupdip tawngklai hown buk pra kowh kakbak napela kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Ahua che naiawngün sum chap mih nowng pe dowi hanow paw pe sung plan dowi kowi nami narma kowi nalawtta kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Takhüm, tabawp hown tapaw asak mih kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Lowra maru kowi bawpah kowh kowngta khai hanow abawp miia kowi paw nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Nachenganchepaw nakowngta kown mih tuak uowi dowi kowi bawpah kowh kowngta maru khai hanow nami abawp miia kowi naia ripah kown nadowi. Aia dow ang kamrütah mih arah kowi naia powt kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng kowng mih dow ang pe phawah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Tawkchedow nakowngta kown mih kamrüt hown cham saita maru kowh powt mih kowi dow phuchuara kowi kowpowt chepaw nami hownia nauang küngla now enni nakowngta kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Bawp u-pa mih maru kowi nakowngta ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Lowra maru cham ku maru kowh cham sumta khai chepaw, aia tut-e towah chepaw nami kuk mih kowi ka khüm khai hanow aia kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“U-pa kowi pe <char style="w">piati</char> mih maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18-19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18-19" />“Maru pre ia taran kowh lowk ia mih kowi thawngah chepaw, huaklu hown kuakah chepaw kowng dowi hanow naiawng chang mih maru kowi dow nakowngla pat mih ripra naia peah kown nadowi. Ka arau mih maru mawk hüah chepaw akung kowi che raitua hown amang takla khai hanow naiawng chang mih maru kowi maiawng naripah kown: Ka arau mih maru kowh akhin iawm mih sung naiawng chang mih maru kowi nape iawah kown takla. Nami klen kowi arau iung dowi mowr dow ka arau mih kowi nami maru nacham rawah kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:18-19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Lowra maru aia kowh narma kowi chepaw, narla kowi chepaw müa hown bawpah kowh kowngta khai hanow nami maru kowi naripah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Nachenganchepaw anar che singla ani pre ni tak hanow abawp miia kowi naripah kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow anar kowng mih dow aia iawmta dawngthawnguan mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Takhüm khe kum nau mih masiuüa kowi kak kowh mu lak kowi kowh chah piak khai. Tawkche akeng mih che tawngpaw tawi piak dowi hanow nami masiuüa kowh hua hown tara chet miuüa tek iawng nami masiuüa kowi kakta mih maru naiaw ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Tawkchedow nami klen kowi che piak khai hanow maiawng naripah kown takla: sak kowh sak klai, <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />mik kowh mik klai, iüng kowh iüng klai, rut kowh rut klai, khawk kowh khawk klai, <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />towk kowh towk klai, ma kowh ma klai, bawp kowh bawp klai hown naripah kown.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“Lowra maru aia kowh narma kowi chepaw, narla kowi chepaw amik kowi bawpah kowh piakta pe mik khai hanow nami sung dow aia kowh nar kowi paw pe sung plan dowi kowi nalawtta kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Now kim iah che aia kowh nar kowi bawpah kowh letta pe iüng khai hanow nami sung paw aia kowh nar kowi paw pe sung plan dowi kowi nalawtta kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tawncher lawnguan kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Chiala che krawi ting maru kowh kowngta maru khai hanow nami chiala kowi dow kowng pat hua hown nakuakah ngengche kown, now nami chia nga dow miapaw nacha kown nadowi. Tawkchedow nami chia iah mih naka ripra kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Nachenganchepaw nami chiala che krawi ting maru reng mih akiang uowi khai, now chia iah kowi paw tek pe kung kowi nami chia kowi khuowkah dowi kowh cham kowngta maru khai hanow naiawng mih kowi dow ripra nalangah kown. Naiawng mih kowi dow chiala hailawm chia iah kowi paw nakowngta kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Nachenganchepaw chia iah kowi che lü pe iawk khai kowh chalow now kük pe mowr nami chia iah naiaw kown takla, now nami tangka takcha aia kowh sak dow naplai kown. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Nami chiala che ngeuüa kowi cham tingta kowh kowngta khai hanow nakhowk khe paw naiawng nachangah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Now nami chiala che maru kowh narma kowi chepaw, narla kowi chepaw cham tingta kowh kowngta khai hanow nami nar kowh kim iah kowi chia iah napeah tai tangka 30 iun kown takla. Now nami chia kowi dow hua hown kowng pat nakuakah ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33-34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33-34" />“Lowra maru aia laih kowi thai kuam kowh thiala kaneu dowi kowi towla hüah now nami kuam kowi chia chepaw, kawrngaramchük chepaw uang dowh khe kowng khai hanow nami kuam thai miia mih tawncher iah tut-e naiaw kown takla. Tawkche nami tawncher uak dow kuam thai miia kowh nachowng kown towbowt.<verse eid="EXO 21:33-34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />“Maru pre ia kowh chiala tating kowh alowk mih kowh chiala kowi kowngta khai hanow ta sing mih chiala nasumah iüah kown, now sumah mih chiala sung hown kowng khai mih chiala nga dow amatchi pre ia riri nataretah kown. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Tawkchedow chiala krawi ting reng mih aiawng tuk towbowt chepaw chia iah che khuowkah dowi hanow nami chia iah kowi chia kowh chia klai napaw pe kown, now kowng khai mih chia dow aia kowh nachowng kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Dawngthawnguan lawnguan kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Kuk mih kowi dow maiawng naripah kown: chia lah, ruapur lah, cham kuah now ngenta khai chepaw, sumta khai chepaw kuk mih kowi dow napaw pe aiawk ngengche kown takla. Aia kowi dow chia apum kowi tanga pum chi napaw pe aiawk kown, now ruapur apum kowi tali pum chi napaw pe aiawk kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 22:1" /><verse number="2-4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2-4" />Now kuk mih tut-e che cham kuah mih tawncher asing ka khüm khai hanow chia chepaw, kawrngaramchük chepaw, ruapur chepaw pre phow chi napaw pe asung kown takla. Aia kowh che naiawla kown mih tawngpaw uowi dowi kowh chalow now maru nachangla nar kownkow aia matia kowi nacham sumah kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:2-4">“Now kuk mih cham ku khe kim kowi hawt ka khümta kowh bawpah now kowngta khai chepaw abawp miia kowh <char style="w">aprek</char> nauowi kown nadowi. Nachenganchepaw naiawng phaw mih che ni-e chekhai hanow abawp miia kowh aprek nauowi kown.<verse eid="EXO 22:2-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Lowra maru cham thing tawncher khe dowm kowi chepaw, kowmatia kowh krum kowi chepaw lawtta hüah kowh nami tawncher che maru kowh grep krum kowi cham kup kowh cham chata uih-ien pantawn khai hanow nami tawncher iah naiaw kown takla. Aia dow aiamat krum hownia kowh lang iung mih uih-ak aia kowh tawncher chata pe mih krum iah kowi napeah kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“Kowmatia üa towk maih cham pruk kowh maru kowh uih-ien pantawn chepaw, maru kowh kheti bakan chepaw tawi kam khai hanow nami üa iah mih naiawngün kam mih sung naiaw kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Tangka lah, uanh lah, maru kowi enni cham pe mingkhetah mih khin paw nauowi kown. Now enni cham pe towah mih kim hownia paw kuk mih kuta chepaw naia. Akung kowi nami kuk mih kowi che ka khümta khai hanow nami kuk mih kowi pre phow nape iawah kown. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Tawkchedow kuk mih kowi che ka khüm dowi hanow hawt tow pe tangka hai uanh mih kim iah CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowkowi kown, now aia paw dowi pami kowkham sawi kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />“Akeng maru tut-e kowh uowi mih chia lah, kawrngaramchük lah, ruapur lah, khupdip tawngklai lah lowra maru aia kowh tama mih lowra chap khi kowh nami dow, ‘Ang kowh,’ pahai kham hanow amatchi pre ia trui tara chet miuüa tut-e nakowkowi kown takla. Amia iawng mih kowi chow tara chet miuüa tang pe aprek mih nami maru dow alowk mih maru kowi pre phow naiaw kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Dowkah diah sik, maru lowk ia mih aia kowh chia chepaw, kawrngaramchük chepaw, ruapur chepaw alowk mih maru tut-e cham towah khai. Now naiawngün tawncher dow kowng khai, kakmün kakma khai, now iawngpa tama khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawng phaw mih dow amiapaw khi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11-13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11-13" />Nahanow nami maru dow, ‘Naiawng mih lup ang chang dowi,’ pami CHAKRAMANG ming hown nakham sawi kown. Nami tawncher iah paw nami maru kowh sawi kham laiklow nachün pe kown takla. Nahanow nami tawncher iah dow aia kowh tawncher kowng mih klai nami maru kowi naia kük pe kown nadowi. Now nami tawncher kowi che kaurawng uaramchak makta mih chekhai hanow amakna lowra mih ngadi ngasek tawncher iah kowi nauang tüng pe kown takla. Naiawng che aia chang hanow aia mih aiawk takla kown nadowi bowt. Nachenganchepaw nami maru hownia che naiawngün tawncher maru kuta pe mih chekhai hanow aia mih naiaw pe kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:11-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Maru tut-e cham lai tawncher kowh tawncher iah khi dowi khe che nami tawncher kakmün kakma hai kowng khai hanow kowlai miia mih tawncher iah kowi naiaw pe kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Nachenganchepaw naiawngün che tawncher iah pur kowi kakmün kakma hai kowng khai hanow nami dow uang laila miia mih tawncher iah kowi aiawk takla dowi tham. Tawkchedow nami tawncher che tangka hown ngaah mih chekhai hanow nami tangka towbowt nachowng iawk müa kown.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chowm krang uowi krang lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Ahua kham uowi dowi tak mih malauüa, kachakuüa hown taphua taiua dowi tak mih malauüa kowi kuanah kowh phua iuaah mih maru dow nami malauüa pa kowi napeah sung kown takla, now nami malauüa kowi paw hing pünta kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Nami kachakuüa hown achama kowi pe tachawngah kown mih malauüa pa nauta dowi chepaw asung dow nami kachakuüa napeah kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“Maiaklese chang mih masiuüa kowi nakowngta kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Tawncher hown kowh taphua taiua mih maru kowi paw nakowngta ngengche kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“CHAKRAMANG klen kowi akeng mih thurai kowi cham chang phuchua mih kowi paw nakowngta kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“Prenlang maru-uüa kowi angak lah, anowng apowng lah enni naia chang kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni paw Aigupta pren kowi prenlang maru iawng uowila akat mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />“Mamaimow kowi lah, <char style="w">saratchow</char> chah kowi lah enni natowkah akrat kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Naiawng enni changah kowh amatni che ang tut-e uang awr kar khai hanow amatni kowh kar klow mih ang nahawt sünta pe ngengche kown. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />Nakhowk khe ang nakunmarau hanow tasen hown ang nakowngta enni kown. Naiawng hai enni kowh masi hawmuüa dow nachowng mamaimow kown, now enni kowh chauüa paw nachowng saratchow chah kown.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh ngaraima miuüa kowi che enni peah tangka khawi hanow chang marat kownkow pe lowi miuüa iawng enni napaw pe achüt kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Enni tut-e che maru uang pawng uanchow hanow sat kup dowi rawn nami uanchow enni naplanta pe kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />Aia kowh dow nami uan lowkchow taih nakhupah kown mih uowi. Nami uan che uowi dowi hanow tawng hown chow aia namüi kown? Aia che nami uan rakowi ang tut-e uang awr kar hanow aia kowh kar klow mih ang nahawt sünta pe kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow sanara atekma chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“Thurai kowi hang tha hang nang büa diah, now enni kowh kruitown mih kowi paw hang pe piati büa diah.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“Enni kowh luprak hai grep tui hownia enni nau ap ang kown mih nauang ap kownkow hangkow kra büa diah.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Enni kowh chapa ta enni nape ang kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />“Enni kowh chia hai ruapur kowi kowh rik pen mih ala paw enni naap ang kown takla. Naiawngün chia hai ruapur chah dow ranit ni mowr a-u tut-e nauowi kown. Now raiat ni khe dow naiawngün mih ang kowi nauang ap ang kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Enni dow ang lang kloah mih maru chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kaurawng uaramchak makta mih tawncher nga enni nacha kown nadowi; nami dow kui kowi enni nape chaah kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s1">Tara nowm chet lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Anowm nadowi mih laiklow hang cham uet büah. Maru ngak prakowi tawi tangila hai hang tawi thuak dai lai saksi diah.<verse eid="EXO 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />“Angak chang miuüa lang kawm khai pache en paw natawi chang kown mih nadowi. Tara chetra kowi paw maru ngak prakowi tangi mih maru lang kawm khai pache en natawi tangi kown mih nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Ngarai mih maru kowi chet pe tara khe ngaraima pache en natawi tangila kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“En ransu kowh chia chepaw, kawrngaramchük chepaw akeng prakowi cham powt mih che en khi hanow aia tut-e en nakowpawla pe ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Sui en mih maru kowh kawrngaramchük che kurdik di lai kowh cham taphet hüah mih en khi hanow en nakhowngah ngengche kown takla; en natowla hüah kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“Ngaraima mih maru kowi paw tara nowm nachet pe kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Maru kowi hang krawi pe ngak naklak. Angak uowi dowi mih maru hai <char style="w">achinawmma</char> mih maru kowi nakowngla kown mih ripra hang krawi pe diah. Naiawng mih lup ngak chang mih maru kowi dow ang nape plaiah kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />“Hang paw abüm asua büah. Paw büm paw sua khai bowt hanow mik uowi chepaw mik duma iawng chekhai. Bümsua lup dow achinawmma mih maru kowi paw angak prakowi pawla reng chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Akeng prenchak maru-uüa luk kowi hang chang nowng büah. Prenlang maru-uüa kowh saktuak dow enni aiawng tuk towbowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren kowi enni paw prenlang maru-uüa iawng uowila akat khowk chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tanai Ni rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“Taruk ning mowr dow enni nachang üa nachang laih kown, now naiawngün hownia kowh phaw mih enni napaw kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Nachenganchepaw ranit ning mih ning kowi dow üa hai laih paw enni nachang kown nadowi, now naiawngün hownia kowh awr ta phaw mih chap paw enni napaw kown nadowi. Naiawngün hownia kowh uang awr ta phaw mih srui dow enni pungmadawng kowi kowh ngarai miuüa chak müa naown kown, now nami klen kowi kowh ta lat mih dow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh chak müa naown kown. Enni kowh grep rawng hai kanrawn khang vüi paw naiawng enni nachang kown.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“Pasapta kowi taruk ni mowr enni nachang lup kown. Nachenganchepaw ranit ni mih ni khe dow tawng lup paw enni nachang kown nadowi. Nahanow enni kowh chia hai kawrngaramchük paw naka tanai kown towbowt. Now enni kowh narma narla hai akeng prenchak uang chang enni lup miuüa paw naka tanai kown towbowt.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Ang pe enni mih ana maten enni nachün ngengche kown takla. Akeng thuraiuüa kowi enni nachup kown nadowi, now naiawngünuüa ming paw enni narük kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sum chap mih pawi chang rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“Ang vüi kowi ning towng enni nachang pawi sum kat chi kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />Lowk kowi kowh dow the pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi chekhai. Nami pawi sun mih khin khe dow ang ana pek iawng ranit ni mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown takla. Nami pawi dow Abib la kowi kowh khowmta bowkta mih ni kowi enni nasunah reng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt mih dow nami la kowi chekhai. Nami pawi enni sun mih khin khe dow amia iawng mih paw rut khawma hown ang pur kowi hang pacham uang lah. <verse eid="EXO 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />Pre kowi kowh dow Chamüng Pawk Pawi chekhai. Nami pawi enni sun mih khin khe dow üa hai laih hownia kowh enni kaah mih uih müng CHAKRAMANG tut-e enni naap-ah kown. Now sum kowi kowh dow Bowthowk Pawi chekhai. Nami pawi dow enni ki tawnta luprak prowng khe enni nachangah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />Naiawng hai paning kowi sum kat chi enni pungmadawng kowi kowh kachakuüa maten ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai pur kowi nauang takua kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“Enni phuchuala ang mih tawncher kowi kowh vi enni uang phuchua mih khin khe dow the pe tuah mih kawm enni naphuchuala kown nadowi. Now enni phuchuala ang mih tawncher sau dow auai rau mowr enni natowah kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />Rua chah nga dow a-u iawn tui hown enni naengah kown nadowi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“Üa hai laih hownia kowh uih müng kowi lang iung mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chup kim kowi enni nauang pawla kown.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana pek hai laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Enni pur kowi narik mang kownkow kramamu kowi ang nauang chin enni lowk ia kown. Aia dow enni vüi ang kamrütta hüah mih uowi rah kowi napawla enni kown, now tiama rawng kowi naming nakhet enni kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Aia natek enni kown mih enni nasünta kown takla, now nachün pe kown takla. Aia tut-e ang tawi uowi khai rakowi aia kowi enni nakingküaah kown nadowi. Enni che kingküaah khai hanow aia mih nalawt enni kown nadowi tham. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Nachenganchepaw enni che aia laiklow sünta hai ang tek mih srui chang hanow enni kowh ransu-uüa mih ang kowh ransu nachowng kown, now <char style="w">kingküa</char> enni miuüa kowi dow ang nakingküaah kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Ang kowh kramamu mih enni pur kowi narik mang hanow Amawruüa, Hituüa, Perizuüa, Kananuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa uowiah mih pren kowi nakowpawla enni kown. Naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi dow ang napiakta bowk kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />Amatni kowh thuraiuüa pur kowi enni natawi tabawk kown nadowi, now chup paw enni natawi chup kown nadowi. Amatni kowh kawngmu rirow iawng enni natawi chang kown nadowi. Amatni kowh thurai rup maten enni napiakta pe nak kown, now amatni chupah mih hua maten paw enni nadita pe nak kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai, ang kowi chowtaih enni nachup naiia kown. Naiawng enni chang hanow enni kowh chakkham kowi hai tui luk kowi ang kowh prasira nauowi kown. Nami klen kowi enni kowh arau abau maten paw ang nahenta enni kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />Enni pren kowi dow masiuüa paw lawt nau dowi bowt tham, now ting mih paw uowi dowi bowt tham. Chowngdawng sakklangma ang nape sing enni kown.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Enni nau kowiah kown mih pren kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi ang narik peah kramra kown, now amatni kowi dow amawlawma ang nachangah kown. Enni kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi kung prakowi taplan hanow ang nape powtah kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Hivuüa, Kananuüa hai Hituüa kowi naprütla kownkow enni dowi rawn ang kowrik chin pe takrow takraira kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Nachenganchepaw paning sang amatni bowkbowk kowi ang naprütta kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawng che chang hanow pren mih akhaw aklaima nauowi kown chekhai. Nahanow kaurawng uaramchak hawmh nahu lai kown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Enni kowh maru iun hu kowh paprenma krawi ia powng dowi mowr naiawngün chenchapuüa kowi ditchowchi ditchowchi ang naprütah kown.<verse eid="EXO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />“Enni kowh pren sünghi dow sata Rik hownia Filistinuüa pren kowi kowh sata mowr, now süngrüp süngkangma hownia Iufratis aw mowr ang nape enni kown. Nami pren kowi kowh hawt uowi miuüa kowi dow enni rut kowi ang naap enni kown, now amatni kowi enni naprütta kown. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />Amatni hown paw, amatni kowh thuraiuüa hown paw, enni natatow sangbowk laitawm kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />Amatni kowi dow enni pren kowi enni nape uowiah kown nadowi. Enni che pe uowila khai hanow amatni rakowi nakingküala ang kown mih angak enni nachang kown. Amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi che enni tawi chup khai hanow leng kowi tasowk khe kowh iawng enni naown kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm Israeluüa nauta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Arawn, Nadab, Abihu hai Israeluüa lawngtang aluchow mih ranitkawm ia hailawm hungh kowi ang tut-e uang awr pün büa diah. Enni uang awr pün mih khin khe alakma hownia tabawk krawm se enni nachup ang kown. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Nachenganchepaw ang tut-e dow en lowk iachow taih nauang kown, now kowbüah dow hauang pacham tawi lah. Kowbüah klen kowi akeng mih Israeluüa paw en hown hungh kowi hauang pacham tawi pün lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Now nami laiklow maten hai ari aiang maten dow hungh hownia uang dowm hanow maru kawmuüa kowi Mosi uang tek pe khai. Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG tek pe iawng nauta hanow akrowksang tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek mih srui anging nachang kown towbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Mosi dow CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih laiklow srui ruiah khai. Now auai rau murpa Mosi awr rü hanow hungh tut kowi kowthawp phuchuara lowk khai. Now aia dow nakowi mih Israeluüa kowh laipre chen tuakla se hua laipre buk chowkah khai. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi nachang phuchua kownkow Israel klanguüa hawmh kowi Mosi kowchinah pre sum ia khai. Nami Israel klanguüa hawmh dow changla phuchua mih tawncher nga hai sau mih phuchuara kowi kowh maih kowi nawmah now tikah mih uanap pawi changla büah khai. Now Thurai hai maru hown taking tasangra nauowila kownkow taking tasangra uanap vüi chiala paw ahuma phuchuala büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Nakhowk khe changla phuchua mih tawncher vi Mosi pawah dawnglang hanow biatum kowi towah khai, now dawnglang mih vi dow phuchuara kowi aia krawi thetah khai. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Nami kung kowi dow Sangbowk Laitawm Bowih pawah now maru kawmuüa kowi aia phat pe khai. Nahanow Mosi kowi nami maru kawmuüa klangah mih, “CHAKRAMANG tek iawng anging nachang kown towbowt, aia tek mih srui anging nachün kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Nami laiklow ta hanow Mosi mih biatum kowi kowh vi pawah now maru kawmuüa luk kowi krawi thetah khai. Now aia tek pe mih, “Mami dow sangbowk laitawm vi chekhai. Sangbowk Laitawm Bowih kowi arui uowi iawng mami vi hown CHAKRAMANG mih enni hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Nami kung kowi Mosi, Arawn, Nadab, Abihu hai Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa ranitkawm ia dow hungh kowi kowpün khai. <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />Nami hungh kowi kowpün khe amatni dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi kowkhi büah khai. Aia khawkpha dak kowi kowh aphai dow asung khakma mih hua hown kowh thawpah mih iawng chekhai. Nami dow kuangchan achimma khe kowh iawng aruama chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa dow khi Thurai khowk chepaw Thurai dow amatni kowi kowngta dowi chekhai. Amatni dow Thurai kowi khi büah khai, now cha büah kham büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En mih hungh luk kowi uang awr pün now ang tut-e uang diah, now makowi uang uowi nawng diah. Maru kawmuüa kowi natüngsangah kown mih ana hai ari aiang huapher luk kowi ang ruita hüah khowk; nami huapher ang nape en kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Nami laiklow tata hanow Mosi mih aia kowh akhowng mih Josua kowi hawla now tarü khai, now aia dow Thurai hungh kowi kowpün khai. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Lawngtang aluchowuüa kowi Mosi ta tekla pe mih, “Angching uang plan dowi mowr mami re-e hawt uowi büa diah. Arawn hai Hur iüah tawi uowila enni reng chekhai. Enni che takhowk taran khai hanow kowiüah tut-e kowkowi büa diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15-16" />Nami kung kowi dow Mosi mih hungh kowi awr pün khai bowt, now hungh dow uangnim hown taruk ni mowr hing tamum hüah khai. Now ranit ni khe dow nami uangnim dawng hownia Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG iu hawah khai. CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow Sinai hungh luk kowi uowi hüah chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 24:15-16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow maih lün bia laplap mih iawng hungh chut hownia Israeluüa tut-e uang tatüng khai. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Mosi dow nami uangnim dawng kowi kowkup hanow hungh luk kowi kowpün khai. Aia dow nami hungh luk kowi likawm ni likawm uar mowr kowuowi khai.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s1">Taklowp taklangra te vüi uanh pek lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Ang vüi nauang pe uanh kownkow Israeluüa kowi kowtek pe diah. Amatni sak nau hown uang pe mih uanh maten en mih nahawt paw pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Amatni hownia kowh en nahawt pawah kown mih uanh dow kuh, tai, kri; <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la; rua pawi; <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />aringma süah mih ruapurla pik, chak pik aiungma mih; ri singh; <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />maibu towk müa kanrawn sau; tape arah khe kowh <char style="w">nümnap</char> müa sau nathawpla kownkow nam iungma mih chap hai anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than di; <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />uamow lang kri mih kowh ephawd kowrmow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ephawd kowrmow </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow uamow lang kri mih kowh kowrmow panguai athawngma mih chekhai.</char></note> kowi hai <char style="w">owngphowr</char> im luk kowi nachawpah kown mih asung khakma mih ‘oniks’ hua hai akeng mih asung khakma mih hua ün chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />“Ang vüi uowi rah chimsaima mih <char style="w">taklowp taklangra te</char> Israeluüa kowi pe thawpah lowk diah. Nahanow enni pungmadawng kowi ang natawi uowi kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Nami taklowp taklangra te hai nami te lak kowi kowh tawngah kengah kown mih uanh maten dow ang natüng en akuh kown mih powm iawng enni nathawp ang kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Ri singh hown enni nathawp <char style="w">sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</char> lowk kown. Nami dow areng klang pre muk hown dawnglang, now adowng phia hown akro dow amuk hown dawnglang chi enni nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Alak hai prang kowi dow kuh achangma mih hown enni naklaiah kown, now auenh tapat lut mih kowi dow kuh hown enni nathawp pe bawng kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Kuh hown akualuachow thawp pe akli tali klüng hanow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla tali nui mih kowi nachawpah kown. Nami akli dow mapra dam pre buk, paipra dam pre buk chi nachawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Now ri singh hown enni nahui pe akawtlawng pre buk kown. Nami akawtlawng kowi paw enni naklai pe kuh kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow nakawtla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kownkow akli kowi enni nasowrah kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kli kowi hing sowrta hüah kown takla; nami dow nahowkah kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Now ang nape en sangbowk laitawm huapher kown. Nami huapher mih nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi en natowah kown.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Now nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla vüi kuh achangma mih hown enni nathawp pe aküm lowk kown. Nami aküm dow maru kawmuüa kowh angak khu müa naown kown. Nami aküm dow areng klang pre muk hown dawnglang, now adowng phia amuk hown dawnglang enni nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Nami kung kowi sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm adowng pra ret kowi kowh vüi paw kuh hown sawnah now ‘Cherup<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cherup </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dow alap uowi mih chap iawng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw nami lawnguan kowi miapaw tukah kaneu dowi chekhai.</char></note>’ rup enni nathawp pe pre buk kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Nami ‘Cherup’ rup pre buk mih dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm mapra downg hownia lowk, paipra downg hownia lowk enni natowah kown. Nami ‘Cherup’ rup dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm kowi kowh kuh nasawnah hanow enni nathawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />‘Cherup’ pre buk mih dow tatingtang klowk enni natowah kown, now amatchi kowh lumowr dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm prakowi enni nadangah kown. ‘Cherup’ pre buk trui kowh lap dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi naiangah kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Nami aküm dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla luk kowi enni natowah kown, now ang nape en kown mih sangbowk laitawm huapher dow nami tawkpla lak kowi en natowah kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi kowh <char style="w">Cherup</char> rup pre buk mih takra kowi dow en hown ang nauang takrum reng kown, now nami hownia Israeluüa vüi ang kowh ana pek maten ang nape en reng kown.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Chimsaima mih kawm towk rah pawitang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Now ri singh hown enni nathawp <char style="w">pawitang</char> lowk kown takla. Nami pawitang dow areng klang pre muk, adowng phia amuk, now akro dow amuk hown dawnglang enni nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Nami pawitang dow kuh achangma mih hown enni naklaiah kown, now auer tapat lut mih kowi kuh hown enni nathawp pe bawng kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Nami pawitang adak prakowi aret tapat lut apawk ngia enni nathawp pe aping kown. Nami aping kowi paw kuh hown enni nathawp pe bawng kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Now pawitang nui towng akhawk luk kowi akawtlawng sowr müa akli paw enni nachawp pe lowk chi kown. Nami akli dow kuh hown enni nathawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Naiawngün akli dow pawitang dak kowi kowh aping dakchow re-e nachawpah kown. Nami akli kowi dow sowr pe akawtlawng hanow nacham kawtla reng kownkow nami re-e nachawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow ri singh hown nahuiah hanow enni naklai pe kuh kown takla, now pawitang dow nami akawtlawng hown enni nakawtla reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Now pawitang luk kowi kowh towah kown mih lawngpan hai bia, now khamah mih uanap kowi kowh tawngah kown mih biatum hai tuikawng dow kuh achangma mih hown enni nathawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Now pawitang luk kowi dow uang ap ang mih chimsaima mih kawm atungma nauowi reng kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maibu towngh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Now kuh achangma mih hown thawp <char style="w">maibu towngh</char> büa lowk diah. Nami maibu towngh kowi dow achowm müa, <char style="w">achüng</char> hai bia thawp pe büa diah, now klangiung müa pau hai pau khawm paw thawpla pe büa diah. Naiawngün dow pakluchow mih kuh hown sawnah now thawpah büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Maibu towngh kowi kowh achüng kowi dow mapra sum buk, paipra sum buk chi bowkbowk kowi taruk klüng thawp pe amia prek büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Amia prek towng madam pau iawng mih bia dow pau hai akhawm hailawm thawp pe sum buk chi diah. Maibu towngh kowi kowh amia prek taruk klüng mih dow apowmsang thawpah büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Maibu towngh kowi kowh achüng kowi paw amia prek kowi kowh iawng thawp pe bia büa diah. Nachenganchepaw achüng kowi dow thawp pe tali klüng diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Maibu towngh chüng kowi kowh amia prek uowi taruk klüng mih kowi paw amiakrum towng amiakrum dakchow kowi apau hai akhawm thawp pe büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Apau, akhawm, amia prek maten hai achüng dow kuh achangma mih pakluchow hown phengah now thawpah büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />Nami kung kowi dow kuh achangma mih hown thawp pe maibu ranit klüng büa diah. Now naiawngün maibu dow achüng kowi kowh aluk nowm nowm mih bia kowi lowk, now amia prek taruk klüng mih kowi paw aluk nowm nowm mih bia kowi tow pe lowk chi büa diah. Naiawngün maibu dow towkah hanow maibu towngh purdowng prakowi nowi bowk iawng towah büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Now nami maibu kowi kowh bawthi kep müa kaingkep hai maidim towk rah lawngpan dow kuh achangma mih hown thawpah büa diah. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Maibu towngh hailawm naiawngün uanh thawp müa dow bowkbowk kowi kuh achangma mih 30 set ngia nalakke kown.<verse eid="EXO 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />“Mami hungh luk kowi kowh ang tüng en mih akuh iawng nathawpah bowk kownkow pe pe ching kaneu diah,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te thawp lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Ang kowh taklowp taklangra te dow uan powng hamüt rua hown en nape thawpah kown. Naiawngün uan dow adipükchow mih la hown en nape kawngah kown. Nami uan powng kowi dow ruapur pawi hown kowh thawpah mih aruama mih la, arikma mih la hai aringma mih la hown bawng sawt sarauüa kowi cherupuüa pung en nape sawtah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Naiawngün uan powng dow anowksang nakawngah kown. Nami uan powng dow arua kowi aklang pirmi lairaiat muk, now aphia dow tali muk naown kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Nami uan powng hamüt rua mih hownia napawah tanga rua hanow aphiama nasownah atheng kown takla, now ta lat tanga rua mih hown paw aphiama nasownah atheng kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Nami uan pre theng trui kowi dow adowng pra kowh aret kowi aruama mih lasin hown nape chawpah amin sangrum chi kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Naiawng hai aphiama mih uan pre theng mih kowi dow areng pra kowh aret kowi akualuachow nachawp pe amin 50 klüng chi kown takla. Nami uan pre theng mih kowi kowh chawpah mih amin dow pre pra hownia natungah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Nami kung kowi dow kuh hown nathawp pe auowk müa 50 klüng kown. Naiawngün auowk müa dow uan pre theng tatung mih kowi kowh akualuachow mih amin kowi nauowkah kown. Nahanow nami uan pre theng mih hown dow taklowp taklangra te nachowng lowk kown towbowt.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taklowp taklangra te khu müa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Now taklowp taklangra te luk khu müa dow rua pawi hown nakawng uan powng lailowk rua kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Naiawngün uan powng dow anowksang nakawngah kown takla. Nami uan powng dow arua kowi aklang 30 muk chi, now aphia dow tali muk chi naown kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Nami uan powng lailowk rua mih hownia napawah tanga rua hanow aphiama nasownah atheng kown takla, now ta lat taruk rua mih hown paw aphiama nasownah atheng kown takla. Now nami pre theng mih kowi kowh lang iuk mih uan powng taklowp taklangra te pur prakowi kowh marat mih dow nataiap dowi kownkow naawr plan klepta kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Nami uan powng pre theng trui kowi dow adowng pra kowh aret kowi nachawp pe amin 50 klüng chi kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Nami kung kowi dow kri hown nathawp pe auowk müa 50 klüng kown. Naiawngün auowk müa dow aphiama mih uan pre theng mih kowi kowh amin kowi nauowkah kown. Nahanow nami uan pre theng mih hown dow taklowp taklangra te khu müa nachowng lowk kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Uan tanga rua hown kowh sownah mih uan powng dow taklowp taklangra te kung prakowi nataiap dawnglang kown. Nami dow klep kla dowi bowt. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Nami rua pawi uan powng dow adak kowi kowh uan powng lak-e lang klang pamuk chi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi nami taklowp taklangra te dow nahing tamum klum kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />“Nami luk kowi paw naplan khuah pre lüp kown takla. Alüp mih dow aringma süah mih ruapurla pik hown nakhuah kown, now nami luk kowi dow chak pik lang iung mih hown nakhuah kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te ping müa phen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Now taklowp taklangra te ping müa dow ri singh hown en nape ngenah phen sangrum kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Phen maten dow aklang hamüt muk hai aphia amuk hown dawnglang chi en nape ngenah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />Now arup rah kowi narupah kownkow phen maten kowi arup müa khawk nauowi pre buk chi kown takla. Taklowp taklangra te ping müa phen maten dow anowksang en nape ngenah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Mrawkphak pra kowh aping müa vüi dow en nape ngenah phen pirmi phiah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />Naiawngün phen vüi dow akhawk rup rah tai hown en nape thawpah pre rah chi kown. Phen maten vüi akhawk rup rah bowkbowk kowi likawm rah en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Taklowp taklangra te tawngphak prakowi kowh aping müa vüi paw en nape ngenah phen pirmi phiah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />Naiawngün phen vüi paw akhawk rup rah tai hown en nape thawpah pre rah chi kown. Phen maten vüi akhawk rup rah bowkbowk kowi likawm rah en nape thawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Taklowp taklangra te kung pra kowh vüi paw en nape ngenah phen taruk phiah kown. Nami dow taklowp taklangra te satkup prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />Taklowp taklangra te kung pra kowh anui pre nui mih vüi paw en nape ngenah phen pre phiah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Nami phen pre phiah mih dow anui kowi nakawpah kown: Adak prakowi dow areng pra kowh phen hai adowng pra kowh phen kowi nakawpah kown. Nachenganchepaw aluk prakowi dow auowk müa hown nauowkah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Naiawng hai satkup prakowi dow aping müa phen nauowi raiat phiah kown. Nami phen vüi paw phen dak kowi akhawk rup rah tai hown aphiah kowi pre buk chi bowkbowk kowi laitaruk klüng en nape thawpah kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phen kep müa lawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Now taklowp taklangra te ping kep müa lawng dow ri singh hown en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />Nami akep müa lawng dow mrawkphak pra kowh vüi tanga klüng, tawngphak pra kowh vüi tanga klüng hai satkup pra kowh vüi tanga klüng; bowkbowk kowi laitanga klüng en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Naiawngün akep müa lawng dow aluk prakowi pre buk, adak prakowi pre buk nakepah kown. Now alowk mih dow dawnglang kowi mami hownia paipra kowi plawn pat nasowrah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Naiawngün phen dow kuh hown en nape klaiah kown. Akep lawng krua müa akli dow kuh hown en nape thawpah kown, now phen kowi en nape chawpah kown. Naiawngün akep müa lawng kowi paw kuh hown en nape klaiah kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />“Mami hungh luk kowi kowh ang tek en mih powm iawng taklowp taklangra te dow en nape thawpah kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uaniang hai uaniang iang müa chüng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Now aruama mih la, arikma mih la, aringma mih hai adipükchow mih la hown en nape thawpah uaniang lowk kown. Nami uaniang kowi dow bawng sawt sarauüa kowi en nape sawtah cherupuüa pung kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Nami uaniang iang müa dow ri singh hown en nape thawpah achüng tali chüng kown. Naiawngün achüng kowi dow nachawp pe auowk rah hanow uaniang mih naiangah kown. Naiawngün achüng kowi paw kuh hown naklaiah hanow akhawk rup müa tai hown kowh thawpah mih akhawk rup rah kowi narupah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Nami uaniang dow aluk kowi kowh adipükchow mih la hown kowh kawngah mih uan kowi tachawp mih auowk rah dak kowi naiangah kown. Nami uaniang kung prakowi dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla en natow pe kown. Nami uaniang dow Chimsaima mih Arah hai Lang Chimsai mih Arah kowi nakraah kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Nami Lang Chimsai mih Arah lak kowi kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla luk kowi dow en natow pe aküm kown. Nami dow angak khu müa sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Chimsaima mih arah tawngphak prakowi dow chimsaima mih kawm towk rah pawitang en natow pe kown. Now mrawkphak prakowi dow en natow pe maibu towngh kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Taklowp taklangra te plawt vüi paw en nape thawpah uaniang lowk kown. Nami uaniang dow aruama mih la, arikma mih la, aringma mih la hai adipükchow mih la hown en nape kawngah hanow nape sawtah bawng kown. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Now ri singh hown en nape thawpah achüng tanga chüng hanow naiawngün achüng kowi paw en nape klaiah kuh kown. Naiawngün achüng vüi paw akhawk rup rah kri hown en nape thawpah tanga klüng kown. Now naiangla uaniang kownkow achüng towng kowi kuh hown en nape thawpah auowk rah lowk chi kown.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s1">Tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Ri singh hown en nape thawpah phuchuara lowk kown, now nami phuchuara dow anui nauowi tali klüng kown. Areng klang hai adowng phia dow tanga muk chi en nape thawpah kown, now akro dow sum muk en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />Phuchuara aluk prakowi dow anui towng anang iawng achemchow en nape huiah lowk chi kown. Naiawngün anang tali klüng mih dow phuchuara hown panga sang nasawnah kown. Now phuchuara hailawm naiawngün bowkbowk dow kri hown en nape klaiah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Phuchuara kowi kowh plawi kuak müa puh, phuchuara kowi kowh mawngchawng kuak müa uaibak, tawncher vi towk müa biatum, chaknga khowng müa chuk hai mairing pawk müa puh nathawpah kown. Naiawngün bowkbowk dow kri hown nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Now kri hown en nape thawpah lawkrachow<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lawkrachow </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow sawp bawkra pahai maru ka tuak khai. Nachenganchepaw achima tukah kaneu dowi. </char></note> lowk kown. Nami lawkrachow nui kowi dow akualuachow nathawp pe akli hanow en nape chawpah lowk chi kown. Nami akli paw kri hown en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />Nami lawkrachow dow phuchuara uen dakchow kowi natowah kown. Nahanow nami lawkrachow dow phuchuara daw hownia phuchuara dawnglang kowi naawr uowi kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />Now phuchuara kawt müa paw ri singh hown en nape huiah akawtlawng pre buk kown, now nami akawtlawng paw kri hown en nape sowah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow akli kowi mapra dam lowk paipra dam lowk nasowrah kown, now nami akawtlawng hown phuchuara dow nacham kawtla reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Nami phuchuara dow phen hown nathawpah kown, now alak kowi dow akuangma natowah kown. Mami hungh kowi kowh ang tek en mih powm iawng nami dow en nape thawpah kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taklowp taklangra te re-e kowh viadawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Taklowp taklangra te tavir lut en natow pe viadawng kown takla. Now nami viadawng dow uaniang hown en nape pingah kown. Mrawkphak prakowi dow 100 muk mowr napingah kown. Nami aping vüi dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh uaniang natawngah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />Naiawngün uaniang iang müa dow natow pe achüng pirmi chüng kown. Nami achüng vüi dow akhawk rup rah kri hown nathawp pe pirmi klüng kown. Now uaniang iang müa dow lawngha iang hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih auowk rah achüng kowi nachawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Tawngphak prakowi paw nami iawng rowprowp en nachangah kown.<verse eid="EXO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />“Satkup prakowi dow 50 muk mowr uaniang hown napingah kown. Nami pra dow uaniang hai achüng nauowi hamüt chüng kown, now naiawngün achüng vüi dow kri hown kowh thawpah mih akhawk rup rah natow pe lowk chi kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Satlawt prakowi paw 50 muk mowr uaniang hown napingah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14-15" />Nami prakowi dow natow pe aplawt kown. Aplawt hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi dow laitanga muk chi uaniang hown napingah kown. Nami uaniang iang müa dow natow pe achüng sum buk chi kown. Naiawngün achüng vüi paw kri hown kowh thawpah mih akhawk rup rah natow pe lowk chi kown.<verse eid="EXO 27:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />“Nami viadawng plawt vüi dow nathawp pe achüng tali klüng kown. Naiawngün achüng vüi dow akhawk rup rah kri hown nathawp pe tali klüng kown. Now aplawt vüi dow pirmi muk mih uaniang nathawpah lowk kown. Nami uaniang dow aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown kowh sawt pe bawng mih natawngah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Viadawng tapat lut mih achüng maten dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih lawngha iang hown natachawp bowk kown. Now achüng luk kowi dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih auowk rah nachawp pe kown. Now achüng kowi kowh akhawk vüi akhawk rup rah dow kri hown nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Viadawng dow areng klang akawm muk naown kown, now adowng phia dow 50 muk naown kown. Uaniang maten dow akro tanga muk chi naown kown. Naiawngün uaniang dow adipükchow mih la hown nakawngah kown, now achüng vüi dow akhawk rup rah kri hown nathawpah bowk kown. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh natawngah kown mih uanh maten dow kri hown nathawpah bowk kown takla. Tangbung hai viadawng kowi kowh achüng tük müa krawng kowi kowh dupah mih chung paw kri hown nathawpah kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maibu towngh vüi kowi kowh sau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Israeluüa kowi peah ana diah. Natowkla maibu kownkow kanrawn sau achangma mih en tut-e pauang pawla büah lah. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Nami taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi dow naiang pe uaniang kown. Uaniang uat kowi kowh Chimsaima Mih Arah kowi Arawn hai achapauüa mih sat kup hownia sat lawt pat chi CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh maibu pacham mingkhet lah. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma Israel krungchakuüa nasunah reng kown mih ari arow chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s1">Uamow tawnguat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Israeluüa pungmadawng hownia en taimow Arawn hai achapa Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar hai Ithamar büah kowi en tut-e hawah diah. Amatni dow nachang uamow lup kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />En taimow Arawn natatawngla kownkow hai nakala ringkawra kownkow chimsaima mih tawnguat en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Uan sown sarauüa kowi <char style="w">chanlaira</char> atekma mih lümla ang iu pe pe khowk. Nami sarauüa kowi Arawn vüi nathawp pe uamow tawnguat kownkow kowtek pe diah; nami tawnguat dow nachang uamow lup kownkow Arawn kowi nalang kraah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Amatni kowi dow akrüa kowi kowh khupah mih kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih lowk, nami luk kowi kowh khupah kown mih aruama mih kowrmow athawngma mih lowk, nami luk kowi kowh khupah kown mih ephawd kowrmow lowk, nami luk kowi kowh khupah kown mih owngphowr im lowk en nape thawpah kown. Now napawng hai kekawm en nape thawpah lowk chi kown. En taimow Arawn hai achapauüa mih nanowng changla uamow lup kownkow tawnguat chimsaima mih en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Amatni dow naiawngün tawnguat thawp mih khin khe kuh hai aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la natawngah büah kown.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephawd kowrmow thawp krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Ephawd kowrmow dow kuh, aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown nathawpah kown. Naiawngün dow uan sown sarauüa kowh lup chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />Ephawd kowrmow dow pur prakowi kowh uan nga hown kung prakowi kowh uan nga nachawpah kownkow pangkawt re-e mapra lowk paipra lowk chi nachawp pe aleng kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Ephawd kowrmow kowi kowh kekawm paw ephawd kowrmow iawng nathawpah kown takla; nami paw kuh, aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown sarauüa kowi klangiungma nape thawpah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />En napaw pe ‘oniks’ hua pre buk hanow nami luk kowi dow Israel kowh chapauüa ming en nape ruiah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Lowk mih huapher kowi dow amatni uang dia khe kowh taken taria iawng taruk ia ming en nape ruiah kown, now alowk mih huapher kowi paw akeng mih taruk ia ming kenah seklek en nape ruiah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11-12" />Asung khakma mih hua kowi <char style="w">mur</char> thawp miuüa thawp mur iawng dow nami huapher pre buk mih luk kowi Israel kowh chapauüa ming en nape ruiah kown. Nami huapher pre buk mih dow kuh hown thawp pe adan müa hanow naiu danah kown, now ephawd kowrmow kowi kowh pangkawt re-e nasükah kown. Ang CHAKRAMANG, ang pur kowi Arawn uang mih khin khe Israeluüa kowi ang natukla reng kownkow nami ming rui uowi mih huapher pre buk mih pangkawt kowi Arawn nadanla reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:11-12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13-14" />Kuh hown thawpah mih dan müa plan thawp pe pre buk diah. Now kuh achangma mih hown thawp pe leng pre buk hanow nami kuh apherklepchow mih kowi en nachawpah kown.<verse eid="EXO 28:13-14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Owngphowr im thawp krang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Ang kowh naukrang natukla kownkow en nape thawpah owngphowr im lowk kown takla. Nami dow uan sown sarauüa kowh lup chekhai. Nami owngphowr im paw ephawd kowrmow iawng dow kuh, aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Nami owngphowr im dow aklang hai aphia pakar chi nathawpah kown. Nami dow uan pathowrchow mih hown klepah now tali tingnuichow nachangah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Nami owngphowr im luk kowi dow nadan pe asung khakma mih hua tali tan kown. Rik khüa mih tan kowi dow ‘Sardius’ hua, ‘Topaz’ hua hai ‘Karbun’ hua nadan pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />Pre tan mih kowi dow ‘Emeral’ hua, ‘Safir’ hua hai ‘Daimawn’ hua nadan pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />Sum tan mih kowi dow ‘Ligure’ hua, ‘Agate’ hua hai ‘Amethis’ hua nadan pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />Achur tan kowi dow ‘Beril’ hua, ‘Oniks’ hua hai ‘Jasper’ hua nadan pe kown. Naiawngün hua dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih adan müa luk kowi nadanah kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Israel kowh chapa laipre ia vüi hua nauowi laipre buk kown. Naiawngün hua towng kowi dow Israel kowh chapauüa ming narui pe lowk chi kown. Naiawngün dow thawp mur khe iawng nathawpah kown.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22-25" />“Nami owngphowr im vüi dow nathawp pe akli pre buk hanow owngphowr im aluk pra kowh nui kowi mapra lowk paipra lowk nachawpah kown. Nami akli dow ephawd kowrmow pangkawt kowi kowh kuh leng hown nakhuowkah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:22-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Nami klen kowi paw kuh hown nathawp pe akli pre buk hanow owngphowr im adak pra kowh nui kowi mapra lowk paipra lowk nachawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Nami klen kowi paw kuh hown kowh akli naplan thawp pe pre buk iawk kown. Nami akli pre buk mih dow ephawd kowrmow kowi kekawm lukchow re-e nachawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Owngphowr im adak pra kowh akli hown kekawm lukchow kowi kowh akli dow aruama mih leng hown nakhuowkah kown. Nahanow owngphowr im dow ephawd kowrmow hownia natasüt kown nadowi bowt.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Chimsaima mih arah kowi Arawn uang kup mih khin khe nami Israel chapauüa ming rui uowi mih owngphowr im mih nadanla reng kown. Nahanow ang CHAKRAMANG mih ang maru-uüa kowi natukah reng kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Ang CHAKRAMANG, ang kowh ana pek tuk müa ‘Urim’ hai ‘Thumim’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">‘Urim’ hai ‘Thumim’ </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow owngphowr kowi kowh towah mih achachow mih uanh chekhai. Nami dow hua chünchü singh chünchü miapaw tuk kaneu dowi. Nami dow Thurai naukrang natukla kownkow tawngah mih uanh chekhai.</char></note> pami dow owngphowr im kowi natowah kown. Now ang pur kowi Arawn uang mih khin khe nami dow aia sakmowr kowi nauowi kown towbowt. Nahanow Israeluüa vüi ang kowh ana pek Arawn natuk kown towbowt.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow kowh akeng mih tawnguat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Ephawd kowrmow lak pra kowh khupah kown mih kowrmow athawngma mih dow aruama mih la hown kangowh en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />Nami kowrmow aluk pra dow lu krua müa natow pe akuang kown. Nami akuang uer dow natathek naklak dowi kownkow tapat lut asipma nakrawi sownah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Now aruama mih la, arikma mih la hai aringma mih la hown <char style="w">dalim</char> uih iawng en nathawp pe powtuh hanow nami kowrmow adak pra kowh uer kowi tapat lut nakrawi tan pe kown, now nami powtuh takra kowi dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih ro nakrawi chawp pe lowk chi kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Adak pra kowh auer maten dow powtuh hai ro kriaah seklek se tapat lut nakrawi tan pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Arawn uang chang ang lup mih khin khe nami kowrmow mih nauang khupla kown takla. Chimsaima Mih Arah kowi ang CHAKRAMANG pur kowi aia uang khe hai powt khe nami ro tün dow nata kown. Naiawng nadowi hanow aia dow nakowng kown.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Now kuh apherklepchow thawpah lowk hanow nami luk kowi dow ‘CHAKRAMANG VÜI CHIMSAIMA’ pami laiklow mur kowi kowh ruiah iawng en nape ruiah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Nami kuh apherklepchow mih dow napawng pur prakowi aruama mih leng hown natapah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />Maru-uüa uang ap uanh mih khin khe atawima iawng che uang ap uanh khai hanow naiawngün maru-uüa kowh aprek mih Arawn nakur kown. Naiawngün uanap ang CHAKRAMANG nahawt paw pe kownkow nami kuh apherklepchow mih kaubeng kowi Arawn nadanla reng kown.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Aruama mih kowrmow krüa kowi nakhupah kown mih kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih hai napawng dow adipükchow mih la hown en nape kawngah kown. Kekawm dow en nape kawngah hanow nape sawtah bawng kown.<verse eid="EXO 28:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />“Arawn kowh chapauüa natatawngla kownkow hai nakala ringkawra kownkow kowrmow, kekawm hai lukruk mih en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />En taimow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi naiawngün tawnguat mih en nakhup pe kown. Amatni kowi dow naklai pe sau hanow en nanümnapah kown, now en napeah uamow rah kown. Naiawng hai amatni kowi dow ang CHAKRAMANG vüi nauang chang lup kownkow en nalang kraah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />Amatni kowh siri natüngla dowi kownkow kelang hownia thungtawr mowr namumla kown mih iawngpa mih la hown kraksa dawngh en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Taklowp taklangra te lak kowi uang khe hai Chimsaima Mih Arah kowi kowh phuchuara ria kowi uang chang lup khe amatni dow nami dawngh na-üla reng kown. Nahanow amatni kowh siri tüng mih rakowi naka aprek kown nadowi bowt, now amatni dow nakowng kown nadowi tham. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma Arawn hai aia chuprek chaprekuüa vüi ari arow naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowi chimsaiah kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Naia chang uamow lup kownkow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi maiawng lang kraah diah.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 29:1">“Auown kowi aser auowk uowi dowi mih chiala apum hai ruapurla pre pum en napawah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />Now kawmdi lang iung mih hown the pe tuah dowi mih kawm en nathawp pe sum chap kown: Lawk pe kanrawn sau mih pachap, lawk pe kanrawn sau dowi mih pachap, now apalachow ngaiah mih pachap en nathawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Naiawngün dow kharang kowi en natowah kown. Chiala apum hai ruapurla pre pum mih en uang phuchua ang khe naiawngün dow en nauang pawla kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />Now Arawn hai achapauüa kowi taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e en nauang pawla now amatni kowi mih tui hown en nape tasauah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Nami kung kowi dow Arawn kowi en nakhup pe uamow tawnguat kown. Auown khe kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih en nakhup pe kown, now nami luk kowi dow aruama mih kowrmow athawngma mih en nakhup pe kown, nami luk kowi dow ephawd kowrmow hai owngphowr im en nakhup pe kown. Now kekawm dow ephawd kowrmow luk kowi en nasük pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Nami kung kowi dow alu kowi en nasui pe napawng kown, now nami napawng luk kowi ‘CHAKRAMANG VÜI CHIMSAIMA’ pahai arui uowi mih kuh apherklepchow mih en nasük pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Nami kung kowi dow alu kowi en naklai pe nümnap müa sau hanow en nanümnapah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Nami kung kowi dow achapauüa kowi paw uang pawla now en nakhup pe kowrmow kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />Now<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mami lawnguan kowi rik ruiah mih chabowih kowi pre chaing arui uowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawng mih chow towah kown mih tuk dowi kowh akeng Baibul kowi alangma kangowh chekhai.</char></note> amatni kowi paw en nasük pe kekawm kown. Now amatni kowi dow en nakruk pe lukruk kown. Naiawng hai Arawn kowh chapauüa kowi paw en napeah uamow rah kown. Nami uamow rah dow amatni krungchakuüa tut-e chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Now taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi nami chiala en nauang pawla kown. Arawn hai achapauüa mih nami chiala lu kowi amatni kowh rut natangah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Nami chiala dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi en nangenah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Nami chiala vi dow en napawah sangrum hanow phuchuara luk kowi kowh nang tali klüng mih kowi rutchawk hown en nakrawi plikah kown. Now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara daw kowi en napatah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Now riaklah sau, plawng ram lang iuk mih hai asau hailawm akia pre buk mih en napawah kown. Naiawngün dow phuchuara luk kowi en natikah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Nami chiala nga, apik, akih hailawm mih aria dow nacham pawla now Israeluüa kowh tangbung khupra hownia alakma kowi nacham tikah kown. Nami dow uamowuüa kowh angak lawt müa phuchua chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Nami kung kowi dow ruapurla pre pum mih hownia en nauang pawla apum kown. Arawn hai achapauüa mih nami ruapurla lu kowi amatni kowh rut natangah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Nami ruapurla dow en nangenah hanow avi mih phuchuara kowi tapat lut en nakrawi thetah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Nami ruapurla dow en natawpah hanow akhawk hai akawlakchak maten en nasauah kown, now naiawngün alu hai akeng mih tawp ia hown katsang en natowah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Naiawngün dow phuchuara luk kowi en natikta bowk kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh tikah mih uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Nami kung kowi dow alowk mih ruapurla en napawah kown. Nami dow pela uamow rah mih pawi vüi kowi kowh ruapurla chekhai. Arawn hai achapauüa mih nami ruapurla lu kowi amatni kowh rut natangah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Nami ruapurla kowi paw en nangenah hanow avi mih en napawah sangrum kown. Nami vi dow Arawn hai achapauüa kowh hawmlawm pra kowh param iah hai hawmlawm pra kowh rutma hown hawmlawm pra kowh khawkma kowi en naplik pe kown. Now ta lat mih vi dow phuchuara tapat lut en nakrawi patah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Nami kung kowi dow phuchuara luk kowi kowh vi hai nümnap müa sau en napawah sangrum hanow en nalawkah kown. Now naiawngün dow Arawn hai achapauüa buk kowi hown amatni kowh tawnguat kowi en naprak pe kown. Naiawng hai tawnguat hailawm aia hown achapauüa mih ang vüi chimsaima naphaw bowt kown.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“Naiawng rakowi nami ruapurla kowi kowh asau, amai tut, riaklah sau, plawng ram lang iuk mih, asau hailawm akia pre buk mih hai hawmlawm pra kowh thung en napawta kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Nami kung kowi dow kharang kowi kowh kawm CHAKRAMANG kowi kowh en ap-ah mih hownia lawk pe kanrawn sau mih kawm, lawk pe kanrawn sau dowi mih kawm hai apalachow ngaiah mih kawm en napawah apah chi kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Now naiawngün kawm hai chaknga dow Arawn hai achapauüa rut kowi en naap pe kown, now naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi krowngah mih uanap amatni nachangla kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Nami kung kowi dow naiawngün mih amatni rut hownia en napawah hanow phuchuara luk kowi tikah mih uanap hown katsang en natikah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi kowh maih kowi tikah mih uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />Arawn kowi peah uamow rah mih pawi kowi kowh ngenah mih ruapurla sakowuh dow en napawah kown. Now nami nga dow pawah hanow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi krowngah mih uanap en nachangla kown. Nami kung kowi dow en matia vüi en natowah kown; nami dow en kowh chakbak chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27-28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27-28" />“Now pur prakowi dow pela uamow rah mih pawi hai taking tasangra uanap pawi kowi kowh Israeluüa uang ap-ah mih ruapurla sakowuh hai athung nga mih uamowuüa kowh vüi bak naown kown. Nami dow katpaw taklowi dowk mih rirow chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 29:27-28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Arawn kowng kung kowi dow aia kowh tawnguat chimsaima mih aia kowh chapauüa nata ka kown. Now amatni kowi ap pe arah mih khin khe hai uamow lang kri mih rah peah mih khin khe amatni mih naiawngün tawnguat nakhup kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Arawn kowng kung kowi dow achapauüa pungmadawng kowi uamow lang kri mih rah nata paw lowk ia kown. Nami pawi kowi dow ranit ni mowr taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih rah kowi uamow lang kri mih rah ta paw mih maru nachang lup kown. Naiawng rakowi nami ranit ni chur dowi mowr nami maru dow nami tawnguat nakhup kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Pela uamow rah mih pawi kowi kowh ruapurla nga dow pawla now taklowp taklangra te chimsaima mih viadawng kowi nacham butah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Nami chaknga dow kharang kowi kowh towah mih kawm hown taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi Arawn hai achapauüa nachaah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Nami chakkham dow peah uamow rah mih pawi hownia kowh chekhai, now nami dow amatni kowh angak lawt müa chekhai. Nami chakkham dow chimsaima chekhai rakowi akeng miuüa natawi ia cha kown nadowi; uamowuüa chowtaih naia cha kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Nami pawi kowi kowh ruapurla nga hai kawm dow rau-e mowr ta lat khai hanow nami dow maih kowi natikta kown takla. Nami chakkham dow chimsaima chekhai rakowi miapaw natawi ia cha kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Arawn hai achapauüa luk kowi nachang pe kownkow ang tek en mih srui en nachang pe bowk kown takla. Naiawng ap pe arah mih pawi dow ranit ni mowr en nasunah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />Now nalawtla pe angak kownkow angak lawt müa phuchua iawng hai ranit ni mowr ani kowi apum chi chiala hown en nauang phuchua ang kown. Naiawng chang hanow phuchuara mih chimsaima naown kown towbowt. Nami kung kowi nami phuchuara dow klai pe nümnap müa sau hanow ang vüi kowi nalang takra kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Naiawng hai ranit ni mowr phuchuara kowi en mih tawncher hown nachang phuchua kown, now nümnap müa sau klai pe hanow en nalang kraah kown. Nahanow nami phuchuara dow lainowmma nachimsai kown towbowt. Naiawng rakowi nami phuchuara kowi kowh uang kak mih srui dow chimsaima naown kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ni towng kowh phuchua</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Nami kung hownia dow ni towng aningchow mih ruapur chah pre pum chi phuchuara luk kowi atungma en naphuchua kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Nami pre pum mih ruapur chah dow rau-e apum, iak pra apum en naphuchuaah kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />Ni towng rau-e uang phuchua ruapur chah mih khin khe dow achangma mih kanrawn sau aset mih hown kawmdi lang iung mih aset hown 400 gram lawkah mih paw en nauang phuchuala kown. Nami klen kowi khamah mih uanap iawng hai grep tui paw en naphuchuala aset kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Rau-e khe kowh iawng sat kup khe paw nami ruapur chah hown kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap pawi en nachangah kown. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowi chakkham uanap chekhai. Nami uanap nam hown dow CHAKRAMANG awmrawm reng chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 29:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />“Nami tikah mih uanap dow chowngchowng saksakma taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e CHAKRAMANG pur kowi atungma enni nauang phuchua kown. Now taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e ang maru-uüa hown ang nauang takrum kown, now en hown ang nataklang kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Nami arah dow ang kowh kraingra hown chimsaima naown kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />Taklowp taklangra te hai phuchuara dow ang vüi chimsaima ang natowah kown, now uamow lup nachang kownkow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi paw ang nalang kraah kown.<verse eid="EXO 29:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />“Ang dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai nachowng kown, now amatni pungmadawng kowi ang natawi uowi kown. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Nami khin khe dow ang CHAKRAMANG chowtaih amatni kowh Thurai pami natuk büah kown. Aigupta pren hownia amatni kowi ang uang lawtla mih dow amatni hown ang natawi taiua uowi kownkow chekhai. Ang dow CHAKRAMANG amatni kowh Thurai chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s1">Nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Maikhük towk müa phuchuara dow ri singh hown en nape thawpah lowk kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />Nami phuchuara dow tali tingnui en nape thawpah kown. Areng klang hai adowng phia dow amuk chi en nape thawpah kown, now akro dow pre muk en nape thawpah kown. Phuchuara aluk prakowi kowh anui towng dow anang iawng achemchow en nape sawnah lowk chi kown. Naiawngün anang tali klüng mih dow phuchuara hown panga sang en nape sawnah kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Naiawngün anang hailawm phuchuara dow achangma mih kuh hown nasowah kown. Now auenh tapat lut mih kowi kuh hown nape thawpah bawng kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Nami phuchuara dow nacham ia kawtla reng kownkow auenh dak kowi anui re-e akawtlawng sowr müa mapra dam pre buk paipra dam pre buk nachawp pe akli kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow ri singh hown en nape huiah kown, now nasow pe kuh kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Nami phuchuara dow Lang Chimsai mih Arah kra müa uaniang uat hownia uaniang riachow kowi natowah kown; nakowi mih en hown ang nauang takrum reng kown.<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />“Now rau towng krawi mingkhet maibu mih khin khe nami phuchuara luk kowi mih anam iungma mih maikhük Arawn natowkla reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Iak prakowi krawi towk maibu mih khin khe paw nami maikhük mih aia natowkla iawk kown. Naiawng hai Arawn kowh krungchakuüa mih chowngchowng saksakma akhin towng ang CHAKRAMANG pur kowi natowk maikhük kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />Nami phuchuara luk kowi dow ang ana pek iawng thawpah dowi mih maikhük towk müa chap naia towk kown nadowi. Nakowi dow tikah mih uanap, kawmdi uanap hai khamah mih uanap paw naia chang kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Angak lawt lük müa phuchua pawi kowi kowh ngar vi dow maikhük towk müa phuchuara nang tali klüng mih kowi Arawn naplikah kown. Naiawng hai maikhük towk müa phuchuara dow aning kowi pakat chi chowngchowng saksakma uamow lang kri mih nachimsaiah kown. Nami dow ang CHAKRAMANG vüi lang chim lang sai mih phuchuara chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te muh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“Israeluüa kowh maru iun rüa mih khin khe amatni kowh asak klan müa nape ang tai kown takla. Amatni che pe khai hanow rüa maru iun rakowi nauang kla kown mih phih amatni luk kowi nauang kla kown nadowi bowt. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13-14" />Pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa maten dow lowk ia kowi tai hamüt gram chi nape ang ngengche kown takla; tai hamüt gram dow taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah mih naown kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 30:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />Nami dow amatni kowh asak klan müa nape ang kown mih chekhai. Nami dow hamüt gram klen kowi kureng miuüa paw achüt pek takla dowi tham, now ngarai miuüa paw apek nalang e kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Israeluüa hownia kowh napawah kown mih asak klan müa naiawngün tai maten dow taklowp taklangra te lup chang müa kowi natawngah kown. Enni matia takcha kowi kowh naiawngün asak klan müa enni pe mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG natukla enni reng kownkow chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rut sau khawk sau müa biatum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Rut sau khawk sau müa biatum kri hown en nape thawpah lowk kown takla, now nami biatum chowm rah paw kri hown en nape thawpah lowk kown. Nami biatum dow taklowp taklangra te hown phuchuara takra kowi natowah kown, now nami biatum kowi dow natow pe tui kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Nami tui hown dow Arawn hai achapauüa nasau rut nasau khawk reng kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20-21" />Taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowkup kown khe nakowngla dowi kownkow amatni mih nami tui hown nasaula rut khawk reng kown takla. Now maih kowi kowh tikah mih phuchuara kowi kowchang lup mih khin khe paw nakowngla dowi kownkow phuchuara pra kowkowi dowi rawn amatni mih nasaula rut khawk reng kown takla. Nami dow chowngchowng saksakma Arawn hai aia chuprek chaprekuüa vüi ari-arow naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 30:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nümnap müa sau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Nathawpla nümnap müa sau kownkow anam iungma mih chap krawi paw sangrum diah. En nakrawi paw kown mih dow ‘mura<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mura </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow nam iungma mih pram chap chekhai. Mathai 2:11 Kowi satlawt maru chanlaiuüa uang pawla awmrawm sung mih uanh chekhai.</char></note>’ tanga set, singding pik pre set hown akhuai ngia, nam iung mih pram chap pre set hown akhuai ngia, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />‘kasia’ pami singh pik tanga set chekhai. Nami klen kowi kanrawn sau paw sum sen hown akhuai ngia en napawla kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Naiawngün nam iungma mih chap dow paingbawng thawp sarauüa kowi amaisang nape rawah now en nape thawpah kown. Nami dow chimsaima mih nümnap müa sau naown kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Nami sau dow krawi phawkah hanow en nalang krala uanh kown. En nalang kraah kown mih uanh dow Taklowp taklangra te, sangbowk laitawm tawkpla, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />pawitang hai nakowi kowh tawngkengah kown mih uanh maten, maibu towngh hai nami kowi kowh uanh maten, maikhük towk müa phuchuara, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara hai nakowi kowh uanh maten, now biatum hown biatum chowm müa ün chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />Naiawngün dow naiawng hai en nalang kraah kown, nahanow naiawngün dow lang chim lang sai mih uanh naown kown towbowt. Naiawngün kowi kowh kak mih srui dow chimsaima naown kown takla.<verse eid="EXO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />“Arawn hai achapauüa dow nachang ang kowh uamow lup kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow phawk pe sau hanow en nanümnapah kown, now ang vüi en nalang kraah kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Now nami sau dow enni vüi chowngchowng saksakma pat chimsaima mih nümnap müa sau naown kown pami Israeluüa kowi tek pe diah. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Nami sau dow chimsaima chekhai; enni paw nami sau dow chimsaima pahai natuakah kown takla. Naiawng rakowi nami sau dow iawngpa mih maru buk kowi hang pacham phawk naklak lah. Nami klen kowi akeng lup kowi natawngah kownkow nami powm iawng mih sau hang pacham thawp lah. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Naiawng mih sau thawp mih maru kowi dow Israel chen hownia nabatta kown takla, now uamow nadowi kowi iawngpa mih maru kowi krawi phawk mih che uowi khai hanow nami maru kowi paw Israel chen hownia nabatta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nam iungma mih maikhük</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe Mosi mih, “Anam iungma mih chap, anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than achangma mih hai akeng mih than en nacham paw kown. Now naiawngün dow anowksang rawah hanow anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa chap en nape thawpah kown. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Naiawngün dow thawp paingbawng miuüa kowi en nape thawpah kown. Now naiawng thawp mih khin khe awisa paw narawla pe kown; nahanow achangma naown kown towbowt, now nami dow achimsaima naown kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Nami maikhük towk müa chap dow pawah ditchow now nadi-ah kown, now taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi natowah kown. Nakowi mih en hown ang nauang takrum kown. Nami anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa chap dow lainowmma chimsai mih uanh padow enni namüah kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />Mia iawng mih paw kowmatia tawng müa anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa chap hang pacham thawp lah. Nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kraah mih chekhai padow sak kowi enni natowah reng kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Paingbawng iawng dow natawngah kownkow naiawng mih chap tawi thawp mih maru che uowi khai hanow nami maru kowi dow Israel chen hownia nabatta kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s1">Bezalel hai Oholiab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Sünta, Juda krungchak kowi kowh Uri chapa Bezalel kowi ang lang klota hüah khowk. Uri dow Hur kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />Bezalel kowi mih ang kowh lümla ang peah khowk. Aia kowi dow ang lümla hown prengia, tukra, chanlaira hai achap kawm nowng changla mih kür ang peta khowk. <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4-5" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kuh, tai, kri, asung khakma mih hua hai singh hown klangiung klangiungma mih uanh natuk thawp kown. <verse eid="EXO 31:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Now aia kowi nakhowngah kownkow Oholiab kowi paw ang lang klota khowk chekhai. Oholiab dow Dan krungchak kowi kowh Ahisamak chapa chekhai. Now uanh thawp sarauüa maten kowi paw ang peta tukra khowk. Naiawng rakowi ang pe en mih ana iawng amatni mih natuk chang lup kown. Ang pe en ana iawng amatni nathawp kown mih dow: <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Taklowp taklangra te, sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai nami luk kowi kowh angak khu müa sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm, taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowh uanh, <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />pawitang hai nakowi kowh tawngkengah kown mih uanh ün, achangma mih kuh hown kowh maibu towngh hai maibu kowi kowh bawthi kep müa kaingkep, maidim towk rah lawngpan, maikhük towk müa phuchuara, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara hai nami kowi kowh tawngah mih puh bia aikam, biatum hai biatum chowm müa, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />Arawn nachangla uamow lup kown mih vüi chimsaima mih tawnguat hai achapauüa vüi tawnguat, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />nümnap müa sau hai anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than ün chekhai. Naiawngün dow ang pe en ana mih rowprowp nathawpah büah kown takla,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tanai ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12-13" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa vüi Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Ang dow CHAKRAMANG, ang matia vüi kowi chimsai enni mih dow ang chekhai. Ang chimsai enni mih natukla reng kownkow ang kowh tanai ni mih enni nasunah reng kown. Nami dow enni hown ang kowh chowngchowng saksakma mih amat müa chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 31:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />“Tanai Ni dow enni nasunah reng kown takla. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami ni dow enni vüi chimsaima ang towah mih chekhai. Nami ni tawi sun dowi kowi chang lup mih maru kowi dow aia chenchap hownia nabatta kown, now aia kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Pasapta kowi taruk ni mowr enni nachang lup kown. Tawkche ranit ni mih ni dow Tanai Ni naown kown. Nami Tanai Ni dow ang CHAKRAMANG vüi ang chimsaiah mih ni chekhai. Nami ni kowi chang lup mih che uowi khai hanow nami maru kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Nami Tanai Ni dow sangbowk laitawm iawng hai chowngchowng saksakma Israeluüa nasunah reng kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Nami dow Israeluüa hown ang kowh chowngchowng saksakma amat müa naown kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami taruk ni mowr dow mukuang hai lusa ang thawpah khai. Ranit ni khe dow ang tanai khai; tawng lup paw ang chang dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />Sinai hungh luk kowi naiawngün laiklow ki tek pe now sangbowk laitawm huapher mih Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah pre buk khai. Nami huapher pre buk mih luk kowi kowh ana maten dow Thurai matia ngengche ruiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s1">Kuh hown kowh chia chah rup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />Hungh hownia Mosi uang dowm dowi mih kra lai bowt rakowi maru kawmuüa mih Arawn ria kowi tapat lut uang takua talawm khai. Nami maru kawmuüa tek pe Arawn mih, “Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla a-i mih Mosi tawng chow cham own mih a-i tuk dowi. Naiawng rakowi a-i vüi thawp a-i thuraiuüa diah. Naiawngün thuraiuüa mih natüng a-i tiama hanow nakruila a-i kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Nakhowk khe Arawn tek pe mih, “Enni kowh masi hai chauüa tut-e kowh kuh ramseng klüpah now ang tut-e uang pawla büa diah,” pape khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Nahanow maru maten amatni masi hai chauüa kowh ramseng klüpah hanow Arawn tut-e uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Now maru kawmuüa uang pawla pe mih kuh pawah hanow Arawn mih maih kowi chawrah khai, now sawnla chia chah rup khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 32:4">Nami chia chah rup khita now Israeluüa tatek mih, “Tainau-uüa low, mami chowbowt a-i kowh thurai; Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla a-i mih thurai mami chowbowt,” pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Nami khita hanow Arawn mih nami chia chah rup pur kowi thawp phuchuara lowk khai. Now maru kawmuüa kowi aia tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG kowi a-i napeah ringkawra kownkow tharau dow pawi nauowi kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Now maru kawmuüa dow auai rau murpa awr rü hanow tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap pawi chang büah khai. Nami kung kowi dow nacha nakham kownkow chowm büah khai, now cha büah kham hanow taphua taiuala prung se piaw büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Hungh hownia iu dowm diah. Aigupta pren hownia kowh en uang lawtla mih maru-uüa piak bowk khowk. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Amatni dow ang kowh ana pek nuata khai bowt. Amatni dow amatni vüi thawp chia chah rup tüng khowk. Nami chia chah rup kowi dow krawng kowi tabawkah krawm now chupah büah khai, now nami chia chah vüi dow tawncher ün phuchua büah khai bowt. Amatni tatek mih, ‘Tainau-uüa low, mami chowbowt a-i kowh thurai; Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla a-i mih thurai mami chowbowt,’ pabüah khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />“Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi ang tuk chowh; amatni dow laiüama mih chenchap chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Amatni luk kowi ang kunmarau mih dow maih iawng pacham lün pluplup lah. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi mih ang napiakta kown; hauang hang ang diah. Nami kung kowi en hownia chenchap aiukma ang nathawpah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG aia kowh Thurai kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh kür akraingma mih hai en kowh rut akürma mih hown en kowh maru-uüa kowi Aigupta pren hownia en uang lawtla khai. Tawngplawng kowchow kawmat naiawng khowt pat amatni luk kowi en tuk kunmarauah khai? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />‘Mami pren hownia lawtla hanow tiama rawng kowi nakowngta kownkow hai lusa hownia namitta kownkow kowbüah kowi amatni kowh Thurai pawla mih chowlowbow,’ pami laiklow tawngplawng kowchow Aigupta maru-uüa naka tekra kown? Naiawng rakowi sakrauma hown en kowh kunmarau lün pluplup mih prowngta diah, now en kowh maru-uüa luk kowi hauang pawla pe phih diah. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />En kowh nar Abraham, Isak hai Israel büah tut-e kowh en khamah mih lai sam tuak madiah. Amatni kowi dow en matia ming hown kham sawi se en tek pe mih, ‘En krungchakuüa kowi kuang dawng kowi kowh krek iawng nowng rüaah dowi mowr ang nathawpah kown, now ang kham en mih pren chowngchowng saksakma vüi ang nape powngah kown,’ pape khai,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 32:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Nami laiklow tata now CHAKRAMANG mih leta saktuak khai. Aia dow aia maru-uüa luk kowi nauang pawla pe phih kown pami uang pawla pe dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Now Mosi dow sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk mih dowkla now hungh hownia uang iu dowm khai bowt. Sangbowk laitawm huapher kowi dow pre dam trui arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Nami huapher pre buk mih dow CHAKRAMANG thawpah mih chekhai, now nami huapher pre buk kowi kowh arui uowi mih paw aia ruiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />Josua dow maru kawmuüa kowh hek klow plak klow tata hanow tek pe Mosi mih, “A-i kowh uowi rah kowi tasen klow chabak!” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Nakhowk khe Mosi tek pe mih, “Nami dow tasen awng khe kowh how mih klow nadowi; tasen sum khe kowh kar mih klow paw nadowi. Ang ta mih dow meng klow chowtaih,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Now amatni kowh <char style="w">tangbung khup rah</char> ria kowi uang tatawn hanow maru kawmuüa plai sawmlawm mih hai chia chah rup mih Mosi uang khi khai. Nami khita now Mosi mih lainowmma kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia rut kowi kowh huapher pre buk mih iu theuta khai, now nami huapher pre buk dow teu khai. Naiawng aia chang mih dow hungh tut kowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Nami chia chah rup dow Mosi dowkah hanow maih kowi nawmta pe khai. Nami maih kam na dow adima changah now tui kowi phiowah khai, now nami tui dow Israeluüa kowi kür hown pe khamah khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Arawn kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Naiawngün maru-uüa tawng chow changta en khai? Tawngplawng kowchow naiawngünuüa kowi naiawng khowt mih angak prakowi en tuk pawla khai?” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Now Arawn tek pe mih, “Aw <char style="w">chakramang</char>, hang kunmarau diah. Maiawngün maru-uüa kowh saktuak dow angak prakowi kangowh mih en aiawng tuk towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Amatni dow ang tut-e uangah now tek ang mih, ‘Aigupta pren hownia kowh uang lawtla a-i mih Mosi tawng chow cham own mih a-i tuk dowi. Naiawng rakowi natüng a-i tiama hanow nakruila a-i kownkow thawp a-i thurai diah,’ pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Nami ang tata hanow kuh hown kowh tatawng müa uowi mih nauang pawla ang kownkow ang tek pe khai. Now kuh hown kowh tatawng müa uanh uang pawla ang büah hanow naiawngün kuh mih maih kowi ang nawmah khai, now nami chia chah rup dow uang awr phaw khai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Now maru kawmuüa kowi amatni nau iawng Arawn pe uowiah mih chowbowt pami Mosi tuk khai. Amatni kowi Arawn nowng khet dowi bowt rakowi amatni dow ransu-uüa tut-e chowng rensi kau mih chowbowt padow Mosi ka tuak khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Naiawng rakowi tangbung khup rah plawt re-e Mosi iowngah now tek pe mih, “Enni pungmadawng kowi CHAKRAMANG kowi tangila mih nget ang tut-e uang büa diah,” pakhai. Nahanow Levi krungchakuüa nget dow Mosi prakowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Nakhowk khe Levi krungchakuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai tek mih, ‘Enni bowkbowk kelang kowi uaila saidawng büa diah, now tangbung maten kowi krawi kowi hanow krum mih srui kowi saila diah. Tainau lah, auiua lah, kimping namkhet lah khi mih srui kowi saila diah,’ pakhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />Now Levi krungchakuüa dow Mosi ana pek iawng chang khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi nami ni dow kachakuüa nget 3,000 ia ngia kowng khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Nami kung kowi Levi krungchakuüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG dow aia kowh lup enni naia changla kownkow ani mih lang klota enni khai bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow kowmatia chauüa hai tainau-uüa kowi khowm padow nasaita kownkow kung prakowi enni sut dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ani mih CHAKRAMANG hownia enni ka prasi khowk,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG tut-e Israeluüa vüi Mosi kowlü lawt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Now auai ni khe Mosi tek pe maru kawmuüa mih, “Lainowmma enni chang angak khai. Nachenganchepaw enni kowh angak nalawt enni tak chünchü kawmat hungh kowi ang kowpünah hanow CHAKRAMANG tut-e ang kowchang enni lup tak,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e Mosi kowplan kowiah now tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami maru-uüa lainowmma changta angak khai bowt. Amatni dow kuh hown kowmatia vüi thawp thurai rup khai. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Nachenganchepaw sakrauma hown amatni kowh angak lawtta pe diah. En che amatni kowh angak lawtta pe dowi kowh chalow now en maru-uüa kowh ming tang bowih hownia ang kowh ming phiawkta diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Kingküa ang mih maru-uüa kowh ming chowtaih ang maru-uüa kowh ming tang bowih hownia ang naphiawkta kown. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Sünta, kawmat kowplan hanow maru kawmuüa kowi ang tek en mih arah kowi kowpawla diah. Ang kowh kramamu mih natawi tüng enni tiama kown taih. Chang angak miuüa kowi dow akhin khe ang napeah ripra kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Arawn kowi pe thawpah chia chah rup mih rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow maru kawmuüa luk kowi phih kraingma uang chin pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="s">Sinai hungh hownia nalawt kown mih ana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Aigupta pren hownia kowh en uang lawtla mih maru-uüa kowi mami Sinai hungh hownia pawla now ang khamah mih pren kowi kowpowtla diah. Nami pren dow Abraham, Isak hai Jakawb büah kowh krungchakuüa kowi ang napeah kown pahai ang takham khai. <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />En dowi rawn ang uang iu chin en kramamu lowk kown, now nami pren kowi kowh hawt iawng uowi mih Kananuüa, Amawruüa, Hituüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa kowi ang naprütta kown. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Nakowi dow iawn tui, kuai tui hai tawng chap paw akhawr uowi dowi chekhai. Nachenganchepaw enni hown dow ang tawi dowi tham. Tawngplawng kowchow panow enni dow laiüama mih chenchap chekhai. Enni hown che ang tawi now tiama rawng kowi ang nakowngta enni bowk kown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />Nami phih laiklow tata hanow maru kawmuüa dow kar büah nguk büah khai. Now amatni kowh tatawng müa paw ü büah dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow Israeluüa kowi natek pe kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Enni dow laiüama mih chenchap chekhai. Enni hown che ang taiua uowi nawngchow hanow ang nakowngta enni bowk kown chekhai. Naiawng rakowi enni kowh tatawng müa maten kawmat klüpta büa diah. Now tawng chow ang nachang enni kown mih ang napaw tuak kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa dow Sinai hungh hownia lawt büah mih khin hownia bowt now tatawng müa paw ü büah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takrumra te</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />Israeluüa dow tiama rawng kowi kowh amatni cham tanaira re-e khup tangbung büah reng chekhai. Now tangbung khup rah uat kowi alak sangrumchow re-e Mosi mih cham khup tangbung reng chekhai. Nami tangbung kowi dow takrumra te pahai Mosi chap pe ming khai. Lowra sia CHAKRAMANG kowi lünta kown nau miuüa dow nami takrumra te kowi kowkowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Nami takrumra te kowi Mosi kowkowi towng maru kawmuüa mih amatni chowlowkkow tangbung plawt kowi hawt iowng reng chekhai, now alak kowi Mosi kup dowi mowr dow maru kawmuüa tang müah büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Takrumra te lak kowi Mosi kowkup kung kowi dow uangnim iowng chunglung mih uang iu dowm reng, now Mosi hown CHAKRAMANG taklang mowr nami uangnim iowng chunglung mih dow takrumra te plawt kowi hing uowi hüah reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />Nami uangnim iowng chunglung mih che takrumra te plawt kowi maru kawmuüa khi hanow amatni dow chowlowkkow tangbung plawt hownia krawng kowi tabawkah krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Auiua hown tatingtang klowk maru talawp khe kowh iawng CHAKRAMANG mih Mosi hown talawp reng chekhai. Now ki talawp kung kowi dow Israeluüa kowh tangbung kowi Mosi kowplan khai iawk. Nachenganchepaw Nun kowh chapa Josua dow takrumra te hownia uang tawi lawt dowi chekhai. Nami Josua klanguüa dow Mosi kowh akhowng mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG natüng pe aia kowh kraingra kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Akat khe Mosi tek pe CHAKRAMANG mih, “En khamah mih pren kowi mami maru-uüa kowi nakowpawla kown mih en tek ang khai. Tawkchedow ang hown amia iawng mih kowi chow en natawi chin ang kown? Nachenganchepaw ang kowi dow aiungma en tuk pami hai en sak-ih ang reng pami en tek ang khai. <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />En che sak-ih ang khai hanow sakrauma hown en naukrang pe tuk ang diah. Nahanow aiungma ang natuk en kown, now en nasak-ih ang reng kown towbowt. Mami chenchap dow en kowh chowtaih pami sak kowi towah reng diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Now CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Ang matia ngengche en hown natawi kown, now ang nape en thaulangra kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Mosi tek pe mih, “Anging hown che en tawi dowi hanow hauang chin anging diah. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Anging hown che en tawi dowi hanow ang luk kowi hai en kowh maru-uüa luk kowi en sak-ih reng pami akeng chenchapuüa tuk kown nadowi tham. Lusa kowi kowh akeng chenchap maten lak-e alangma anging uowi mih dow en tawi uowila anging kowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En tek iawng ang nachang en kown taih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en luk kowi dow ang kowh saksing sanara uowi reng chekhai, now en kowi dow aiungma ang tuk en chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Now Mosi tek pe mih, “Naiawng chekhai hanow sakrauma hown en kowh kraingra tüng ang diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “En pur iawng ang uang mang kown. Nakhowk khe ang kowh iungra maten ang natüng en kown, now ang ming dow ‘CHAKRAMANG’ pami ang naphuang en kown. Ang nauah mih maru kowi dow ang nasaksingah kown, now ang nauah mih maru kowi dow ang nasanaah kown. <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Nachenganchepaw ang kowh lumowr dow en nakhi kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow khi ang lumowr kung kowi dow amiapaw ia sing dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 33:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Now CHAKRAMANG plan tek pe mih, “Ang hown atawnchow mih huamang uowi lowk. Mami huamang luk kowi en nauang iowng kown. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />En pur iawng ang kowh kraingra uang mih khin khe dow huamang talak mih takra kowi ang natow en kown, now ang klenla en dowi mowr dow ang kowh rut hown ang natung en kown. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Now ang pawta rut kung kowi dow ang kowh kum en nakhi kown. Nachenganchepaw ang kowh lumowr dow en nakhi kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s1">Mosi kowi Thurai peah huapher sar mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Auown khe kowh huapher pre buk mih iawng kawmat paw plan thawp huapher sar pre buk iawk diah. Nami huapher sar kowi en kuakta mih huapher kowi kowh arui uowi mih laiklow maten ang naplan rui en iawk kown. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Naiawng rakowi tharau rau-e kamrütia hown Sinai hungh chut kowi ang tut-e en nauang kown. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Nakhowk khe amia iawng mih maru paw en hown uang ia tawi kown nadowi, now nami hungh kowi paw akeng mih maru-uüa kowi naia khi kown nadowi. Nami klen kowi chia, rua hai ruapur hawmh paw nami hungh ria kowi nauang ia taw kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Now Mosi dow auown khe kowh huapher pre buk mih iawng plan thawp huapher pre buk khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng rau-e murpa Sinai hungh kowi kowpün khai. Aia dow nami huapher pre buk mih paw pawla khai. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG mih uangnim dawng iawng uang dowm hanow Mosi re-e uang iowng khai, now “CHAKRAMANG” pahai aia ming dow phuang pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Aia dow Mosi pur iawng haimang se maiawng phuang pe khai, “CHAKRAMANG, CHAKRAMANG, CHAKRAMANG dow saksingra hai sanara atekma mih Thurai. Aia dow kunmarau naklak dowi. Aia kowh sakraura hai kaah sakowm mih rah dow achur uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow athawng aiawng chowng mowr uowi reng; aia dow atawi ama ün, chün lai dowi mih ün, angak ün lawt reng chekhai. Tawkche aprek uowi miuüa kowi dow aia ripah reng chekhai; aia dow u-pa kowh angak sung chauüa luk kowi sum tali chowng mowr peah ripra reng chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Nami laiklow tata hown akrowksang Mosi mih krawng kowi tabawk krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupiiaah khai. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />CHAKRAMANG kowi aia tek pe mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG, ang luk kowi che en kowh saksing sanara uowi khai kowh chalow now anging hown tawi diah. Mami maru-uüa dow laiüama mih chenchap pami ang tuk chowh. Nachenganchepaw anging kowh angak mih lawtta anging diah. Now en matia kowh maru iawng hai paw anging iawk diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Plan rui pe sangbowk laitawm lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “En maru-uüa hown kawmat ang towta sangbowk laitawm khowk. Amatni pur kowi ang nachang pe awdara lup kown. Nami awdara lup dow lusa kowi amia iawng mih chenchap pur kowi paw ang chang dowi tak chekhai. Now enni vüi ang nachangah kown mih lup dow mün khowt chow kraingra uowi khai pami enni tut-e kowh tawi uowi mih akeng chenchapuüa nakhi kown.<verse eid="EXO 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />“Ani kowh ang nape enni kown mih ana enni nachünah kown takla. Amawruüa, Kananuüa, Hituüa, Perizuüa, Hivuüa hai Jebusuüa kowi dow enni pur hownia ang naprütta kown. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Kaneu diah! Enni kowuowiah kown mih prenchakuüa hown tawng iawng mih sangbowk laitawm paw enni natow kown nadowi; enni che tow hanow enni natauowk kown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Amatni kowh phuchuara ün enni napiakta pe kown. Amatni chupiiaah mih hua ün enni nadita pe nak kown, now amatni phuchuaah mih Asera limpu ün paw enni nakripta pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />Akeng mih thurai kowi enni nachupiia kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang CHAKRAMANG dow khowrbown dawma; ang klen kowi akeng chap kowi enni cham chup mih mapaw ang nau dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />“Naiawngün che enni piakta bowk dowi hanow nami prenchakuüa hown enni natatow sangbowk laitawm chepaw naia kown. Amatni dow amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi nachup naiia büah kown, now amatni kowh thuraiuüa vüi naphuchua tawncher büah kown. Nami khin khe nahawla enni hawm chak hanow amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi kowh phuchuala mih ngar enni natawi cha kown chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Naiawngün che enni piakta bowk dowi hanow enni nachangla iaumow kownkow amatni kowh chamauüa kowi enni paw pe chepaw naia kown. Naiawngün masiuüa dow amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi nachupiia kown, now enni kowh chapauüa kowi paw amatni kowh thuraiuüa kowi nachupiia kownkow napawla kown.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“Lawngha hown tawng iawng mih arup paw enni naia thawp kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“The pe tuah dowi mih kawm Pawi enni nasun reng kown. Ang pe enni ana iawng ranit ni mowr the pe tuah dowi mih kawm enni nacha kown. Nami pawi dow Abib la kowi kowh khowmta bowkta mih ni kowi enni nasunah reng kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Aigupta pren hownia enni uang lawt mih dow nami la kowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Rik dia mih kachakuüa chah maten dow ang kowh chekhai. Nami klen kowi tawncher kowi kowh rik pen mih ala maten paw ang kowh chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Now kawrngaramchük rik pen mih ala takcha kowi dow ruapur chah hown enni naklanah kown. Klan dowi kowh chalow now nami kawrngaramchük chah kowh ngawng enni naklowkta pe kown. Now enni kowh chapa ta maten kowi paw enni naklanah ngengche kown takla.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Pawi khe dow rut khawma ang tut-e enni naia uang kown nadowi.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Taruk ni mowr mih enni nachang lup kown, now ranit ni khe dow enni natanai kown. Asawt khin khe lah, angen khin khe lah, nami ni dow enni natanai kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />Püm ngen khin khe dow rik ngenah mih püm hown enni nachang Chamüng Pawk Pawi kown. Now ning chur prakowi ki tawnta luprak prowng khe dow enni nachang Bowthowk Pawi kown. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23-24" />Enni pren kowi kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi ang naprütta enni kown. Ang dow Israeluüa kowh Thurai chekhai. Naiawng rakowi paning kowi sum kat chi kachakuüa maten ang CHAKRAMANG pur kowi enni nauang takua kown takla. Nami khin khe dow enni kowh krawng bawn nauang khün kown mih ransu-uüa nauowi kown nadowi bowt. Enni kowh pren sünghi mih aphiama ang nachang enni kown.<verse eid="EXO 34:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“Ang vüi kowi tawncher hown enni chang phuchua mih khin khe the pe tuah mih tawng chap paw enni naphuchuala kown nadowi. Takat Pawi kowi kowh phuchuaah mih dow tawng chap paw auai rau mowr enni natow kown nadowi. <verse eid="EXO 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />Üa hai laih hownia kowh uih müng lang iung mih dow ang CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai chup kim kowi enni nauang pawla kown.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“Rua chah nga dow a-u iawn tui hown enni naengah kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, “Naiawngün laiklow dow ruiah diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow en hai Israeluüa hown ang tow sangbowk laitawm mih dow naiawngün laiklow hown chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Sinai hungh kowi CHAKRAMANG tut-e Mosi uowi mih dow likawm ni hai likawm uar mowr chekhai. Nami khin khe aia dow tawng chap paw cha dowi kham dowi chekhai. Huapher pre buk mih luk kowi dow sangbowk laitawm lai plan ruiah khai. Nami dow hamüt klüng mih ana pek chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mosi kowh lumowr tawk mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />Mosi mih sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk mih dowkla se Sinai hungh hownia uang iu dowm khai. CHAKRAMANG hown taklang rakowi aia kowh lumowr tawk mih aia dow tuk dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Arawn hai Israeluüa maten dow Mosi kowh lumowr tawk mih khita hanow aia tut-e kowkowi kown mih kram büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Nachenganchepaw Mosi dow amatni kowi haihawah khai, now Arawn hai Israel aluchowuüa dow aia tut-e kowkowi khai. Nahanow Mosi dow amatni hown talawp khai. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa maten Mosi tut-e kowkowi khai, now Sinai hungh kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah mih ana maten amatni kowi Mosi phuang pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 34:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Now maru kawmuüa hown ki taklang kung kowi dow Mosi mih aia kowh lumowr uan hown mumta khai.<verse eid="EXO 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />Nachenganchepaw takrumra te kowi CHAKRAMANG hown nakowtaklang kownkow kowkup mih khin khe dow aia lumowr kowi kowh uan mih lowtta reng chekhai. Now CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh aia kaah mih ana maten dow uang lawt hanow Israeluüa kowi uang tek pe reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />Nakhowk khe maru kawmuüa dow aia kowh lumowr tawk mih khi reng chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG hown kowplan taklang dowi mowr aia kowh lumowr mih Mosi plan mumta hüah chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s">Tanai Ni kowi kowh rirow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Akung kowi Israeluüa maten kowi kuaah now Mosi tek pe mih, “Enni nachünah kownkow mami ana CHAKRAMANG pe enni mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />Pasapta kowi taruk ni mowr enni nachang lup kown. Nachenganchepaw ranit ni mih ni dow enni natanai kown; nami dow CHAKRAMANG vüi chimsaima enni nalang towah kown. Nami ni kowi kowh chang lup mih kowi dow nakowngta ngengche kown takla. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />Tanai Ni khe dow maih khowm amia iawng mih kim kowi paw enni naia chang kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te vüi nape uanh kown mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Mosi plan tek pe Israeluüa mih, “CHAKRAMANG ana pek maiawng: <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />CHAKRAMANG vüi uang ap uanh büa diah. Lowra maru sak nau hown kowh uang ap kown nau mih dow pauang cham pawla lah. Uang ia pawla kown mih uanh dow kuh, tai, kri, <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi, adipükchow mih la, rua pawi, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />aringma süah mih ruapurla pik, chak pik aiungma mih, ri singh, <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />maibu towk müa kanrawn sau, nathawpla nümnap müa sau kown mih nam iungma mih chap, nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa nathawpla than kown mih chap, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />ephawd kowrmow hai <char style="w">owngphowr</char> im kowi kowh nadanah kown mih ‘oniks’ hua hai asung khakma mih hua ün chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te vüi nathawp uanh kown mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Enni pungmadawng kowi kowh uanh thawp sarauüa mih CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng nauang thawp uanh kown. <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />Amatni nathawp kown mih dow taklowp taklangra te hai te luk müa ün, auowk rah hai aping müa phen ün, akep müa lawng ün, achüng hai akhawk rup rah ün chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai akawtlawng ün, sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm müa hai atowk chang müa uaniang, <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />pawitang hai akawtlawng ün, pawitang kowi kowh tawngkengah kown mih uanh ün hai CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh towah mih chimsaima mih kawm, <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />anowi müa maibu towngh hai nami kowi kowh tawngkengah kown mih uanh ün, maibu hai maibu towk müa sau ün, <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />maikhük towk müa phuchuara hai akawtlawng ün, nümnap müa sau hai anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than hai taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi kowh uaniang paw nathawp büah kown. <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />Nami klen kowi tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara hai kri hown kowh lawkrachow, phuchuara kawtlawng hai puh bia aikam ün, kri hown kowh biatum hai biatum chowm müa, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />viadawng ping müa uaniang hai uaniang iang müa achüng ün, achüng vüi akhawk rup rah ün, viadawng ping kowi kowh aplawt vüi uaniang ün, <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />taklowp taklangra te hai viadawng ping tükra chung ün, atük müa leng ün nathawp büah kown. <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />Now uamow Arawn vüi taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lup chang müa chimsaima mih tawnguat paw nasown pe büah kown, now achapauüa vüi paw uamow iawng nachangla lup kown mih tawnguat nasown pe büah kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG vüi uang pawla uanh mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Mosi ki tek lai kung kowi dow Israeluüa mih Mosi hownia powt khai. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Now amatni sak nau hown kowh pe kown nau miuüa maten dow uang pawla uanh now uang plan uang büah khai. Amatni dow taklowp taklangra te chang müa hai lup chang müa ün, uamow kowh chimsaima mih tawnguat thawp müa ün, lakke mih chap maten uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Masiuüa hai kachakuüa pe kown nau mih maten dow kuh hown kowh tatawng müa achap akawm uang pawla büah khai. Amatni uang pawla mih dow uan klia müa mangsarkap, ramseng, rutbüt hai akeng mih tatawng müa ün chekhai. Naiawngün dow CHAKRAMANG vüi uang tangah büah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Now aruama mih la, arikma mih la, aringma mih la hai adipükchow mih la ün, rua pawi ün, aringma süah mih ruapur pik ün, chak pik aiungma mih ün uowi miuüa dow naiawngün uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Now tai hai kri uowi miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kowi napeah kownkow tai hai kri uang pawla büah khai. Nami klen kowi taklowp taklangra te chang müa kowi natawngah kownkow ri singh uowi miuüa dow uang pawla ri singh khai.<verse eid="EXO 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Now masiuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh la thawp akiakma miuüa maten dow aruama mih la, arikma mih la, aringma mih la hai adipükchow mih la ün thawpah büah now uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Pe kown nau miuüa hai tuk thawp la mih masiuüa srui dow rua pawi hown thawp la hanow uang pawla büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Now aluchowuüa dow ephawd kowrmow hai owngphowr im luk kowi nadanah kownkow “oniks” hua hai asung khakma mih akeng mih hua ün uang pawla khai. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Nami klen kowi maibu towk müa sau ün, nümnap müa sau ün, anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than hai kanrawn sau ün uang pawla khai.<verse eid="EXO 35:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih maten nachangla kownkow Israeluüa mih uang pawla uanh khai. Amatni dow masiuüa hai kachakuüa pe kown nau mih maten CHAKRAMANG vüi uang pawla uanh büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bezalel hai Oholiab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Nami kung kowi Israeluüa kowi Mosi tek pe mih, “Sünta büa diah, Juda krungchak kowi kowh Uri chapa Bezalel kowi CHAKRAMANG lang klota khowk. Uri dow Hur kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Bezalel kowi dow Thurai mih aia lümla hown kruiah khowk. Aia kowi dow prengia, tukra, chanlaira hai achap kawm nachangla kown mih kür Thurai peta khowk. <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32-33" />Naiawng rakowi aia dow kuh, tai, kri, asung khakma mih hua hai singh hown klangiung klangiungma mih uanh natuk thawp kown. <verse eid="EXO 35:32-33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Nami klen kowi akeng miuüa kowi paw naiawngün lup nowng sangla kownkow Bezalel hai Dan krungchak hownia kowh Ahisamak chapa Oholiab kowi CHAKRAMANG peta kür khowk. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Amatchi kowi dow aruama süah mih ruapur pawi hown ün, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi hown ün, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hown ün, adipükchow mih la hown ün natuk sawt bawng kownkow hai natuk kawng uan kown mih kür CHAKRAMANG peta khowk. Nami klen kowi singh, hua hai lawngha kowi rut tua lup maten amatchi dow natuk chang kown, now kowmatia kow thawn hown bawng ün maiow maiow natuk thawp iüah kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />Mosi plan tek mih, “Tawng iawng chow taklowp taklangra te nathawpah kown mih natukla kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih Bezalel, Oholiab hai uanh thawp sarauüa kowi peah prengia hai tukra khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün lup dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng amatni pacham ia chang lah pakowh chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Achütma Israeluüa uang pawla uanh mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Now naiawngün lup maten nachang kownkow Mosi mih Bezalel hai Oholiab iüah kowi hawah khai bowt. Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG peah tukra mih uanh thawp sarauüa uang tawi chang lup kown sakkrai miuüa kowi paw aia hawla khai.<verse eid="EXO 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Now nachangla taklowp taklangra te kownkow Israeluüa uang pawla mih uanh maten nami sarauüa kowi Mosi ap pe khai. Nami kung kowi paw maru kawmuüa mih amatni sak nau iawng rau towng Mosi tut-e uang pawla uanh reng tak chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Naiawng uang pawla mih khi hanow uanh thawp sarauüa mih amatni kowh lup towla now Mosi tut-e kowkowi khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />Mosi kowi amatni kowtek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng nachangla lup kownkow lakke mih lak-e maru-uüa uang pawla uanh mih marat klen kowi chüt khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Nakhowk khe tangbung khup rah kowi uowi miuüa kowi Mosi krawi phuang pe satang mih, “Masiuüa chepaw, kachakuüa chepaw taklowp taklangra te vüi hauang pacham pawla uanh tham bowt lah,” pakhai. Nami satang tata hanow maru-uüa mih tawng uanh paw kowpawla dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru-uüa uang pawla mih uanh dow amatni lakkeah mih lak-e chüt khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thawp taklowp taklangra te mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Nami kung kowi dow uanh thawp sarauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kiak miuüa mih thawp taklowp taklangra te khai bowt. Nami taklowp taklangra te dow adipükchow mih la, aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi hai aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hown kowh thawpah mih uan powng hamüt rua hown thawpah büah khai. Naiawngün uan powng kowi dow bawng sawt sarauüa kowi cherupuüa pung pe sawtah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Naiawngün uan powng dow anowksang kawngah büah khai. Nami uan powng dow arua kowi aklang pirmi lairaiat muk, now aphia dow tali muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Naiawngün uan powng dow tanga rua chi sownah now changah atheng chi büah khai. Naiawng hai aphiama changah pre theng büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Nami uan pre theng trui kowi dow adowng pra kowh aret kowi aruama mih lasin hown chawp pe amin 50 klüng chi khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Naiawng hai aphiama mih uan pre theng mih kowi dow adowng pra kowh aret kowi chawp pe amin 100 klüng khai. Nami uan pre theng mih kowi kowh chawpah mih amin dow pre pra hownia tungah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Nami kung kowi dow kuh hown thawp pe auowk müa 50 klüng khai. Naiawngün auowk müa dow uan pre theng tatung mih kowi kowh amin kowi uowkah khai. Nahanow nami uan pre theng mih hown dow taklowp taklangra te chowng lowk khai.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te khu müa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Taklowp taklangra te luk khu müa dow rua pawi hown kawng uan powng lailowk rua khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Naiawngün uan powng dow anowksang kawngah khai. Nami uan powng dow arua kowi aklang 30 muk chi, now aphia dow tali muk chi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Nami uan powng lailowk rua mih hownia pawah tanga rua hanow aphiama sownah atheng khai, now ta lat taruk rua mih hown paw aphiama sownah atheng khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Nami uan powng pre theng trui kowi dow adowng pra kowh aret kowi chawp pe amin 50 klüng chi khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Nami kung kowi dow kri hown thawp pe auowk müa 50 klüng khai. Naiawngün auowk müa dow aphiama mih uan pre theng mih kowi kowh amin kowi uowkah khai. Nahanow nami uan pre theng mih hown dow taklowp taklangra te khu müa chowng lowk chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Nami luk kowi paw plan khuah pre lüp khai. Alüp mih dow aringma süah mih ruapurla pik hown, now nami luk kowi dow chak pik aiungma mih hown chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te ping müa phen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Now taklowp taklangra te ping müa ri singh hown ngen phen sangrum khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Phen maten dow aklang hamüt muk hai aphia amuk hown dawnglang chi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />Now arup rah kowi rupah kownkow phen maten kowi arup müa akhawk uowi pre buk chi chekhai. Taklowp taklangra te ping müa phen maten dow anowksang ngenah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Mrawkphak prakowi kowh aping müa vüi ngen pe phen pirmi phiah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />Naiawngün phen vüi dow akhawk rup rah tai hown thawpah khai. Phen maten vüi akhawk rup rah bowkbowk kowi thawp pe likawm klüng khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25-26" />Nami iawng dow tawngphak prakowi kowh vüi paw ngen pe phen pirmi phiah khai, now naiawngün phen maten vüi paw thawp pe akhawk rup rah likawm rah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Taklowp taklangra te kung pra kowh vüi paw ngen pe phen taruk phiah khai. Nami dow taklowp taklangra te satkup prakowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />Taklowp taklangra te kung pra kowh anui pre nui mih vüi paw ngen pe phen pre phiah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />Nami phen pre phiah mih dow anui kowi kawpah khai: Adak prakowi dow areng pra kowh phen hai adowng pra kowh phen kowi kawpah khai. Nachenganchepaw aluk prakowi dow auowk müa hown uowkah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Naiawng hai satkup prakowi dow aping müa phen uowi raiat phiah chekhai. Nami phen vüi paw phen dak kowi akhawk rup rah tai hown aphiah kowi pre buk chi bowkbowk kowi laitaruk klüng thawp pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phen kep müa lawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Now taklowp taklangra te ping kep müa lawng dow ri singh hown thawp pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />Nami akep müa lawng dow mrawkphak pra kowh vüi tanga klüng, tawngphak pra kowh vüi tanga klüng hai satkup pra kowh vüi tanga klüng thawp pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Naiawngün akep müa lawng dow aluk prakowi pre buk, adak prakowi pre buk kepah khai. Now alowk mih dow dawnglang kowi mami hownia paipra kowi plawn pat sowrah khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Naiawngün phen dow kuh hown klaiah khai. Akep müa lawng krua müa akli dow kuh hown thawpah khai, now phen kowi chawpah khai. Naiawngün akep müa lawng paw kuh hown klaiah khai.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uaniang hai uaniang iang müa chüng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Bawng sawt sarauüa dow aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown thawp uaniang lowk khai. Nami uaniang kowi dow bawng sawt sarauüa sawt pe cherupuüa pung khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Nami uaniang iang müa dow ri singh hown thawp pe achüng tali chüng khai, now naiawngün achüng kowi dow klai pe kuh khai. Nami klen kowi naiawngün achüng kowi dow kuh hown kowh klaiah mih akrua rah paw chawp pe sangrum chi khai, now akhawk rup rah paw tai hown thawp pe tali klüng khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Now nami taklowp taklangra te plawt vüi paw sawt pe bawng mih uaniang iawng aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown thawp pe uaniang khai. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Nami uaniang iang müa dow thawp pe achüng tanga chüng khai. Now nami achüng kowi dow chawp pe krua rah khai. Now achüng lu hai lawngha iang kowi dow kuh hown sowah khai. Nami achüng vüi paw akhawk rup rah kri hown thawp pe tanga klüng chi khai.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Bezalel dow ri singh hown thawp sangbowk laitawm tawkpla khai bowt. Nami dow areng klang pre muk hown dawnglang, now adowng phia hai akro amuk hown dawnglang aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Alak hai prang kowi dow kuh achangma mih hown aia sowah khai, now auenh tapat lut mih kowi dow kuh hown thawp pe bawng khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Kuh hown thawp pe akli tali klüng hanow akhawk tali klüng mih kowi chawpah khai. Nami akli dow mapra dam pre buk, now paipra dam pre buk chawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Now ri singh hown hui pe akawtlawng pre buk khai. Nami akawtlawng kowi paw klai pe kuh khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow nakawtla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kownkow akli kowi sowrah khai.<verse eid="EXO 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Nami kung kowi dow Bezalel mih kuh achangma mih hown thawp sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm lowk khai. Nami dow angak khu müa sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm chekhai. Nami aküm dow areng klang pre muk hown dawnglang, now adowng phia amuk hown dawnglang aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm adowng pra ret kowi kowh kuh dow sawnah now cherup rup thawpla pre buk khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />Nami cherup rup pre buk mih dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm mapra downg hownia lowk, paipra downg hownia lowk aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Cherup pre buk trui kowh lap dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi iangah khai. Cherup pre buk mih dow tatingtang klowk towah khai, now amatchi kowh lumowr dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm prakowi dangah khai.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh pawitang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Now Bezalel dow ri singh hown thawp pawitang lowk khai. Nami pawitang dow areng klang pre muk, adowng phia amuk, now akro dow amuk hown dawnglang aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Nami pawitang dow achangma mih kuh hown aia klaiah khai, now auenh tapat lut mih kowi dow kuh hown aia thawp pe bawng khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Nami pawitang adak pra kowh aret dow tapat lut apawk ngia aia thawp pe aping khai. Nami aping kowi paw kuh hown aia thawp pe bawng khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Now pawitang nui towng kowi akhawk luk kowi akawtlawng sowr müa akli paw aia chawpla pe lowk chi khai. Nami akli dow kuh hown aia thawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Naiawngün akli dow pawitang dak kowi kowh aping dakchow re-e chawpah khai. Nami akli dow sowr pe akawtlawng hanow nacham kawtla reng kownkow nami re-e chawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Aia dow pawitang kawt müa akawtlawng pre buk mih ri singh huiah hanow kuh hown klaiah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Now khamah mih uanap kowi tawngah kownkow pawitang luk kowi towah kown mih lawngpan ün, bia ün, biatum ün, tuikawng ün paw kuh achangma mih hown aia thawpla khai.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maibu towngh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Now Bezalel dow achangma mih kuh hown thawp maibu towngh lowk khai. Nami maibu towngh kowi dow achowm müa hai achüng, bia hai pau khawm aia thawp pe khai. Naiawngün dow pakluchow mih kuh hown sawnah now aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Nami maibu towngh kowi kowh achüng kowi dow mapra sum buk, paipra sum buk chi bowkbowk kowi thawp pe amia prek taruk klüng khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Amia prek towng madam pau iawng mih bia dow pau hai akhawm hailawm aia thawp pe sum buk chi khai. Maibu towngh kowi kowh amia prek taruk klüng mih dow apowmsang aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Maibu towngh kowi kowh achüng kowi paw amia prek kowi kowh iawng dow aia thawp pe bia khai. Nachenganchepaw achüng kowi dow aia thawp pe tali klüng khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Maibu towngh chüng kowi kowh amia prek uowi taruk klüng mih kowi paw amiakrum towng amiakrum dakchow kowi apau hai akhawm thawpla pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Apau, akhawm, amia prek maten hai achüng dow kuh achangma mih pakluchow hown sawnah now thawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Kuh achangma mih hown maibu ranit klüng, bawthi kep müa kaingkep hai maidim towk rah lawngpan ün paw thawpla ne khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Maibu towngh hailawm naiawngün uanh maten thawpla mih dow bowkbowk kowi kuh achangma mih 30 set ngia chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Now Bezalel dow ri singh hown thawp maikhük towk müa phuchuara lowk khai. Nami phuchuara dow tali tingnui aia thawpah khai. Areng klang hai adowng phia dow amuk chi, now akro dow pre muk aia thawpah khai. Phuchuara aluk prakowi kowh anui towng dow anang iawng achemchow aia sawnah lowk chi khai. Naiawngün anang tali klüng mih dow phuchuara hown panga sang aia sawnah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Nami phuchuara dow anang hailawm aluk hown aping ün kuh achangma mih hown klaiah khai. Now tapat lut mih auenh kowi dow kuh hown thawp pe bawng khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Nami phuchuara dow nacham ia kawtla reng kownkow auenh dak kowi anui re-e akawtlawng sowr müa akli mapra dam pre buk paipra dam pre buk chi Bezalel chawp pe khai. Naiawngün akli dow kuh hown aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow ri singh hown thawpah now aia klai pe kuh khai.<verse eid="EXO 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Nami klen kowi paingbawng thawp sarauüa thawp paingbawng iawng maikhük towk müa uanh hai nümnap müa sau paw aia thawpla khai.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s1">Tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara hai biatum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Bezalel dow ri singh hown thawp tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara lowk khai. Nami phuchuara dow anui uowi tali nui chekhai. Areng klang hai adowng phia dow tanga muk chi aia thawpah khai, now akro dow sum muk aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Phuchuara aluk prakowi dow anui towng anang iawng achemchow hui pe lowk chi khai. Naiawngün anang tali klüng mih dow phuchuara hown panga sang sawnah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Now phuchuara hailawm naiawngün bowkbowk dow kri hown klaiah khai. Aia dow phuchuara kowi kowh plawi kuak müa puh, phuchuara kowi kowh mawngchawng khur müa uaibak, tawncher vi towk müa biatum, chaknga khowng müa chuk hai mairing pawk müa puh ün thawpah khai. Naiawngün bowkbowk dow kri hown aia thawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Now lawkrachow paw kri hown aia thawpla lowk khai. Nami lawkrachow dow phuchuara uen dakchow kowi towah khai. Nahanow nami lawkrachow dow phuchuara dawnglang mowr awr uowi khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Aia dow akawtlawng sowr müa nami lawkrachow nui towng kowi chawp pe akli lowk chi khai. Naiawngün akli dow kri hown aia thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Now aia dow ri singh hown thawp akawtlawng pre buk, now nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow kri hown aia klaiah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Nami akawtlawng pre buk mih dow akli kowi mapra dam lowk, paipra dam lowk sowrah khai. Nami akawtlawng hown phuchuara dow cham kawtla reng chekhai. Nami phuchuara dow phen hown thawpah khai, now nami lak kowi dow akuangma towah khai.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Biatum hai biatum chowm müa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Now biatum hai biatum chowm müa dow kri hown aia thawpah khai. Naiawngün kri dow taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi uang chang lup mih masiuüa hawmh uang pawla mih kri nimrua hownia kowh chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Taklowp taklangra te re-e kowh viadawng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Nami kung kowi Bezalel mih taklowp taklangra te tavir lut krawi pingah hanow thawp viadawng khai. Nami viadawng mrawkphak prakowi dow akawm muk mowr pingah khai. Nami aping vüi dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh uaniang tawngah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />Naiawngün uaniang iang müa dow tow pe kri chüng pirmi chüng khai. Nami achüng vüi dow akhawk rup rah kri hown thawp pe pirmi klüng khai. Now uaniang iang müa dow lawngha iang hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih auowk rah achüng kowi chawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Tawngphak prakowi paw nami iawng rowprowp aia changah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Satkup prakowi kowh 50 muk mowr mih aping müa paw thawp pe uaniang sangrum khai. Naiawngün uaniang iang müa paw thawp pe achüng hamüt klüng khai, now nami achüng vüi paw akhawk rup rah kri hown thawp pe hamüt klüng khai. Now uaniang iang müa lawngha iang hai tai hown kowh thawpah mih lawngha iang krua müa akli dow achüng kowi chawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Satlawt prakowi paw 50 muk mowr uaniang hown pingah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14-15" />Nami prakowi dow tow pe aplawt khai. Aplawt hawmlawm pra hai lakuai prakowi dow laitanga muk chi uaniang hown pingah khai. Nami uaniang iang müa paw thawp pe achüng sum buk chi, now nami achüng vüi paw akhawk rup rah kri hown thawp pe sum buk chi khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Viadawng tavir lut mih kowi kowh aping müa uaniang maten dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Viadawng tapat lut mih achüng maten dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih lawngha iang hown chawp pe bowk khai. Achüng luk kowi dow tai hown kowh thawpah mih auowk rah chawp pe khai. Now achüng kowi kowh akhawk vüi akhawk rup rah dow kri hown thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Aia dow nami viadawng plawt vüi paw thawp pe uaniang lowk. Nami uaniang kowi dow aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown sawt pe bawng khai. Nami uaniang paw aphia dow tanga muk, now aklang dow pirmi muk chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />Nami uaniang iang müa paw thawp pe achüng tali klüng, now nami achüng vüi paw akhawk rup rah kri hown thawp pe tali klüng khai. Now achüng kowi kowh chawp müa akli hai lawngha iang dow tai hown thawpah khai. Achüng lu kowi paw tai hown klaiah khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Taklowp taklangra te hai viadawng kowi kowh uaniang tük müa chung ün dow kri hown thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thawpla taklowp taklangra te mih uanh ingsap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Mami dow thawp taklowp taklangra te khe kowh tawngah kengah mih uanh ingsap chekhai. Mosi ana pek iawng Leviuüa dow naiawngün uanh ingsap auown hownia ruiah khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa luk kowi kowh chang alow mih dow uamow Arawn kowh chapa Ithamar chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Juda krungchak Uri kowh chapa Bezalel dow thawpah bowk khai. Bezalel dow Hur kowh chu chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Bezalel kowi kowh tawi khowngah mih dow Dan krungchak Ahisamak kowh chapa Oholiab chekhai. Oholiab dow uanh thawp hai bawng thawp akiakma chekhai. Nami klen kowi paw aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown bawng sawt paw atukma chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Taklowp taklangra te thawp müa kowi kowh uang pe mih kuh dow 30 set ngia chekhai. Naiawngün kuh dow arah chimsaima mih kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah mih chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25-26" />Israeluüa rüa maru iun khe kowh amatni hownia kowh kaah mih tai dow 3,017 set hown 750 gram chekhai; lowk ia kowi pe mih dow tai 5 gram chi chekhai. Nami dow arah chimsaima mih kowi kowh akhai müa hown khaiah mih chekhai. Israeluüa pungmadawng kowi kowh rüaah mih maru iun mut dow 603,550 ia chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kangowh. <verse eid="EXO 38:25-26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Naiawngün tai hownia 3,400 set mih dow taklowp taklangra te hai naiangla uaniang kown mih achüng vüi akhawk rup rah thawpla khai. Naiawngün akhawk rup rah kowi dow pakhawk kowi tai 34 set chi kowi khai; naiawng hai achüng vüi akhawk rup rah dow thawpah akawm khai. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Tai ta lat 20 set mih hown dow achüng kowi kowh chawp müa akli, achüng lu kowi kowh klai müa hai uaniang iang müa lawngha iang ün kowi tawngah khai.<verse eid="EXO 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Taklowp taklangra te thawp müa kowi kowh uang pe mih kri dow 2,400 set ngia chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Naiawngün kri hown dow taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi kowh achüng vüi akhawk rup rah ün, phuchuara hai lawkrachow, puh bia aikam ün, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />viadawng ping tavir lut mih kowi kowh achüng vüi akhawk rup rah ün, aplawt kowi kowh achüng vüi akhawk rup rah ün, taklowp taklangra te hai viadawng ping tavir lut mih kowi kowh uaniang tük müa chung ün thawpla khai.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s1">Uamow lang kri mih kowh tawnguat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Uanh thawp sarauüa dow taklowp taklangra te kowi chang lup khe kowh nakhupah kown mih tawnguat maten aruama mih la, arikma mih la hai aringma mih la hown kawngah büah khai. Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powm iawng amatni dow Arawn vüi uamow lup chang müa chimsaima mih tawnguat thawp pe khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ephawd kowrmow thawp</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Ephawd kowrmow dow kuh, aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown uan sown sarauüa thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Amatni dow kuh sawnah now apachow changah khai. Now aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown akat sang naia tawngah kownkow nami kuh dow lasin iawng asinchow kepah büah khai. Naiawngün dow uan sown sarauüa kowh lup chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Ephawd kowrmow dow pur prakowi kowh uan nga hown kung prakowi kowh uan nga chawpah kownkow pangkawt re-e mapra lowk paipra lowk chi chawp pe aleng büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Nami ephawd kowrmow kowi kowh kekawm paw ephawd kowrmow powm iawng thawpah büah khai. Nami kekawm paw kuh hai aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi, adipükchow mih la hown sarauüa kawngah khai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6-7" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow kuh apherklepchow mih luk kowi “oniks” hua dan pe pre buk büah khai. Nami hua kowi dow thawp mur khe kowh iawng Israel kowh chapauüa ming rui pe büah khai, now ephawd kowrmow kowi kowh pangkawt kowi kowh leng hown chawpah büah khai. Nami hua pre buk dan pe mih dow Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG napela ching kownkow chekhai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owngphowr im</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Nami kung kowi amatni dow thawp owngphowr im khai. Nami dow uanh thawp sarauüa kowh lup chekhai. Owngphowr im paw ephawd kowrmow iawng dow kuh, aruama süah mih ruapur pawi, arikma süah mih ruapur pawi, aringma süah mih ruapur pawi hai adipükchow mih la hown thawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Nami owngphowr im dow aklang hai aphia pakar chi thawpah büah khai. Nami dow uan pathowrchow mih hown klepah now tali tingnuichow changah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Nami owngphowr im luk kowi dow dan pe asung khakma mih hua tali tan khai. Rik khüa mih tan kowi dow “Sardius” hua, “Topaz” hua hai “Karbun” hua dan pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />Pre tan mih kowi dow “Emeral” hua, “Safir” hua hai “Daimawn” hua dan pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />Sum tan mih kowi dow “Ligure” hua, “Agate” hua hai “Amethis” hua dan pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />Achur tan kowi dow “Beril” hua, “Oniks” hua hai “Jasper” hua dan pe khai. Naiawngün hua dow kuh apherklepchow mih luk kowi danah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Israel kowh chapa laipre ia vüi dan pe hua büah laipre buk chekhai. Naiawngün hua towng kowi dow Israel kowh chapauüa ming rui pe lowk chi büah khai. Naiawngün dow thawp mur khe iawng thawpah büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Amatni dow nami owngphowr im vüi kuh achangma mih hown thawp pe kuh leng pre buk khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Now amatni dow kuh apherklepchow mih thawpah pre buk khai, now kuh hown kowh akli paw thawpla pe pre buk khai. Nami akli pre buk mih dow owngphowr im aluk pra kowh nui kowi mapra lowk paipra lowk chawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Nami kuh leng pre buk mih dow nami akli pre buk mih kowi khuowkah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />Kuh leng akeng pra kowh towr dow ephawd kowrmow pangkawt kowi kowh leng luk kowi kuh apherklepchow mih kowi khuowkah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Nami klen kowi paw kuh hown thawp pe akli pre buk hanow owngphowr im adak pra kowh nui kowi mapra lowk paipra lowk chawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Nami klen kowi paw kuh hown kowh akli plan thawp pe pre buk khai, now nami akli pre buk mih dow ephawd kowrmow pangkawt kowi kowh leng hown tatawng klowk re-e kekawm lukchow kowi chawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Nahanow owngphowr im adak pra kowh akli hown kekawm lukchow kowi kowh akli dow aruama mih leng hown khuowkah büah khai, now owngphowr im dow ephawd kowrmow hownia tasüt dowi bowt chekhai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uamow kowh akeng mih tawnguat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Ephawd kowrmow lak pra kowh khupah kown mih kowrmow athawngma mih dow aruama mih la hown kangowh thawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />Nami kowrmow aluk pra dow lu krua müa akuangma tow pe büah arah khai. Nami akuang uer dow natathek naklak dowi kownkow tapat lut asipma krawi sownah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Now aruama mih la, arikma mih la hai aringma mih la hown dalim uih iawng thawp pe powtuh hanow nami kowrmow adak pra kowh uer kowi tapat lut krawi tan pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Now kuh achangma mih hown thawp pe ro büah hanow nami powtuh hown kriaah seklek se krawi tanah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Uamow chang lup khe kowh nakhupah kown mih kowrmow kowi dow adak pra kowh auer tapat lut powtuh lowk ro lowk chi takria seklek tanah büah khai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Amatni dow Arawn hai achapauüa vüi aruama mih kowrmow krüa kowi nakhupah kown mih kowrmow bawngthawng athawngma mih adipükchow mih la hown kawng pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />Now napawng hai lukruk paw adipükchow mih la hown kawng pe büah khai. Kraksa dawngh dow iawngpa mih la hown thawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />Kekawm dow adipükchow mih la, aruama mih la, arikma mih la hai aringma mih la hown kawngah büah hanow sawt pe bawng büah khai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Nami kung kowi dow chimsaima mih lukruk kowi kowh vüi kuh achangma mih hown apherklepchow sawnah büah lowk khai. Nami apherklepchow mih kuh kowi dow “CHAKRAMANG VÜI CHIMSAIMA” pami laiklow mur kowi kowh ruiah iawng ruiah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Nami kuh apherklepchow mih dow napawng pur prakowi towah now aruama mih leng hown tapah büah khai. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh uanh Mosi tut-e uang pawla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Now taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh uanh maten dow ki thawpta büah khai bowt. Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Amatni dow taklowp taklangra te vüi kowi kowh thawpah mih uanh maten Mosi tut-e kowpawla khai. Naiawngün dow taklowp taklangra te hai nakowi kowh natawngah kown mih auowk rah ün, aping müa phen ün, akep müa lawng ün, achüng ün, akhawk rup rah ün, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />aringma süah mih ruapurla pik hai chak pik aiungma mih hown kowh akhup müa, Lang Chimsai mih Arah tung müa uaniang, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />akawtlawng hailawm mih sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai angak khu müa sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm ün chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />Nami klen kowi pawitang hai nakowi kowh tawngkengah kown mih uanh ün, CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh towah mih kawm, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />maibu hailawm kuh achangma mih hown kowh thawpah mih maibu towng, maibu towng kowi kowh uanh ün, maibu towk müa sau, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />kuh hown kowh thawpah mih phuchuara, nümnap müa sau, anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa than, taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi kowh iangah kown mih uaniang, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />kri hown kowh thawpah mih phuchuara hai nakowi kowh towah kown mih lawkrachow, phuchuara kawtlawng, phuchuara kowi kowh puh bia aikam, biatum hai biatum chowm müa, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />viadawng ping müa chüng ün, achüng vüi akhawk rup rah ün, viadawng ping müa uaniang, viadawng ping kowi kowh aplawt kowi iangah kown mih uaniang, viadawng uaniang tük müa chung hai aleng ün, taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh tawngah kown mih uanh srui uang pawla büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />Now uamow Arawn vüi taklowp taklangra te kowi kowh lup chang müa chimsaima mih tawnguat sown pe büah khai, now achapauüa vüi paw uamow iawng nachangla lup kown mih tawnguat sown pe büah khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Amatni dow Mosi kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm thawpah khai. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Now Mosi dow Israeluüa kowh lup khi hanow CHAKRAMANG peah ana khe kowh iawng chang büah bowk khowk pami hawt tuk khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow Israeluüa kowi peah prasi khai.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s">Khup taklowp taklangra te mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Nami kung kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe Mosi mih, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“Taklowp taklangra te dow ning sar la sar ni sar khe en nachangah kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow nami taklowp taklangra te lak kowi en natowah hanow uaniang hown en natungah kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Chimsaima mih kawm towk rah pawitang paw taklowp taklangra te lak kowi en nauang towah hanow nami luk kowi kowh natowah kown mih uanh srui klangiungma en natowah kown. Nami kung kowi dow maibu towngh en nauang pawla hanow maibu maten en natow pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur re-e uaniang uat kowi dow kuh hown kowh maikhük towk müa phuchuara en natowah kown, now taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi dow en naiang pe uaniang kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />Tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara dow taklowp taklangra te plawt hownia alak sangrumchow re-e en natowah kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Nami phuchuara hai taklowp taklangra te takra kowi dow en natow pe biatum lowk hanow en natow pe tui kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Taklowp taklangra te viadawng dow uaniang hown tapat lut en nakrawi pingah kown. Now viadawng plawt kowi paw en naiang pe uaniang kown.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Nami kung kowi dow en napaw pe nümnap müa sau hanow nami sau dow taklowp taklangra te kowi hai nakowi kowh uowi mih uanh maten kowi en nakrawi phawkah kown; naiawng hai naiawngün dow ang vüi kowi en nalang towah kown. Nahanow naiawngün uanh dow chimsaima naown kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />Nami klen kowi puh bia aikam hailawm tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara kowi paw nümnap müa sau en nakrawi phawk pe hanow ang vüi kowi en nalang kraah kown. Nahanow naiawngün dow lang chim lang sai mih uanh naown kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />Biatum hai biatum chowm müa kowi paw en naphawk pe nümnap müa sau hanow ang vüi kowi en nalang kraah kown.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Nami kung kowi dow Arawn hai achapauüa kowi taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e en nauang pawla hanow tui hown en nape tasauah kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Now Arawn kowi dow chimsaima mih tawnguat en nakhup pe hanow en nanümnapah kown, now ang vüi kowi en nalang kraah kown. Nahanow aia dow naia chang uamow lup kown towbowt. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />Arawn kowh chapauüa kowi paw uang pawla now uamow tawnguat en nakhup pe kown. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Amatni kowi paw a-pa Arawn kowi iawng en nanümnapah kown. Nahanow amatni paw naia chang uamow lup kown towbowt. Naiawng nümnapah mih hownia kowh kaah mih uamow rah dow chowngchowng saksakma amatni kowh krungchakuüa tut-e nauowi reng kown,” pakhai. <verse eid="EXO 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Now Mosi dow aia kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG peah ana mih powmpowm lup maten changah khai.<verse eid="EXO 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Aigupta pren hownia uang lawt büah mih paning chur kowh pre ning uang tauown mih ning sar la sar ni sar khe taklowp taklangra te thawp büah khai bowt. Naiawngün lup maten dow Mosi tek iawng thawpah büah khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />Aia dow phen vüi rik tow pe akhawk rup rah khai. Nami kung kowi dow aping müa phen iu rup pe khai, now akep müa lawng sowr pe khai. Nami kung kowi dow uaniang iang müa achüng phük pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng taklowp taklangra te mih uan powng hown aia lukah khai. Now nami luk kowi paw aia plan lukah sum lüp khai.<verse eid="EXO 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Mosi dow sangbowk laitawm huapher pre buk mih pawah hanow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lak kowi towah khai. Nami kung kowi dow akawtlawng ün sowr pe khai, now angak khu müa aküm dow sangbowk laitawm tawkpla luk kowi towah khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Nami kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kowtowah now uaniang hown tungah khai.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Now aia dow pawitang paw taklowp taklangra te lak kowi uang pawla now uaniang ria re-e tawngphak prakowi towah khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh pawitang kowi dow chimsaima mih kawm klangiungma tow pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24-25" />Maibu towngh paw taklowp taklangra te lak kowi uang pawla now mrawkphak prakowi towah khai. Nami maibu towngh dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng CHAKRAMANG pur kowi towkah khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:24-25" /><verse number="26-27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26-27" />Aia dow kuh hown kowh thawpah mih nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara paw Lang Chimsai mih Arah kra müa uaniang uat hownia uaniang riachow kowi towah khai, now CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng nami phuchuara luk kowi dow maikhük nam iungma mih towk pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:26-27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Nami kung kowi dow taklowp taklangra te plawt kowi iang pe uaniang khai.<verse eid="EXO 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Now tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara dow taklowp taklangra te plawt re-e viadawng kowi towah khai. Nami phuchuara luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ana pek iawng tikah mih uanap hai kawmdi uanap uang ap pe khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Nami phuchuara hown taklowp taklangra te takra kowi dow tow pe biatum now nami biatum kowi nasaula rut khawk kownkow tow pe tui khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Nami biatum kowi kowh tui hown dow Mosi hai Arawn hown Arawn kowh chapauüa sau rut sau khawk reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek iawng amatni dow taklowp taklangra te lak kowi kup kown khe hai phuchuara kowi kowkowi kown khe nami biatum kowi saula rut khawk reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Phuchuara hai taklowp taklangra te ria kowi dow tapat lut uaniang hown krawi pingah hanow thawp pe viadawng khai. Nami viadawng ping kowi paw thawp pe aplawt hanow iang pe uaniang khai. Naiawng hai Mosi dow aia kowh lup chang maten churta khai bowt.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowh kraingra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Nami kung kowi dow uangnim uangah hanow taklowp taklangra te kowi uang tamum klum khai, now CHAKRAMANG kowh kraingra dow taklowp taklangra te kowi atekma uang uowi khai. <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Naiawng rakowi taklowp taklangra te lak kowi Mosi kowia kup dowi chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 40:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Nami hownia bowt now taklowp taklangra te luk kowi kowh tamum mih uangnim prowng dowi mowr dow Israeluüa katpaw cham süt dowi chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Uangnim prowng dowi mowr dow cham süt büah dowi kowi uangnim naprowng kown mih kowi chawngah büah reng chekhai. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />Tiama rawng kowi uowi mowr mih khin khe taklowp taklangra te luk kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh uangnim uang uowi mih ni-e khe Israeluüa khi reng chekhai. Iak-e paw nami uangnim dawng kowi maih uang uowi reng mih khi büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>